#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.380 ACP FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".380 ACP ammunition with a brass jacketed 95gr bullet.  Popular in pocket "
"pistols for over a century, it is often considered the weakest caliber to "
"consider carrying.  One should be careful not to chamber it in 9x18mm "
"Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .380 ACP recubierta de latón, de 95gr. Popular para pistolas de "
"bolsillo por más de un siglo, es considerada comúnmente como el calibre más "
"débil. Se debe evitar usarla en armas 9x18mm Makarov o 9x19mm."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".380 ACP JHP"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP JHP"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP JHP"
msgstr[1] ".380 ACP JHP"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.380 ACP JHP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".380 ACP ammunition with a 95gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  It is a "
"popular round for small concealable backup pistols, and often the weakest "
"recommended defensive caliber.  One should be careful not to chamber it in "
"9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .380 ACP de 95gr, con punta hueca. Es una bala popular para "
"pistolas pequeñas de respaldo, y el calibre más débil recomendado. Se debe "
"evitar usarla en armas 9x18mm Makarov o 9x19mm."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".380 ACP +P"
msgid_plural ".380 ACP +P"
msgstr[0] ".380 ACP +P"
msgstr[1] ".380 ACP +P"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.380 ACP +P'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Overpressure .380 ACP ammunition with a 90gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  "
"These defensive loadings are designed to maximize performance and tend to be"
" more accurate than practice ammo.  One should be careful not to chamber it "
"in 9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .380 ACP de sobrepresión, de 90gr con punta hueca. Estas cargas "
"defensivas han sido diseñadas para maximizar el rendimiento y tiende a ser "
"más precisa que la munición de práctica. Se debe evitar usarla en armas "
"9x18mm Makarov o 9x19mm."

