"An improvised 40x46mm buckshot load somewhat resembling M576, loaded into a "
"M118 canister.  Due to the limitations of weapons built to fire 40x46mm "
"grenades, it's much less powerful than most people would expect."
msgstr ""
"Es una carga improvisada 40x46mm de perdigones grandes que recuerda un poco "
"a M576, cargado en una carcasa M118. Debido a las limitaciones de las armas "
"construidas para disparar granadas 40x46mm, es mucho menos potente de lo que"
" se esperaría."

