#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.454 Casull'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".454 Casull ammunition with 300gr jacketed soft point bullets.  The .454 "
"Casull round is derived from .45 Long Colt with a stronger, lengthened case."
"  It is an exceptionally powerful cartridge with higher stopping power than "
"many rifle rounds, although it suffers from extreme recoil making it "
"unsuitable for most purposes."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .454 Casull recubierta de 300gr con punta suave. La bala .454 "
"Casull proviene de la .45 Long Colt con un casquillo más fuerte y alargado. "
"Es un cartucho excepcionalmente poderoso con mayor potencia de detención que"
" muchas balas de rifle, aunque sufre de retroceso extremo lo que la hace "
"inadecuada para la mayoría de las ocasiones."

