msgstr[1] ".45 Colt JHP, pólvora"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "4.6x30mm"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm"
msgstr[1] "4.6x30mm"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with 31gr copper plated steel bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge."
"  It has low recoil and excellent armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 4.6x30mm de 31gr, de acero con chapado con cobre. La bala "
"4.6x30mm fue desarrollada por H&K para competir con el cartucho 5.7x28mm de "
"FN Herstal. Tiene poco retroceso y una excelente penetración de blindaje."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm, pólvora"
msgstr[1] "4.6x30mm, pólvora"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm, black powder'}
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge."
"  It has low recoil, but no usual armor penetration due to using simple lead"
" bullets rather than proper factory-made penetrator projectiles."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 4.6x30mm de 31gr, de plomo con chapado con cobre. La bala "
"4.6x30mm fue desarrollada por H&K para competir con el cartucho 5.7x28mm de "
"FN Herstal. Tiene poco retroceso pero no tiene una penetración de blindaje "
"normal debido al uso de balas simples de plomo en lugar de los proyectiles "
"industriales de penetración."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "4.6x30mm, reloaded"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm, recargada"
msgstr[1] "4.6x30mm, recargada"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".460 Rowland HCFN"
msgid_plural ".460 Rowland HCFN"
msgstr[0] ".460 Rowland HCFN"
msgstr[1] ".460 Rowland HCFN"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.460 Rowland HCFN'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plated, hard cast flat nosed variant of the .460 Rowland round.  This "
"increases penetration slightly at the cost of reduced damage from expansion."
msgstr ""
"Es una variante de vaina cromada y dura de la bala .460 Rowland. Esto "
"incrementa la penetración pero disminuye el daño debido a la expansión."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".460 Rowland"
msgid_plural ".460 Rowland"
msgstr[0] ".460 Rowland"
msgstr[1] ".460 Rowland"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.460 Rowland'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".460 Rowland ammunition with 185gr JHP bullets.  The .460 Rowland round is "
"designed to emulate hard-hitting .44 magnum in common autoloading pistols.  "
"Like the .44, .460 Rowland has exceptional power - and recoil.  It is almost"
" dimensionally identical to .45ACP, save for having a longer case and deeper"
" seated bullets to prevent ammunition mix-ups."
msgstr ""
"Es munición .460 Rowland con balas de JHP 185gr. Esta bala está diseñada "
"para emular a la magnum .44 como pistolas de autocarga. Como la .44, la .460"
" Rowland tiene una potencia excepcional al igual que su retroceso. Es casi "
"igual en tamaño a la .45 ACP, excepto que tiene una vaina más larga y las "
"balas más al fondo para prevenir mezclar las municiones."

