#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm SS190"
msgstr[1] "5.7x28mm SS190"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '5.7x28mm SS190'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with 31gr AP FMJ bullets.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was "
"designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although "
"the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled the "
"5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be "
"reliable.  It has very low recoil and its armor penetration is a defining "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 5.7x28mm AP FMJ de 31gr. El cartucho 5.7x28mm fue diseñado por "
"FN Herstal para reemplazar la 9x19mm de uso en la OTAN. Aunque el proyecto "
"para reemplazar la 9x19mm Parabellum fue efectivamente cancelado, la bala "
"5.7x28mm ha visto acción en muchos conflictos y probado su valor. Tiene un "
"retroceso muy bajo y la penetración de blindaje es su característica "
"especial."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "5.7x28mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm, pólvora"
msgstr[1] "5.7x28mm, pólvora"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '5.7x28mm, black powder'}
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '5.7x28mm, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with 31gr AP FMJ bullets.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was "
"designed by FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although "
"the project to replace 9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled the "
"5.7x28mm round has seen action in many conflicts and has proven to be "
"reliable.  It has very low recoil but no usual armor penetration due to "
"using simple lead bullets rather than proper factory-made penetrator "
"projectiles."
msgstr ""
"Es munición 5.7x28mm AP FMJ de 31gr. El cartucho 5.7x28mm fue diseñado por "
"FN Herstal para reemplazar la 9x19mm de uso en la OTAN. Aunque el proyecto "
"para reemplazar la 9x19mm Parabellum fue efectivamente cancelado, la bala "
"5.7x28mm ha visto acción en muchos conflictos y probado su valor. Tiene un "
"retroceso muy bajo pero no tiene una penetración de blindaje normal debido "
"al uso de balas simples de plomo en lugar de los proyectiles industriales de"
" penetración."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "5.7x28mm, reloaded"
msgid_plural "5.7x28mm, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "5.7x28mm, recargada"
msgstr[1] "5.7x28mm, recargada"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "RA110 5x50mm flechette"
msgid_plural "RA110 5x50mm flechettes"
msgstr[0] "RA110 5x50mm dardos perforantes"
msgstr[1] "RA110 5x50mm dardos perforantes"

#. ~ Description for RA110 5x50mm flechette
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round "
"features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para atravesar el blindaje corporal, la bala Rivtech 5x50mm de "
"dardos perforantes se caracteriza por el sabot biodegradable y el perforante"
" estabilizado por aletas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "RA119 5x50mm penetrator"
msgid_plural "RA119 5x50mm penetrators"
msgstr[0] "RA119 5x50mm penetrante"
msgstr[1] "RA119 5x50mm penetrante"

#. ~ Description for RA119 5x50mm penetrator
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm RA119 penetrator "
"round features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized tungsten "
"alloy projectile."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para atravesar el blindaje corporal moderno, la bala Rivtech  "
"5x50mm RA119 penetrante se caracteriza por el sabot biodegradable y el "
"proyectil de aleación de tungsteno estabilizado por aletas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "5x50mm flechette, reloaded"
msgid_plural "5x50mm flechettes, reloaded"
msgstr[0] "5x50mm dardos perforantes, recargada"
msgstr[1] "5x50mm dardos perforantes, recargada"

#. ~ Description for 5x50mm flechette, reloaded
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed to defeat modern body armor, the Rivtech 5x50mm flechette round "
"features a biodegradable sabot and a single, fin-stabilized penetrator.  "
"This one has been hand-reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para atravesar el blindaje corporal, la bala Rivtech 5x50mm de "
"dardos perforantes se caracteriza por el sabot biodegradable y el perforante"
" estabilizado por aletas. Esta ha sido recargada a mano."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "M74 rocket"
msgid_plural "M74 rockets"
msgstr[0] "misil M74"
msgstr[1] "misiles M74"

#. ~ Description for M74 rocket
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"66mm incendiary rockets used in the M202 FLASH rocket launcher.  Their "
"warheads are filled with a thickened pyrophoric agent, which burns at 2200 "
"degrees Fahrenheit."
msgstr ""
"Misiles 66mm incendiarios utilizados en el lanzamisiles M202 FLASH. Sus "
"ojivas están cargadas de agente pirofórico espeso que arde a 1200ºC."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "66mm HEAT"
msgid_plural "66mm HEAT"
msgstr[0] "66mm HEAT"
msgstr[1] "66mm HEAT"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '66mm HEAT'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 66mm high-explosive anti-tank round.  It could blow through up to two feet"
" of concrete."
msgstr ""
"Es una bala de 66mm anti-tanque de alta explosividad. Su explosión puede "
"atravesar hasta 60 centímetros de concreto."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".700 NX"
msgid_plural ".700 NX"
msgstr[0] ".700 NX"
msgstr[1] ".700 NX"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.700 NX'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The .700 Nitro Express is a very powerful rifle round designed for long-"
"range use.  Its stupendous accuracy and armor piercing capabilities make it "
"one of the most deadly rounds available, offset only by its drastic recoil "
"and noise."
msgstr ""
"El .700 Nitro Express es una bala de rifle muy poderosa, diseñada para largo"
" alcance. Posee una estupenda precisión y penetración de blindaje, que la "
"convierten en una de las balas más letales. Sus desventajas son el tremendo "
"retroceso y su ruido."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".700 NX, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".700 NX, reloaded"
msgstr[0] ".700 NX, recargada"
msgstr[1] ".700 NX, recargada"

