msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle, AP (pólvora)"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "foreign rifle ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "foreign rifle ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle extranjero, bola"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle extranjero, bola"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'foreign rifle ammo, ball'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Foreign rifle ammo brought by the Exodii, and very common amongst them."
msgstr ""
"Es munición para un rifle extranjero traído por los Exodii y muy común entre"
" ellos."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "railgun rifle ammo"
msgid_plural "railgun rifle ammo"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle de riel"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle de riel"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'railgun rifle ammo'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Projectile used for a railgun.  It's made of a ferromagnetic metal, probably"
" cobalt."
msgstr ""
"Es un proyectil usado por un cañón de riel. Está hecho de metal "
"ferromagnético, por lo general cobalto."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, ball"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle grande, bola"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle grande, bola"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'huge rifle ammo, ball'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and "
"big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other "
"materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  'Ball' is an old term for full "
"metal jacketed bullets which offer reduced fouling, better reliability, and "
"slightly improved penetration compared to plain lead."
msgstr ""
"La munición para rifle grande como esta es el puente entre los cañones "
"ligeros y los rifles de caza mayor. Es adecuada contra vehículos ligeros y "
"otro equipamiento bélico, o para cazar animales muy grandes. \"Bola\" es un "
"término antiguo para las balas full metal jacket, que generan menor "
"suciedad, mejor fiabilidad y una penetración levemente mejorada en "
"comparación al simple plomo."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, AP"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle grande, AP"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle grande, AP"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'huge rifle ammo, AP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge rifle ammunition like this bridges the gap between light cannons and "
"big game rifles.  It's suitable for taking on light vehicles and other "
"materiel, or hunting extremely large game.  These armor piercing munitions "
"feature tungsten steel penetrators for use against light-skinned vehicles."
msgstr ""
"La munición para rifle grande como esta es el puente entre los cañones "
"ligeros y los rifles de caza mayor. Es adecuada contra vehículos ligeros y "
"otro equipamiento bélico, o para cazar animales muy grandes. Esta munición "
"de penetración de armadura posee perforantes de acero de tungsteno útiles "
"contra vehículos ligeros."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "huge rifle ammo, ball (reloaded)"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, ball (reloaded)"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle grande, bola (recargada)"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle grande, bola (recargadas)"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "huge rifle ammo, AP (reloaded)"
msgid_plural "huge rifle ammo, AP (reloaded)"
msgstr[0] "munición de rifle grande, AP (recargada)"
msgstr[1] "municiones de rifle grande, AP (recargadas)"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "rocket, antipersonnel"
msgid_plural "rocket, antipersonnel"
msgstr[0] "misil, antipersonal"
msgstr[1] "misiles, antipersonal"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rocket, antipersonnel'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large anti-personnel rocket for a military rocket launcher.  Designed to "
"be highly effective against personnel."
msgstr ""
"Es un misil grande antipersonal para usar en un lanzamisiles militar. "
"Diseñado para ser de gran eficacia contra las personas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "rocket, multipurpose"
msgid_plural "rocket, multipurpose"
msgstr[0] "misil, multipropósito"
msgstr[1] "misiles, multipropósito"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rocket, multipurpose'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An anti-tank rocket with a high explosive dual purpose warhead for a "
"military rocket launcher.  Designed to be highly effective against vehicles "
"and structures, and retains some effectiveness against personnel."
msgstr ""
"Es un misil antitanque con cabeza explosiva de doble propósito para usar en "
"un lanzamisiles militar. Diseñado para ser altamente efectivo contra "
"vehículos y estructuras, aunque tiene alguna efectividad contra personas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "rocket, smoke"
msgid_plural "rocket, smoke"
msgstr[0] "misil, humo"
msgstr[1] "misiles, humo"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rocket, smoke'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rocket loaded with a smoke warhead for a military rocket launcher.  "
"Commonly used for signaling, target designation, and for screening troop "
"movements."
msgstr ""
"Es un misil cargado con una cabeza explosiva de humo, para usar en un "
"lanzamisiles militar. Generalmente se utiliza para señalizar, marcar un "
"objetivo, y para ocultar los movimientos de las tropas."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, buckshot"
msgid_plural "shotshell, buckshot"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, perdigones grandes"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, perdigones grandes"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, beanbag"
msgid_plural "shotshell, beanbag"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, no letal"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, no letal"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, birdshot"
msgid_plural "shotshell, birdshot"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, perdigones pequeños"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, perdigones pequeños"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'shotshell, birdshot'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shotshell filled with numerous small pellets.  Designed for hunting birds "
"and other small game, its applications in combat are very limited."
msgstr ""
"Es un cartucho lleno de pequeños perdigones. Diseñado para cazar pájaros u "
"otros pequeños animales. Su funcionalidad en combate es bastante pobre."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, slug"
msgid_plural "shotshell, slug"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, posta"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, posta"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'shotshell, slug'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shotshell with a single projectile, shaped somewhat like a shuttlecock.  "
"Slugs are used with shotguns to give them extra range, allowing them to "
"stand in for a rifle.  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Es un cartucho de escopeta de un solo proyectil, con una forma parecida a la"
" pluma del bádminton. Las postas se utilizan en las escopetas para otorgar "
"mayor alcance, similar al de un rifle. Causan muchísimo daño pero son poco "
"precisos."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, pyrotechnical"
msgid_plural "shotshell, pyrotechnical"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, pirotecnia"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, pirotecnia"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'shotshell, pyrotechnical'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A novelty shotgun shell filled with a simple pyrotechnical charge.  The "
"payload is light and won't wound very well, but the flash and sparks will "
"certainly be impressive, in addition to being an extreme fire hazard."
msgstr ""
"Es un innovador cartucho de escopeta con una carga pirotécnica. La carga es "
"ligera y no causará heridas, pero el destello y las chispas pueden ser "
"impresionantes, además de tener el riesgo de incendiar."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, explosive"
msgid_plural "shotshell, explosive"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, explosivo"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, explosivo"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "shotshell, junk"
msgid_plural "shotshell, junk"
msgstr[0] "cartucho, chatarra"
msgstr[1] "cartuchos, chatarra"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
