"A t-shirt with a picture of the Tux mascot on it.  Underneath it says \"You "
"wouldn't buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el dibujo de la mascota Tux. Abajo dice \"Nunca comprarías"
" un auto con el capó soldado.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with a picture of Tux, the Linux mascot!  It says \"You wouldn't "
"buy a car with the hood welded shut.\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el dibujo de Tux, la mascota de Linux. Dice \"No deberías "
"comprar un auto con el capó soldado.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Ubuntu is a South"
" African word for 'I can't configure Debian'\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Ubuntu, y abajo dice \"Ubuntu es una palabra "
"sudafricana que significa 'No puedo configurar Debian'.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Arch Linux logo on it, underneath it says \"Keep it "
"Simple Stupid\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Arch Linux, y abajo dice \"Mentenelo simple "
"estúpido.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Ubuntu logo on it, underneath it says \"Linux for human "
"beings\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Ubuntu, y abajo dice \"Linux para seres "
"humanos.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Linux Mint logo on it, underneath it says \"From freedom "
"came elegance\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Linux Mint, y abajo dice \"De la libertad vino "
"la elegancia.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Fedora logo on it, underneath it says \"Freedom.  "
"Friends.  Features.  First.\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Fedora, y abajo dice \"Libertad. Amigos. "
"Funciones. Primero.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with Red Hat's logo on it, underneath it says \"The World's Open "
"Source Leader\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Red Hat, y abajo dice \"El líder mundial en "
"código abierto.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the Debian logo on it, underneath it says \"The Universal "
"Operating System\""
msgstr ""
"Es una remera con el logo de Debian, y abajo dice \"El sistema operativo "
"universal.\""

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
