msgid_plural "newspaper pages"
msgstr[0] "página de diario"
msgstr[1] "páginas de diario"

#. ~ Description for newspaper page
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It is possibly one of the last "
"issues printed before New England was overwhelmed.  Most of the information "
"on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye"
" briefly."
msgstr ""
"Es una hoja sola de un diario de gran tamaño. Posiblemente sea una de las "
"últimas noticias impresas antes de que New England fuera invadida. La "
"mayoría de la información que contiene es terriblemente trivial o vieja, "
"pero uno cosa capta tu atención por un instante."

#. ~ Description for newspaper page
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from several years"
" ago, and you've NO idea how it lasted this long.  Most of the information "
"on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye"
" briefly."
msgstr ""
"Es una hoja sola de un diario de gran tamaño. Parece ser de hace unos años y"
" no tenés NI idea de cómo llegó entera hasta hoy. La mayoría de la "
"información que contiene es terriblemente trivial o vieja, pero uno cosa "
"capta tu atención por un instante."

#. ~ Description for newspaper page
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from a few years "
"ago--amazing it has lasted this long.  Most of the information on there is "
"terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"Es una hoja sola de un diario de gran tamaño. Parece ser de hace unos años, "
"increíble que haya aguantado entera. La mayoría de la información que "
"contiene es terriblemente trivial o vieja, pero uno cosa capta tu atención "
"por un instante."

#. ~ Description for newspaper page
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
