msgstr[1] "Irradiantes rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken Irradiant
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The irreparably broken remains of an Irradiant weapons platform.  Its "
"mounted plasma cannon self-destructed when the robot was rendered "
"inoperable, but its remains could still be disassembled for some valuable "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Son los restos irreparables de una plataforma de armas Irradiantes. Su cañón"
" de plasma montado se autodestruyó cuando el robot fue dejado inoperable, "
"pero sus restos pueden ser desarmados para conseguir partes valiosas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken Isohypsa"
msgid_plural "broken Isohypsa"
msgstr[0] "Isohypsa roto"
msgstr[1] "Isohypsas rotos "

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'broken Isohypsa'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The broken shell of an Isohypsa drone coordinator.  Most of its sensors and "
"AI units are charred beyond any repair."
msgstr ""
"Es la carcasa rota de un coordinador de drones Isohypsa. La mayoría de sus "
"sensores y unidades de IA están quemados y no pueden repararse."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
