msgid ""
"This ritual creates a small pebble attuned to Stormshapers.  You can use the"
" rune as a catalyst for recipes."
msgstr ""
"Este ritual crea una pequeña piedra alineada a los Tormentaformantes. Podés "
"usar la runa como catalizador en recetas."

