"que los Kelvinista canalicen magia en sus creaciones."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Stormshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "runa Tormentaformante"
msgstr[1] "runas Tormentaformante"

#. ~ Description for Stormshaper rune
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of lightning and storm clouds on it.  It"
" is necessary for Stormshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Esta piedra mágica tiene la insignia de rayos y nubes de tormenta. Es "
"necesaria para que los Tormentaformantes canalicen magia en sus creaciones."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Druid rune"
msgid_plural "Druid runes"
msgstr[0] "runa Druida"
msgstr[1] "runas Druida"

#. ~ Description for Druid rune
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of nature and trees on it.  It is "
"necessary for Druids to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Esta piedra mágica tiene la insignia de naturaleza y árboles. Es necesaria "
"para que los Druidas canalicen magia en sus creaciones."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Animist rune"
msgid_plural "Animist runes"
msgstr[0] "runa Animista"
msgstr[1] "runas Animista"

#. ~ Description for Animist rune
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of summoners on it.  It is necessary for"
" Animists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr ""
"Esta piedra mágica tiene la insignia de conjuradores. Es necesaria para que "
"los Animistas canalicen magia en sus creaciones."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "alchemist rune"
msgid_plural "alchemist runes"
msgstr[0] "runa alquimista"
msgstr[1] "runas alquimistas"

#. ~ Description for alchemist rune
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of alchemy and potions on it.  While "
"versatile in use, the lack of attunement to any school prevents creation of "
"more advanced recipes."
msgstr ""
"Esta piedra mágica tiene la insignia de alquimia y pociones. Aunque es "
"versátil, la falta de alineación con alguna escuela limita la creación de "
"recetas más avanzadas."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "heat cube"
msgid_plural "heat cubes"
msgstr[0] "cubo de calor"
msgstr[1] "cubos de calor"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for heat cube.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Activate torch mode"
msgstr "Activar modo antorcha"

#. ~ Use action msg for heat cube.
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You push the torch button and the cube emits a large flame from the top, one"
" that does radiate heat, but won't burn anything."
msgstr ""
"Apretás el botón antorcha y el cubo emite una gran llama desde su parte "
"superior, irradia calor pero no va a quemar nada."

#. ~ Description for heat cube
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A smooth steel cube the size of your fist.  Several buttons on the sides "
"activate the powers of the cube."
msgstr ""
"Es un cubo suave de acero del tamaño de tu mano. Tiene varios botones a los "
"costados que sirven para activar poderes del cubo."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "heat cube (torch on)"
msgid_plural "heat cubes (torch on)"
msgstr[0] "cubo de calor (antorcha encendida)"
msgstr[1] "cubos de calor (antorcha encendida)"

#. ~ Use action msg for heat cube (torch on).
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "The torch flame is extinguished."
msgstr "La llama de antorcha se extinguió."

#. ~ Description for heat cube (torch on)
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The heat cube in the torch configuration, where it emits warmth and a bright"
" flame that does not burn."
msgstr ""
"El cubo de calor está en su configuración de antorcha, con lo que emite un "
"calorcito y una llama brillante que no quema."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "skeleton key of opening"
msgid_plural "skeleton keys of opening"
msgstr[0] "llave esquelética de apertura"
msgstr[1] "llaves esqueléticas de apertura"

#. ~ Description for skeleton key of opening
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small gold skeleton key.  You can activate it to unlock locked things."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña llave esquelética de oro. Podés activarla para abrir cosas "
"cerradas."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "everburning torch"
msgid_plural "everburning torches"
msgstr[0] "antorcha eterna"
msgstr[1] "antorchas eternas"

#. ~ Description for everburning torch
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a high quality engraved wooden torch.  On command, the tip bursts "
"into flame and produces a fair amount of light.  It will burn forever."
msgstr ""
"Es una antorcha de madera grabada de alta calidad. Cuando quieras, la punta "
"arderá y producirá una cantidad considerable de luz. Y arderá por siempre."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "enchanted tailor's kit"
msgid_plural "enchanted tailor's kits"
msgstr[0] "equipo encantado de sastre"
msgstr[1] "equipos encantados de sastre"

#. ~ Description for enchanted tailor's kit
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a high quality, engraved steel kit with a variety of needles, some "
"plastic spools for thread, some small scissors, even a small heating element"
" for melting and joining plastic.  Use a tailor's kit to customize your "
"clothing and armor.  This uses your tailoring skill.  It also contains one "
"of those magic spiders that constantly, if slowly, makes new thread."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo de muy buena calidad de acera grabado, con una variedad de "
"agujas, algunos carreteles de hilo, pequeñas tijeras de plástico, incluso "
"una resistencia térmica chica para fundir plástico. Podés usar el equipo de "
"sastre para personalizar tu ropa y armadura. Con esto estás usando tu "
"habilidad Sastrería. También contiene una de esas arañas mágicas que están "
"constantemente y lentamente creando hilo."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "spider box"
msgid_plural "spider boxes"
msgstr[0] "cajas de araña"
msgstr[1] "cajas de araña"

#. ~ Description for spider box
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a small glass box that contains a spider that diligently works day "
"and night to produce silk thread that it stores in a reservoir you can open "
"and retrieve it from."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña caja de vidrio que contiene una araña trabajando "
"diligentemente día y noche para producir hilo de seda que va guardando en un"
" lugar, al que podés acceder para usarlo."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Magic Wand"
msgid_plural "Magic Wands"
msgstr[0] "Vara Mágica"
msgstr[1] "Varas Mágicas"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "Disposable Wand"
msgid_plural "Disposable Wands"
msgstr[0] "Vara Descartable"
msgstr[1] "Varas Descartables"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "minor wand of magic missile"
msgid_plural "minor wands of magic missile"
msgstr[0] "vara menor de misil mágico"
msgstr[1] "varas menores de misil mágico"

#. ~ Description for minor wand of magic missile
#. ~ Description for lesser wand of magic missile
#. ~ Description for greater wand of magic missile
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slender wooden wand with a mana crystal socket at the base that casts a "
"spell when activated.  This wand casts magic missile."
msgstr ""
"Es una vara fina de madera con un cristal de maná en la base que puede "
"conjurar un hechizo cuando se lo activa. Esta vara puede lanzar el hechizo "
"misil mágico."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "lesser wand of magic missile"
msgid_plural "lesser wands of magic missile"
msgstr[0] "vara inferior de misil mágico"
msgstr[1] "varas inferiores de misil mágico"

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "greater wand of magic missile"
msgid_plural "greater wands of magic missile"
msgstr[0] "vara mayor de misil mágico"
msgstr[1] "varas mayores de misil mágico"

