msgid ""
"You can see the connections from A to B to C to D.  You look at fellow "
"survivors like you are imagining taking them apart.  Intelligence + 5"
msgstr ""
"Podés ver las conexiones entre A y B y C y D. Ves a tus compañeros "
"sobrevivientes como si los imaginaras desarmándolos. Inteligencia +5."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Reactions"
msgstr "Reacciones Mejoradas"

#. ~ Description for Enhanced Reactions
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Today is the day to start juggling.  Dexterity + 1"
msgstr "Hoy es el día para empezar a hacer malabares. Destreza +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Quickening"
msgstr "Aceleración"

#. ~ Description for Quickening
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are starting to move like they do.  Dexterity + 2"
msgstr "Te empezaste a mover como lo hacen ellos. Destreza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Otherworldly Grace"
msgstr "Gracia Sobrenatural"

#. ~ Description for Otherworldly Grace
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You no longer move like a human, others find it disconcerting.  Dexterity + "
"4"
msgstr ""
"Ya no te movés como un humano, a los otros los desconcertás. Destreza +4."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "New Muscles"
msgstr "Músculos Nuevos"

#. ~ Description for New Muscles
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You see some new muscles that you aren't sure you've seen on humans before."
"  Strength + 1"
msgstr ""
"Ves algunos músculos nuevos que no estás seguro haber visto antes en "
"humanos. Fuerza +1."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Muscle Fiber"
msgstr "Fibra Muscular"

#. ~ Description for Muscle Fiber
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fibrous tissue seems to be spreading through your body.  Strength + 2"
msgstr ""
"El tejido fibroso parece estar esparciéndose por tu cuerpo. Fuerza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mi-go Ears"
msgstr "Orejas Mi-go"

#. ~ Description for Mi-go Ears
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your ears have split into a series of tuberous projections.  They waggle "
"towards far away sounds."
msgstr ""
"Tus orejas se han dividido en varias series de proyecciones tuberosos. Se "
"menea hacia los sonidos lejanos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Detachment"
msgstr "Indiferencia"

#. ~ Description for Detachment
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When were you ever like these creatures, helpless before the changes "
"ravaging this world."
msgstr ""
"Cuándo fuiste como estas criaturas, indefensas ante los cambios devastadores"
" de este mundo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Eldritch"
msgstr "Sobrenatural"

#. ~ Description for Eldritch
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a sinister aspect to your demeanor, no longer part of this world.  "
"You feel no sorrow at the deaths of humans and your brain now processes "
"combat skills more efficiently as you mentally dissect your opponents."
msgstr ""
"Tenes el aspecto siniestro de tu comportamiento, ya ajeno a este mundo. No "
"sentís pena por las muertes de los humanos y tu cerebro ahora procesa "
"habilidades de combate más eficientes mientras diseccionás mentalmente a tus"
" oponentes."

#. ~ Description for YUGGOTH
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "This death throes of this world are the birthing pangs of yours."
msgstr ""
"Estas agonías de muerte de este mundo son las contracciones de nacimiento "
"del tuyo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fetid scent"
msgstr "Aroma Fétido"

#. ~ Description for Fetid scent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your sweat now smells otherworldly, and not in a good way.  The mi-go still "
"hate you but at least they aren't offended by your smell."
msgstr ""
"Tu transpiración ahora tiene un olor sobrenatural, y no de buena manera. Los"
" mi-go te siguen odiando pero por lo menos no están ofendidos por tu olor."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Eerie"
msgstr "Escalofriante"

#. ~ Description for Eerie
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are off-putting to others.  Your mannerisms have changed as if human "
"interaction is becoming foreign."
msgstr ""
"Sos repulsivo para los demás. Tus maneras han cambiado como si la "
"interacción humana se te hubiera hecho desconocida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mi-go Wings"
msgstr "Alas Mi-go"

#. ~ Description for Mi-go Wings
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, veiny wings.  They don't appear to be made for "
"this atmosphere but they grant a powerful buffeting attack."
msgstr ""
"Tenés un par de alas grandes y venosas. No parecen estar hechas para esta "
"atmósfera pero te permiten un poderoso cacheteo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You buffet %s with your wings"
msgstr "Cacheteás al %s con tus alas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s buffets %2$s with their wings"
msgstr "%1$s cachetea al %2$s con sus alas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mi-go breathe"
msgstr "Respiración Mi-go"

#. ~ Description for Mi-go breathe
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You can now breathe the gasses the mi-go thrive in."
msgstr ""
"Ahora podés respirar los gases en los cuales se desarrollan los mi-go."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Uplifted"
msgstr "Elevación"

#. ~ Description for Uplifted
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You come from uplifted animal stock.  This decreases morale penalties for "
"being wet."
msgstr ""
"Has salido elevado del ganado. Esto hace que sea menor la penalidad a la "
"moral por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hauler"
msgstr "Acarreador/a"

#. ~ Description for Hauler
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength "
"could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 60%."
msgstr ""
"Sos capaz de cargar mucho más que una persona con fuerza similar. Tu máxima "
"carga posible está incrementada en un 60%."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Patched Fur"
msgstr "Parches de Piel"

#. ~ Description for Patched Fur
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin has patches of light fur.  This has no impact on your life except "
"marking you as not fully human."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel tiene pedazos de pelaje tenue. Esto no tiene impacto en tu vida "
"excepto marcarte como no completamente humano."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Crushing Feet"
msgstr "Pies Destrozadores"

#. ~ Description for Crushing Feet
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your feet have grown massive and ready to support huge weight.  This allows "
"kicking attacks to do much more damage, provides natural armor, and removes "
"the need to wear shoes; however, you cannot wear normal size shoes.  Reduces"
" wet effects."
msgstr ""
"Tus pies han crecido enormemente y están preparados para aguantar un peso "
"enorme. Esto te permite pegar patadas para hacer mucho daño, te brinda "
"armadura natural, y te quita la necesidad de usar calzado. Sin embargo, no "
"vas a poder usar calzado de tamaño normal. Disminuye los efectos de estar "
"mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You kick %s with your massive feet"
msgstr "Pateás al %s con tus enormes pies"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s kicks %2$s with their massive feet"
msgstr "%1$s patea al %2$s con sus enormes pies"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Face Bumps"
msgstr "Protuberancias Faciales"

#. ~ Description for Face Bumps
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of bumps on your face above your mouth and beside your nose."
msgstr ""
"Tenés un par de protuberancias en tu cara sobre tu boca y a los costados de "
"tu nariz."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tusks"
msgstr "Colmillos Largos"

#. ~ Description for Tusks
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of small tusks on your face.  They allow you to make a weak "
"piercing goring attack."
msgstr ""
"Tenés un par de pequeños colmillos como los de un elefante en la cara. Te "
"permiten causar un poco de daño punzante corneando."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You gore %s with your tusks"
msgstr "Destripás al %s con tus colmillos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s gores %2$s with their tusks"
msgstr "%1$s destripa al %2$s con sus colmillos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pointed Tusks"
msgstr "Colmillos Puntiagudos"

#. ~ Description for Pointed Tusks
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, pointed tusks, like someone weaponized an elephant."
"  They allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent "
"wearing mouthgear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr ""
"Tenés un par de colmillos largos y puntiagudos, como los de un elefante. Te "
"permiten causar mucho daño punzante con tus cabezazos, pero te impiden "
"utilizar equipamiento en la boca que no sea de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You stab %s with your pointed tusks"
msgstr "Apuñalás al %s con tus colmillos puntiagudos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their pointed tusks"
msgstr "%1$s apuñala al %2$s con sus colmillos puntiagudos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Elephant Trunk"
msgstr "Trompa de Elefante"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Elephant Trunk'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face resembles that of an elephant, with a significant trunk.  It looks"
" fierce but prevents wearing mouthgear.  Prehensile and able to perform some"
" fine detail work."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara parece la de un elefante, con la significativa trompa. Parece "
"temible pero te impide usar equipamiento en la boca. Es prensil y capaz de "
"hacer algún trabajo fino."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Three Fingered"
msgstr "Tres Dedos"

#. ~ Description for Three Fingered
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hands have fused into three fingered paws.  Fine manipulation is a "
"challenge: permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate "
"craftwork, and your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better."
msgstr ""
"Tus manos se han fusionado en patas de tres dedos. Se te complica la "
"motricidad fina: tenés una incomodidad de 10 permanente en las manos, es "
"difícil la fabricación de cosas delicadas, y no entran los guantes. Pero se "
"manejan mejor en el agua."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Trumpeting Voice"
msgstr "Voz de Trompeta"

#. ~ Description for Trumpeting Voice
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a trumpeting, elephantine voice.  Threatening NPCs will be easier, "
"but lying will be very hard."
msgstr ""
"Tenés una voz de trompeta como un elefante. Te resulta más fácil amenazar a "
"los PNJ pero es muy difícil mentirles."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Brutal Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza Brutal"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Brutal Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Genetic tampering made your body incredibly strong.  Strength + 7."
msgstr ""
"La manipulación genética hizo tu cuerpo increíblemente fuerte. Fuerza +7."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cryoadaptation"
msgstr "Crioadaptación"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cryoadaptation'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An experimental cryosleep procedure has permanently altered your body, "
"allowing you to better tolerate cold temperatures."
msgstr ""
"Un procedimiento experimental de criosueño ha alterado permanentemente tu "
"cuerpo, permitiéndote tolerar mejor las temperaturas frías."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Alpine Conditioning"
msgstr "Condición Alpina"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alpine Conditioning'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Time spent in high altitudes and low temperatures have adapted you to them, "
"and you're slightly better at resisting the cold."
msgstr ""
"El tiempo pasado en las alturas y bajas temperaturas te han adaptado a "
"ellas, y sos un poco mejor resistiendo el frío."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Brutal Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Genetic defects have made your body incredibly strong.  Strength + 7."
msgstr ""
"Los defectos genéticos hicieron tu cuerpo increíblemente fuerte. Fuerza +7."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Leathered Feet"
msgstr "Pie Áspero"

#. ~ Description for Leathered Feet
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The bottoms of your feet are tough like an animals.  You receive no movement"
" penalty for not wearing shoes."
msgstr ""
"Las plantas de tus pies son resistentes como las de los animales. Si no usás"
" nada en los pies, no se te aplica ninguna penalidad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Skinfolds"
msgstr "Pliegues Cutáneos"

#. ~ Description for Skinfolds
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is tough.  Cutting damage is slightly reduced for you.  Slightly "
"decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel es resistente. El daño cortante es reducido levemente. También "
"reduce las penalidades por estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Weak Joints"
msgstr "Articulaciones Frágiles"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak Joints'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common flaw in your genemod, brought on by increased muscle mass and bone "
"density.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr ""
"Es un defecto común en tu modificación genética, causado al incrementar la "
"masa muscular y la densidad ósea. Atravesar terreno duro te hace más lento, "
"más que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Herbivorous Ancestry"
msgstr "Linaje Herbívoro"

#. ~ Description for Strong Scent
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your scent is particularly strong.  It's vaguely offensive to humans, and "
"animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr ""
"Tu olor es particularmente fuerte. Es un poco ofensivo para los humanos, y "
"los animales que te rastrean por tu olor lo harán más fácilmente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Giant Step"
msgstr "Paso Gigante"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow and Steady"
msgstr "Lento y Firme"

#. ~ Description for Slow and Steady
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can't move as fast as most, resulting in a 10% speed penalty on flat "
"ground."
msgstr ""
"No te podés mover tan rápido como los demás. Tenés una penalidad de 10% en "
"suelo plano."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Short Fur Coat"
msgstr "Cobertura Corta de Piel"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Short Fur Coat'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Short fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing slight protection "
"from cold."
msgstr ""
"Un pelaje corto ha crecido y cubre tu cuerpo entero, lo que te brinda una "
"pequeña protección contra el frío."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Furry'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick brown fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing a slight "
"protection against attacks, and some protection from cold."
msgstr ""
"Te ha crecido pelo marrón y grueso que cubre todo tu cuerpo, lo que te "
"brinda una leve protección contra los ataques, y algo de protección contra "
"el frío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Immovable"
msgstr "Inamovible"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Unstoppable"
msgstr "Imparable"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Meatshield"
msgstr "Escudo de Carne"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Elephantine"
msgstr "Elefantino"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Freakishly Gigantic"
msgstr "Peculiarmente Gigantesco/a"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gigantic"
msgstr "Gigantesco/a"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Terrible Odor"
msgstr "Olor Terrible"

#. ~ Description for Terrible Odor
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You smell exactly like a shaggy elephant would, assuming it sweated, which "
"you do.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and humans "
"will react poorly."
msgstr ""
"Tenés el mismo olor que tendría un elefante desprolijo, si es que "
"transpirara, cosa que vos hacés. Los monstruos que te rastrean por tu olor "
"te van a encontrar fácilmente, y los humanos no te van a querer cerca."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Constant Eater"
msgstr "Comensal Constante"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Large Diet"
msgstr "Dieta Grande"

#. ~ Description for Large Diet
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You require more food than others but your ability to go the distance in "
"both combat and athleticism is expanded."
msgstr ""
"Necesitás más comida que los demás pero tu habilidad de resistencia está "
"expandida tanto en combate como atléticamente."

#. ~ Description for High Thirst
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body needs more water than usual to flush the denser waste products."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo necesita más agua que lo normal para depurar los desechos más "
"densos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Giant Thirst"
msgstr "Sed Gigantesca"

#. ~ Description for Ponderous
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your weight must be delicately placed lest the ground give way.  You move "
"10% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tu peso debe ser delicadamente puesto cuando el suelo te de espacio. Te "
"movés un 10% más lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Very Deliberate"
msgstr "Muy Deliberado"

#. ~ Description for Very Deliberate
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "Your muscles are quite slow to move.  You move 25% slower."
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos son bastante lentos en sus movimientos. Te movés un 25% más "
"lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Whately Story"
msgstr "Historia de los Whately"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sadie Story"
msgstr "Historia de Sadie"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Melee Training"
msgstr "Entrenamiento CRIT Armas Cuerpo a Cuerpo"

#. ~ Description for CRIT Melee Training
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have received CQB training.  For every hit you land, gain themed combat "
"bonuses."
msgstr ""
"Recibiste entrenamiento en combate en espacios cerrados. Por cada golpe que "
"das, ganás bonus de combate."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shadow Meld"
msgstr "Unión Sombría"

#. ~ Description for Shadow Meld
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The light around you bends strangely, making it harder for enemies to notice"
" you."
msgstr ""
"La luz a tu alrededor se dobla extrañamente, haciendo más difícil que te "
"vean tus enemigos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Moon-lit Grace"
msgstr "Gracia Luz de Luna"

#. ~ Description for Moon-lit Grace
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Aside from your appearances, your movements are incredibly graceful and "
"allow you to seemingly glide through every task."
msgstr ""
"Más allá de tu apariencia, tus movimientos son increíblemente ágiles y te "
"permiten deslizarte entre las tareas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Red Iris"
msgstr "Iris Rojo"

#. ~ Description for Red Iris
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You eyes are a pleasant shade of hypnotic scarlet.  People feel mildly "
"persuaded by you."
msgstr ""
"Tus ojos son de un tono placentero de escarlata hipnótico. La gente se "
"siente un poco persuadida por vos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Night Walker"
msgstr "Caminante Nocturno"

#. ~ Description for Night Walker
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Emerge from the grave of the old world, and become the night once again."
msgstr ""
"Emerge de la tumba del viejo mundo, y conviértete en la noche una vez más."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Forest Guardian"
msgstr "Guardián del Bosque"

#. ~ Description for Forest Guardian
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The forests have longed for your help, and this last cry shook the world."
msgstr ""
"Los bosques han necesitado siempre tu ayuda y este último grito ha sacudido "
"al mundo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Nature's Boon"
msgstr "Bendición Natural"

#. ~ Description for Nature's Boon
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your very presence is masked by nature itself.  You are slightly harder to "
"detect."
msgstr ""
"Tu sola presencia está enmascarada por la misma naturaleza. Sos un poco más "
"difícil de detectar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slashers"
msgstr "Cortadores"

#. ~ Description for Slashers
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your torso has an extra set of appendages that have burst out of your back, "
"they are tipped with massive bone blades at the end, and look like they can "
"do some serious damage with the thick acid that they secrete."
msgstr ""
"Tu torso tiene unos apéndices extras que te han salido de la espalda, tiene "
"unas enormes cuchillas de hueso en la punta y parece que pueden causar un "
"daño serio con el ácido espeso que segregan."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your blades"
msgstr "Rasgás al %s con tus cuchillas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their blades"
msgstr "%1$s rasga al %2$s con sus cuchillas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Spurs"
msgstr "Espuelas"

#. ~ Description for Spurs
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Spurs of bone have erupted all across your arms.  A thick, biological "
"secretion oozes out of them promising extra harm to enemies."
msgstr ""
"Te han salido en los brazos unas espuelas de hueso. Una secreción espesa y "
"biológica chorrea de ellas causando un daño extra a los enemigos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You ravage %s with your arms"
msgstr "Arrasás al %s con tus brazos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s ravages %2$s with their arm spurs"
msgstr "%1$s arrasa al %2$s con las espuelas de sus brazos"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Persistent Body"
msgstr "Cuerpo Persistente"

#. ~ Description for Persistent Body
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"As you move, the world seems to breath life and energy into your limbs.  You"
" simply rarely tire less readily than others.  Your maximum stamina is 50% "
"higher than usual."
msgstr ""
"Mientras te movés, el mundo parece respirar vida y energía en tus "
"extremidades. Raramente te cansás más que los otros. Tu resistencia máxima "
"está incrementada un 50% más de lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "RP: Combatant"
msgstr "RP: Combatiente"

#. ~ Description for RP: Combatant
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've seen your fair share of scruffs and scrapes, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit, you fought the Occupiers and managed to survive to tell the tale.  Has "
"no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a fighter to "
"certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""
"Ya habías visto las suficientes raspaduras y rasguños, y cuando sucedió el "
"Cataclismo peleaste contra los Ocupantes y lograste sobrevivir para "
"contarlo. No tiene efecto directo con ninguna habilidad pero te permite "
"presentarte como un luchador frente a ciertos PNJ. Algunos incluso pueden "
"reconocerte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "RP: Medic"
msgstr "RP: Médico/a"

#. ~ Description for RP: Medic
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your job or experiences had you seeing all sorts of trauma, both physical "
"and mental, and you were trusted during the Cataclysm to provide life-saving"
" care.  Has no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a"
" healer to certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo y experiencia te hizo conocer toda clase de traumas, tanto "
"físicos como mentales, y durante el Cataclismo te confiaron el trabajo de "
"cuidar la salud de los demás. No tiene efecto directo con ninguna habilidad "
"pero te permite presentarte como un curador frente a ciertos PNJ. Algunos "
"incluso pueden reconocerte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "RP: Leader"
msgstr "RP: Líder"

#. ~ Description for RP: Leader
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Whether or not you like it, you've always had a knack for managing people "
"and have some hard-won skill in doing so.  During the arrival and the "
"ensuing chaos, you helped lead people around you to safety.  Has no direct "
"skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a leader to certain "
"NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""
"Te guste o no, siempre tuviste la habilidad de manejar a la gente y tenés "
"experiencia bien ganada haciéndolo. Durante la llegada y el caos resultante,"
" ayudaste a liderar a la gente de manera segura. No tiene efecto directo con"
" ninguna habilidad pero te permite presentarte como un líder frente a "
"ciertos PNJ. Algunos incluso pueden reconocerte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tyrano Sapien"
msgstr "Tyrano Sapien"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tyrano Sapien'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thunder lizard, dragon, tyrant.  All these names pale before your majesty."
msgstr ""
"Lagarto de trueno, dragón, tirano. Todos esos nombres palidecen frente a su "
"majestad."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stego'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Slow, methodical, heavily armored.  A walking tank."
msgstr "Lento, metódico, con mucha armadura. Un tanque con patas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tough-Skinned"
msgstr "Piel Resistente"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tough-Skinned'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is getting tougher.  Cutting and bash damage are more reduced for "
"you.  Makes you less dextrous though."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel se está haciendo más resistente. El daño cortante y golpeante se "
"reducirá más. Pero te hace un poco menos hábil."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Diamond-Skinned"
msgstr "Piel Diamantina"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Diamond-Skinned'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skin is developing kevlar-like qualities.  Makes you slower though."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel ha desarrollado cualidades similares al kevlar. Pero te hace más "
"lento."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Apatosaurus Back"
msgstr "Espalda de Apatosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Apatosaurus Back'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying inhuman amounts - more than others with similar "
"strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 70%."
msgstr ""
"Sos capaz de cargar cantidades sobrehumanas - más de lo que pudieran otros "
"con fuerza similar. Tu máxima carga posible está incrementada en un 70%."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Serrated Teeth"
msgstr "Dientes Serrados"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Serrated Teeth'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your mouth has reshaped to accomodate many serrated teeth.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat… but tear giant wounds in "
"your prey."
msgstr ""
"Tu boca se ha reformado para acomodar la cantidad de dientes serrados. Se te"
" hace imposible usar equipo en la boca y te dificulta comer… pero podés "
"causar grandes heridas en tu presa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You tear into %s with your serrated teeth"
msgstr "Hundís tus dientes serrados en el/a %s "

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their serrated teeth"
msgstr "%1$s hunde sus dientes serrados en el/a %2$s"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Horned Tail"
msgstr "Cola Cornuda"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Horned Tail'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance"
" a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tenés una cola larga y gruesa con cuernos puntiagudos y filosos. Ayuda un "
"poco tu balance pero también sirve para golpear. No te permite utilizar "
"pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You smash %s with your tail"
msgstr "Golpeás %s con tu cola"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s smashes %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1$s golpea %2$s con su cola"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Künstler"
msgstr "Künstler"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Künstler'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have lingering memories of training to fight cyborgs and war machines in"
" zero gravity using the obscure Panzer Kunst."
msgstr ""
"Tenés recuerdos persistentes de estar entrenando para combatir ciborgs y "
"máquinas de guerra en gravedad cero, usando el oscuro Panzer Kunst."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Drunken Master"
msgstr "Maestría en Borrachera"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Drunken Master'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ancient arts of drunken brawling come naturally to you!  While under the"
" influence of alcohol, your melee skill will rise considerably, especially "
"unarmed combat."
msgstr ""
"¡El antiguo arte de las peleas de borrachos es natural para vos! Mientras "
"estás bajo la influencia del alcohol, tu habilidad de cuerpo a cuerpo se "
"incrementa considerablemente, especialmente en el combate desarmado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Hero's Spirit"
msgstr "Espíritu de Héroe"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Hero's Spirit"}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have studied the deeds and legends of ancient heroes.  From your "
"research, you have learned an ancient form of combat called Hylian "
"Swordsmanship."
msgstr ""
"Has estudiado las hazañas y leyendas de los héroes antiguos. Por tus "
"investigaciones has aprendido una forma antigua de combate llamada "
"Espadachín Hyliano."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ki Strike"
msgstr "Golpe Ki"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ki Strike'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  You deal more melee damage while unarmed.  This damage "
"improves as your unarmed skill increases."
msgstr ""
"¿Quién necesita armas? Causás más daño de cuerpo a cuerpo cuando estás "
"desarmado. Este daño aumenta a medida que lo hace tu habilidad desarmado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Jedi Training"
msgstr "Entrenamiento Jedi"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jedi Training'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are trained in the ways of the Jedi.  Your knowledge allows you to "
"utilize a form of lightsaber combat."
msgstr ""
"Estás entrenado en los caminos de los Jedi. Tu conocimiento te permite "
"utilizar una forma de combate con sable de luz."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Pokken Master"
msgstr "Maestro/a Pokken"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pokken Master'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are well versed in the monsterous Pocket Fist martial art.  Train well, "
"because it is your destiny to be a master."
msgstr ""
"Sos versado en el monstruoso arte marcial llamado Puño Bolsillo. Entrená "
"bien porque tu destino es ser un maestro."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Martial Adept"
msgstr "Experto/a Marcial"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Martial Adept'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a martial adept and learned one of the martial disciplines of the "
"Sublime Way.  You start with your choice of Desert Wind, Diamond Mind, Iron "
"Heart, Setting Sun, Stone Dragon, or Tiger Claw."
msgstr ""
"Sos un experto marcial y aprendiste una de las disciplinas marciales del "
"Camino Sublime. Empezás seleccionando Viento Desértico, Mente de Diamante, "
"Corazón de Hierro, Sol Poniente, Dragón de Piedra o Garra de Tigre."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You sometimes think back about the world you left behind.  You're glad you "
"burned it in your wake."
msgstr ""
"A veces pensás en el mundo que dejaste atrás. Te pone contento saber que lo "
"quemaste cuando despertaste."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Black Dragon Scales"
msgstr "Escamas de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon Scales'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of heavy black scales has grown to cover your body, acting as natural "
"armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also greatly limits your "
"flexibility, resulting in a -4 penalty to Dexterity.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Es una colección de escamas negras y resistentes te han crecido y cubren tu "
"cuerpo. Funcionan como una armadura natural. Aunque es difícil de penetrar, "
"también limita mucho tu flexibilidad, lo que te da una penalidad de -4 a tu "
"destreza. Reduce mucho los efectos de estar mojado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Clawed Feet"
msgstr "Pies con Garras"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Clawed Feet'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your toenails have grown long and sharp, preventing you from wearing shoes, "
"but providing you with a set of powerful claws on your feet.  Fortunately "
"they don't impede your movement."
msgstr ""
"Las uñas de tus pies han crecido largas y filosas, lo que te impide usar "
"calzado pero tenés unas garras poderosas. Por suerte, no dificultan tus "
"movimientos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon Clawed Feet"
msgstr "Pies con Garras de Dragón"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dragon Clawed Feet'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The claws on your toes have developed in to incredibly tough talons.  These "
"are fearsome and powerful, but still prevent you from wearing shoes and "
"slighly impede your movement."
msgstr ""
"Las garras de tus pies se han desarrollado hasta ser increíblemente "
"resistentes. Son imponentes y poderosas pero siguen impidiéndote usar "
"calzado, y dificultan levemente tus movimientos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You slash %s with your clawed feet"
msgstr "Le hacés un corte %s con las garras de tus pies"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with their clawed feet"
msgstr "%1$s le hace un corte %2$s con las garras de sus pies"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Inconvenient Draconic Growth"
msgstr "Crecimiento Dracónico Inconveniente"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inconvenient Draconic Growth'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller, broader, and menacing.  Much of it is "
"useful muscle mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance "
"and you get in your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance), and you notice "
"people are starting to treat you differently."
msgstr ""
"Te has hecho notablemente más alto, más ancho y más amenazante. La mayoría "
"es masa muscular útil (Fuerza +2), pero notás que te quita el balance y "
"estás más torpe (+10 de incomodidad en torso y brazos), y te das cuenta que "
"las personas te empezaron a tratar de manera diferente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Growth"
msgstr "Crecimiento Dracónico"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Growth'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve, but are all the "
"more menacing for it.  Strength +2."
msgstr ""
"Cargás tu robusto cuerpo con la dignidad que se merece, porque así sos más "
"amenazante. Fuerza +2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Freakish Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "Madurez Dracónica Extravagante"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wyrmling Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza de Cría Wyrm"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wyrmling Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your muscles are enhanced by some growing innate magic.  You are slightly "
"stronger.  Strength + 1"
msgstr ""
"Tus músculos están mejorados por algún crecimiento innato mágico. Sos un "
"poco más fuerte. Fuerza + 1"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Young Dragon Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza de Dragón Joven"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Young Dragon Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The connection to your inner magic is growing and your muscles are stronger,"
" but you're a little more clumsy.  Strength + 3, Dexterity - 1"
msgstr ""
"La conexión con tu magia interna está creciendo y tus músculos son más "
"fuertes, pero sos un poco más torpe. Fuerza + 3, Destreza - 1"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza Dracónica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The magic within you courses through your muscles, greatly empowering them."
"  This costs you valuable flexibility and coordination, however.  Strength +"
" 5, Dexterity - 2"
msgstr ""
"Tu magia interior te corre por los músculos, fortaleciéndolos mucho. Sin "
"embargo, esto te hace perder flexibilidad y coordinación. Fuerza + 5, "
"Destreza - 2"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ancient Draconic Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza Dracónica Antigua"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ancient Draconic Strength'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your internal magic has filled you with unimaginable strength, but you can't"
" move as freely as your form once could.  This is no problem.  Strength + 8,"
" Dexterity - 3"
msgstr ""
"Tu magia interna te ha llenado con una fortaleza inimaginable, pero ya no te"
" podés mover como antes. No hay drama. Fuerza + 8, Destreza - 3"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Maturity"
msgstr "Madurez Dracónica"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Black Dragon Wings"
msgstr "Alas de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon Wings'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, black scaled dragon wings.  While you have control"
" of them and can make attacks with them, they are not large enough nor "
"strong enough to allow you to fly and they throw your off balance, greatly "
"reducing your ability to dodge.  They can be used to cast a protective spell"
" on yourself however."
msgstr ""
"Tenés un par de alas grandes, con escamas negras de dragón. Aunque podés "
"controlarlas y usarlas para atacar, no son lo suficientemente grandes ni "
"fuertes como para permitirte volar, y te sacan de balance, lo que reduce tu "
"habilidad para esquivar. Pero pueden ser usadas para lanzar un hechizo de "
"protección sobre vos mismo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "You bash %s with your powerful wings"
msgstr "Golpeás %s con tus poderosas alas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid "%1$s bashes %2$s with their powerful wings"
msgstr "%1$s golpea %2$s con sus poderosas alas"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Overly Acidic Digestion"
msgstr "Digestión Excesivamente Ácida"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Overly Acidic Digestion'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues have developed to become overly acidic which greatly "
"impacts your ability to normally digest food, resulting in getting far less "
"nutrition from the food you eat and making your need to eat more often."
msgstr ""
"Tus emisiones digestivas se han hecho excesivamente ácidas, lo que influye "
"mucho en tu habilidad para digerir normalmente la comida, y que te hace "
"obtener mucha menos nutrición de lo que comés y necesitás comer más seguido."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon Breath'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your digestive issues may not have settled entirely, but you can somewhat "
"control them and now you have the ability to spit acid!"
msgstr ""
"Tus emisiones digestivos todavía no se han estabilizado completamente, pero "
"podés controlarlas de alguna manera y ahora ¡tenés la habilidad de escupir "
"ácido!"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "Dependencia Dracónica del Calor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Heat Dependence'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  Unfortunately, "
"this doesn't seem to help you conserve any energy."
msgstr ""
"Tu respuesta muscular depende de la temperatura ambiental. Perdés 1% de tu "
"velocidad por cada 2.8 C (5 F) grados por debajo de 18.3 C (65 F). "
"Lamentablemente, esto no parece ayudarte a conservar energía."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "High Draconic Heat Dependence"
msgstr "Alta Dependencia Dracónica del Calor"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'High Draconic Heat Dependence'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  "
"Unfortunately, it seems you have to exert more energy to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Tu respuesta muscular depende mucho de la temperatura ambiental. Perdés 1% "
"de tu velocidad por cada 1.7 C (3 F) grados por debajo de 18.3 C (65 F). "
"Lamentablemente, esto te hace gastar más energía para moverte."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Ectothermia"
msgstr "Ectotermia Dracónica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Ectothermia'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises "
"1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  All this and you"
" need even more food to maintain your energy."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo se ha vuelto permanentemente de sangre fría. Tu velocidad "
"disminuye o aumenta un 1% por cada 1.1 C grados (2 F) por debajo o por "
"encima de 18.3 C (65 F). Con esto necesitás más comida para mantener tu "
"energía."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Magic"
msgstr "Magia Dracónica"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Magic'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are imbued with with the ancient magic powers of black dragons, "
"improving your mana reserves and opening your mind to amazing feats of "
"magic."
msgstr ""
"Estás imbuido por unos antiguos poderes mágicos de dragón negro, lo que "
"mejora tus reservas de maná y abre tu mente para lograr maravillosas proezas"
" mágicas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Draconic Spellcasting"
msgstr "Hechizos Dracónicos"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Draconic Spellcasting'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your mind has fully opened to the power and ancient heritage of dragons.  "
"You can access even greater quantities of mana and you have access to more "
"dragon spells."
msgstr ""
"Tu mente se ha abierto completamente a la herencia poderosa y antigua de los"
" dragones. Podés acceder a mayores cantidades de maná y tenés acceso a más "
"hechizos de dragón."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Scaled Mouth"
msgstr "Boca Escamosa"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scaled Mouth'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown up and around your mouth, digging into your gums and "
"retracting your lips.  On the down side, it makes speaking difficult.  On "
"the positive side, it makes it very easy to bite things, though what's "
"driving you to do that?"
msgstr ""
"Tus escamas han crecido alrededor de tu boca, clavándose en tus encías y "
"retractando tus labios. Lo malo es que se te complica hablar. Lo bueno, es "
"muy fácil morder cosas, aunque ¿por qué querrías hacerlo?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Black Dragon Maw"
msgstr "Fauces de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon Maw'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws have extended to a long, toothy dragon maw.  It's "
"fearsome and causes grievous wounds, but prevents wearing mouth gear."
msgstr ""
"Tu cara y mandíbula se han extendido hasta formar unas fauces de dragón "
"largas y con dientes Son aterradoras y causan heridas severas, pero te "
"impide usar cosas sobre la boca."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stubby Reptile Tail"
msgstr "Cola Regordeta de Reptil"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stubby Reptile Tail'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a short, stubby tail that has strange bumps and ridges.  You can "
"wiggle it, but it serves no purpose."
msgstr ""
"Tenés una cola regordeta y corta que tiene extraños bultos y rugosidades. "
"Podés menearla pero no sirve para nada."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Scaled Reptile Tail"
msgstr "Cola Escamosa de Reptil"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scaled Reptile Tail'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, reptile tail.  You can use it decently as a club of "
"sorts, but it's not doing anything to help you balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tenés una cola larga, gruesa y de reptil. Podés usarla como una clase de "
"garrote decente, pero no te ayuda mucho con el balance. No te permite "
"utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py lang/json/technique_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon Tail"
msgstr "Cola de Dragón"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dragon Tail'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, dragonlike tail.  It doesn't help you balance or "
"dodge any better, but it is a powerful bashing weapon.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"Tenés una cola larga y gruesa, como la de un dragón. No te ayuda con el "
"balance ni a esquivar mejor, pero es una potente arma golpeante. No te "
"permite utilizar pantalones que no sean de tela."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Scaled Hands"
msgstr "Manos Escamosas"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scaled Hands'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your scales have grown to cover your hands and elongate the tips in to "
"jagged claws that can be servicable as cutting and piercing weapons in "
"unarmed combat.  You can still use them normally, but you can't wear gloves."
msgstr ""
"Tus escamas han crecido cubriéndote las manos y alargándote las puntas en "
"forma de garras puntiagudas que son armas útiles de daño cortante y punzante"
" en la lucha desarmada. Todavía podés usar tus manos normalmente pero no "
"podés ponerte guantes."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Black Dragon Talons"
msgstr "Garras de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragon Talons'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"All of your fingers have developed into huge scaled talons.  They prevent "
"wearing gloves, but you can use them to powerful effect in melee combat and "
"you appear to have uncovered some secrets about black dragons."
msgstr ""
"Todos tus dedos se han convertido en enormes garras escamosas. Te impiden "
"ponerte guantes pero podés usarlas efectivamente en combate cuerpo a cuerpo,"
" y parece que has descubierto algunos secretos acerca de los dragones "
"negros."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Artificer"
msgstr "Artífice"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Artificer'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With the mechanically-minded Technomancer and the sheer power of lightning "
"from a Stormshaper, the Artificer has a unique confluence of skills and "
"spells to be perfect for invention.  While modern inventions and machines "
"have won out in a modern society, after a cataclysm one has a chance to go "
"back to roots of things.  To make weird gadgets that are just as likely to "
"explode as explode the thing you're pointing at."
msgstr ""
"Con la mente más mecánica del Tecnomante y el poder puro del rayo del "
"Tormentaformante, el Artífice posee una única confluencia de habilidades y "
"hechizos perfectos para le invención. Aunque los inventos y máquinas "
"modernos han salido victoriosos en la sociedad moderna, luego del Cataclismo"
" uno tiene la oportunidad de volver a las raíces de las cosas. Hacer "
"dispositivos extraños que son capaces de igual manera de explotar que de "
"hacer explotar aquello que apuntan."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Aura Mage"
msgstr "Magia Aura"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Biotek"
msgstr "Biotek"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biotek'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Biotek is quite simply the marriage of technology and flesh.  It was not"
" even discovered as an attunement until recent times due to the great "
"advancements in technology in the last 50 years.  The Biotek is unique as it"
" is the only known attunement that warps the Aethereum in such a way as to "
"allow cybernetics to coincide with magical abilities, to an extent."
msgstr ""
"El Biotek es simplemente la unión entre tecnología y carne. Y no fue "
"escubierto como alineación hasta hace poco debido a los grandes avances en "
"tecnología en los últimos 50 años. El Biotek es la única alineación que "
"modifica el Aetherium de tal manera que permite a los cibernéticos coincidir"
" con habilidades mágicas, hasta cierto punto."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Mage"
msgstr "Magia de Sangre"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Blood Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Animists are known for their blood magic, and being a Biomancer you are able"
" to take it another step further by strengthening your blood.  The dark arts"
" have opened to you, and while dangerous, are incredible to behold."
msgstr ""
"Los animistas son conocidos por su magia de sangre, y al ser un Biomante sos"
" capaz de avanzar un paso más para fortalecer tu sangre. Las artes oscuras "
"están abiertas para vos, y aunque peligrosas, son increíbles de contemplar."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Boreal Mage"
msgstr "Magia Boreal"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Boreal Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Named for the auroras that grace the poles of the earth, the Boreal mage "
"specializes in auras that protect ethereally.  Boreal mages definitely know "
"their way around cold spells, but their real strength is protection."
msgstr ""
"Nombrado por las auroras que adornan los polos de la Tierra, el mago Boreal "
"se especializa en auras que protegen etéreamente. Los magos Boreales conocen"
" definitivamente sus hechizos de frío, pero su verdadera fortaleza es la "
"protección."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Cleansing Flame"
msgstr "Llama Purificadora"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cleansing Flame'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Cleansing Flame is the fire that burns away the chaff, in preparation "
"for the regrowth of new life."
msgstr ""
"La Llama Purificadora es el fuego que quema la cáscara, preparando el "
"renacimiento de la nueva vida."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Crusader"
msgstr "Cruzado"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Crusader'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Crusader attunement is a clashing dichotomy of Man and Nature.  "
"Utilizing man's propensity for tools and nature's resilience, the Crusader "
"is a juggernaut in armed combat."
msgstr ""
"La alineación del Cruzado es la dicotomía chocante entre Hombre y "
"Naturaleza. Al utilizar la propensión del hombre por las herramientas y la "
"resiliencia de la naturaleza, el Cruzado es un gigante en el combate armado."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Earth Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Tierra"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Earth Elemental'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stone is superior to flesh.  You have allowed this axiom into your life, and"
" work to correct your own weakness with biomancy.  The strength of the Earth"
" rushed up to meet you with open arms."
msgstr ""
"La piedra es superior a la carne. Has aceptado este axioma en tu vida y "
"trabajado para corregir tu propia debilidad con biomancia. La fuerza de la "
"Tierra corre hasta encontrarte con los brazos abiertos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Fire Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Fuego"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fire Elemental'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have used your expertise in Biomancy to change your body more toward "
"your affinity for fire as a Kelvinist.  Fire doesn't bother you as much "
"anymore, and your blood is flammable when it touches the air, resulting in a"
" gout of flame when something hurts you.  You are also starting to study "
"more spells that focus on using your own body's affinity for fire."
msgstr ""
"Has usado tu experiencia en la Biomancia para cambiar tu cuerpo y acercarlo "
"a tu afinidad por el fuego, como Kelvinista. El fuego ya no te molesta y tu "
"sangre es inflamable en contacto con el aire, lo que ocasiona una gota de "
"llamas cuando algo te lastima. También estás empezando a estudiar más "
"hechizos que se focalizan en el uso de la afinidad al fuego de tu propio "
"cuerpo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Force Mage"
msgstr "Magia de Fuerza"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Force Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Force = Mass x Acceleration.  This is the typical thing that people think of"
" nowadays when the word is used, but Force Mages have a different meaning, "
"coming from traditional roots: untyped magical damage appears to be a "
"ghostly \"force.\"  This might be the effect of the attunement, but the "
"cause is even more intriguing: they appear to turn Newton's Third Law on its"
" head.  Magical scholars of the 21st century have theorized that this isn't "
"really the case; instead of the opposite reaction happening on this plane of"
" existence, a Force Mage uses the Aetherium's alternate Laws to rebound the "
"force back upon itself, effectively doubling the force in the same direction"
" instead.  However this ability comes with limitations, as the Force Mage "
"can only do this for melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Fuerza = Masa x Aceleración. Esa es la típica cosa que la gente piensa ahora"
" cada vez que se usa esa palabra, pero los Magos de Fuerza poseen un "
"diferente significado que viene de su raíz tradicional: el daño mágico no "
"clasificado parece ser una \"fuerza\" fantasmal. Este puede ser el efecto de"
" la alineación pero la causa es aún más intrigante: parecen dar vuelta "
"completamente la Tercera Ley de Newton. Los estudiantes de magia del siglo "
"XXI han teorizado en que no es realmente ese el caso; en lugar de que la "
"reacción opuesta suceda en este plano de existencia, un Mago de Fuerza "
"utiliza las leyes alternas del Aetherium para rebotar la fuerza sobre sí "
"misma, logrando duplicar la fuerza en la misma dirección. Sin embargo, esta "
"habilidad tiene sus limitaciones ya que el Mago de Fuerza solo puede hacer "
"esto para daño de cuerpo a cuerpo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gaia's Chosen"
msgstr "Elegido de Gaia"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Gaia's Chosen"}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Champion of the Earth, Gaia's Chosen is blessed on all things nature, "
"animate and inanimate."
msgstr ""
"El Campeón de la Tierra, el Elegido de Gaia está bendecido en todas las "
"cosas naturales, animadas e inanimadas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Glacier Mage"
msgstr "Magia Glacial"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glacier Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The power of a Glacier Mage is backed by a thousand tons of ice and snow, "
"with a brutal might in their spells.  While they are skilled with cold "
"spells, their greatest strength is in offense."
msgstr ""
"El poder del Mago Glacial está respaldado por cientos de toneladas de hielo "
"y nieve, con una potencia brutal en sus hechizos. Aunque son habilidosos con"
" los hechizos de frío, su mayor fortaleza es la ofensiva."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Golemancer"
msgstr "Goleomante"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Golemancer'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Golemancer is the ancient myth of the clay golem, made reality from "
"constant use of Animist summons and Earthshaper self-strengthening spells.  "
"Takes some traits from the golems they create, such as immunity to slowing "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"El Goleomante es el antiguo mito del gólem de arcilla, hecho realidad por el"
" uso constante de conjuros Animistas y hechizos de autofortalecimiento "
"Tierraformantes. Toma algunos atributos de los gólems que crea, como la "
"inmunidad a los efectos ralentizadores."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Gravity Mage"
msgstr "Magia Gravedad"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gravity Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The fundamental Laws of the universe are thought of as the end-all-be-all in"
" magical circles, and the Gravity Mage is a result of mages mucking around "
"with those laws.  Unfortunately, this attunement does not give supreme "
"control over gravity as a fundamental force, though the affinity is "
"prominent and comes with some non-negligible benefits."
msgstr ""
"Las leyes fundamentales del universo son vistas como lo esencial en los "
"círculos mágicos, y el Mago de Gravedad es el resultado de magos jugueteando"
" con esas leyes. Lamentablemente, esta alineación no otorga el control total"
" sobre la gravedad como fuerza fundamental, aunque la afinidad es prominente"
" y brinda algunos beneficios nada despreciables."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Overclocker"
msgstr "Overclocker"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Overclocker'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Technomancer specializes in augmenting humans without actually modifying"
" them; and the Overclocker takes the heat aptitude of a Kelvinist and puts "
"that to work.  You are able to think significantly faster, and are able to "
"align your leylines for spellcasting faster as a result."
msgstr ""
"El Tecnomante se especializa en mejorar humanos sin tener que modificarlos; "
"y el Overclocker toma la aptitud sobre el calor del Kelvinista y la pone a "
"trabajar. Sos capaz de pensar significativamente más rápido, y de nivelar "
"tus líneas ley para lanzar hechizos más rápidamente."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Ice Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Hielo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ice Elemental'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Through your power in Biomancy, you have changed your body towards your "
"Kelvinist affinity for ice.  Extreme cold has less effect on you, and your "
"superchilled skin causes frostbite when touching others.  You're also "
"starting to research more magic that focuses on your body's inherent ice "
"affinity."
msgstr ""
"A través de tu poder en la Biomancia, has cambiado tu cuerpo hacia la "
"afinidad Kelvinista por el hielo. El frío extremo tiene menos efecto en vos "
"y tu piel superfría causa congelamiento cuando otros la tocan. También estás"
" empezando a investigar más magia que se focaliza en la afinidad inherente "
"de tu cuerpo hacia el hielo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Illusionist"
msgstr "Ilusionista"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Illusionist'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Through the fine manipulation of light, an Illusionist might craft "
"deceptively convincing and dangerous illusions.  An Illusionist excels at "
"avoiding direct confrontation, instead relying on decoys and traps to slip "
"by undetected."
msgstr ""
"A través de la manipulación de la luz, un ilusionista puede fabricar "
"ilusiones convincentes y peligrosas. Se distingue por evitar la "
"confrontación directa, en su lugar, utiliza señuelos y trampas para pasar "
"desapercibido."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Magnetism Mage"
msgstr "Magia de Magnetismo"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Permafrost Mage"
msgstr "Magia Permahielo"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Radiation Mage"
msgstr "Magia de Radiación"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Radiation Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Radiation mage was discovered as an attunement in the 20th century, "
"closely guarded as a military secret in close relation to the Manhatten "
"Project.  It was declassified in 1989 as a part of the attunement awareness "
"movement, but it is still poorly understood even by the very few researchers"
" that wrote books on attunements."
msgstr ""
"El mago de Radiación fue descubierto como una alineación en el siglo XX, "
"guardado como un secreto militar en relación al Proyecto Manhattan. Fue "
"desclasificado en 1989 como parte del movimiento de concientización sobre "
"alineaciones, pero todavía es poco comprendido incluso por los pocos "
"investigadores que escribieron libros sobre alineaciones."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "Chamán"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shaman'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Deeply attuned to the spiritual fabric that shapes and nurtures the natural "
"world.  Shamans call upon the primeval spirits of nature for aid and advice."
"  Be careful however, for ancient spirits are fickle and unknowable things."
msgstr ""
"Está afinado profundamente con el tejido espiritual que le da forma y "
"alimenta al mundo natural. Los Chamanes pueden convocar espíritus primitivos"
" de la naturaleza para que lo ayuden y lo guíen. Sin embargo, hay que tener "
"cuidado, los antiguos espíritus son inconsistentes y desconocidos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Shapeshifter"
msgstr "Metamorfo"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shapeshifter'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The shapeshifter is the Biomancer refined - able to use a flicker of mana to"
" change shape at the drop of a hat to make yourself more inviting or shape "
"others into desired shapes."
msgstr ""
"El metamorfo es de afinación Biomante - capaz de usar un destello de maná "
"para cambiar de forma a la primera de cambio para hacerse más tentador o "
"para cambiar a los otros a sus formas deseadas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Soulfire"
msgstr "Almafuego"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Soulfire'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Soulfire is a phenomena of the caster's spirit binding to a fragment of "
"a spirit of flame.  This makes it possible for the Soulfire to use its "
"namesake as an element - much like fire, it does burn, but it burns away at "
"the soul instead of the flesh."
msgstr ""
"El Almafuego es un fenómeno del espíritu del hechicero uniéndose a un "
"fragmento de espíritu de llama. Esto hace posible que se utilice el "
"Almafuego como elemento - muy parecido al fuego, quema pero es una quemadura"
" del alma en lugar de la carne."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Storm Elemental"
msgstr "Elemental de Tormenta"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Storm Elemental'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've used your knowledge of Biomancy to change your body into a form "
"befitting a Stormshaper.  You can better withstand the power of electricity,"
" and sparks leap from your skin when something hits you.  You're beginning "
"to study spells that utilize your body's affinity for the electric."
msgstr ""
"Has usado tu conocimiento en Biomancia para cambiar tu cuerpo en una forma "
"adecuada a un Tormentaformante. Podés soportar mejor el poder de la "
"electricidad y chispas saltan de tu piel cuando algo te golpea. Estás "
"empezando a estudiar hechizos que utilizan la alineación de tu cuerpo para "
"la electricidad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stormcaller"
msgstr "Invocación de Tormenta"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stormcaller'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stormcaller is a stormshaper with an additional affinity toward the "
"weather in a localized area.  Historians agree that the druid requirement "
"has something to do with the Druid's affinity for nature, just like their "
"ability to summon animals.  You will know a stormcaller is in the room if "
"your ears pop and your hair stands straight on end.  Stormcallers are not "
"known for their subtlety."
msgstr ""
"Un invocador de tormenta es un tormentaformante con una afinidad adicional "
"hacia el clima localizado en el área. Los historiadores concuerdan en que el"
" requisito del druida tiene algo que ver con la afinidad del Druida con la "
"naturaleza, igual que su habilidad para convocar animales. Te vas a dar "
"cuenta cuando un invocador de tormenta está en el lugar porque te van a "
"sonar los oídos y se te van a parar los pelitos. Los invocadores de tormenta"
" no son conocidos por su sutileza."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Sun Mage"
msgstr "Magia de Sol"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sun Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Sun Mage has been studying the Laws governing heat, and has attained a "
"special relationship with that life-giving yellow orb in the sky.  Glimpses "
"of the Sun meet its foes, and its own burning light pierces the darkness."
msgstr ""
"El Mago Sol ha estudiado las Leyes para gobernar el calor, y ha desarrollado"
" una relación especial con esa esfera amarilla dadora de vida que está en el"
" cielo. Sus enemigos se enfrentarán con Destellos del sol y su propia luz "
"quemante atraviesa la oscuridad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Tundra Mage"
msgstr "Magia Tundra"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tundra Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The barren cold of the world's far reaches flows through the Tundra Mage.  "
"They find power in the all-pervasive frost of the North and in the creatures"
" that defy its deathly chill."
msgstr ""
"El frío estéril de los confines del mundo fluyen a través del  Mago Tundra. "
"Encuentran poder en los hielos omnipresentes del norte y en las criaturas "
"que desafían su frío letal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Void Mage"
msgstr "Magia del Vacío"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Void Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Where there is nothing, there is still power, and the Void Mages embody that"
" power.  The ability to wield emptiness itself is at their fingertips, and "
"no living creature can withstand the call of the void."
msgstr ""
"Donde no hay nada, hay poder, y los Magos del Vacío encarnan ese poder. La "
"habilidad de empuñar el vacío mismo en sus dedos, y ninguna criatura viva "
"puede tolerar el llamado del vacío."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Vulcanist"
msgstr "Volcanista"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vulcanist'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the most destructive forces on earth, a Volcano Mage takes some "
"aspect of its namesake.  Their spells tend to be a little slow, but their "
"resilience in proximity to a volcano is legendary."
msgstr ""
"Una de las fuerzas más destructivas de la tierra, un Mago Vulcano toma "
"algunas cosas de su nombre. Sus hechizos tienden a ser un poco lentos pero "
"su resiliencia en proximidad a un volcán es legendaria."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Wither Mage"
msgstr "Magia Wither"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wither Mage'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While biomancers focus on both life and death; Wither Mages set their sights"
" on the transitional period between these two stages.  They wield entropy "
"and decay hand and hand, using it to enhance their combat prowess to "
"surgical precision.  This confluence of abilities are what lead to assassin "
"mages gaining this attunement."
msgstr ""
"Mientras los biomantes se focalizan tanto en el fuego como en la muerte, los"
" Magos Wither apuntan al período transicional entre esos dos estados. "
"Empuñan la entropía y putrefacción mano a mano, usándola para mejorar su "
"habilidad en el combate con precisión quirúrgica. Esta confluencia de "
"habilidades es lo que lleva a los magos asesinos a ganar esta alineación."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Magus"
msgstr "Magus"

#. ~ Description for Magus
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tradition as old as magic, the Magus focuses on binding and shaping the "
"energy of the universe to their will."
msgstr ""
"Una tradición tan vieja como la misma mágica, el Magus se focaliza en "
"amarrar y formar la energía del universo a su voluntad."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Animist"
msgstr "Animista"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animist'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The animist tradition is a relatively new school of magical thought, formed "
"through combination of many older ways that focus on harmony and connection "
"to the natural world.  This does not mean that animists are passive: the "
"natural world is a savage place."
msgstr ""
"La tradición animista es una escuela de pensamiento mágico relativamente "
"nueva, formada a través de la combinación de varias formas antiguas que se "
"focaliza en la armonía y conexión con el mundo natural. Esto no significa "
"que los animistas son pasivos: el mundo natural es un lugar salvaje."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Kelvinist"
msgstr "Kelvinista"

#. ~ Description for Kelvinist
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Disciples of the great Archwizard Lord Kelvin.  Kelvinists focus their magic"
" on manipulation and control of the temperature of their environment, "
"leading to spectacularly powerful explosions or bone-chilling cold."
msgstr ""
"Son los discípulos del gran Archimago Lord Kelvin. Los kelvinistas focalizan"
" su magia en la manipulación y control de la temperatura y del ambiente, "
"produciendo espectaculares explosiones poderosas o frío que cala los huesos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Stormshaper"
msgstr "Tormentaformante"

#. ~ Description for Stormshaper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stormshapers follow ancient arcane disciplines of meditation and harmony "
"with the winds and tides that shape the planet.  Through their deep "
"connection to these forces, they can request powerful changes."
msgstr ""
"Los tormentaformantes siguen las disciplinas arcanas de la meditación y "
"armonía con los vientos y mareas que dan forma al planeta. A través de su "
"profunda conexión con esas fuerzas, pueden solicitar cambios poderosos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante"

#. ~ Description for Technomancer
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Technomancers are the new breed of modern magician, blending their arcane "
"might with their advanced knowledge of the fundamental nature of the "
"universe.  They use technology to enhance their magic and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"Los tecnomantes son una nueva estirpe de magos modernos que combinan poder "
"arcano con conocimiento más avanzado sobre la naturaleza fundamental del "
"universo. Utilizan la tecnología para aumentar su magia y viceversa."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante"

#. ~ Description for Earthshaper
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Earthshapers have allowed their minds to sink deep within the stones and "
"metals of the planet, and become one with its secrets.  To a master "
"Earthshaper, spells can be as permanent as the stones they are created from,"
" and time is measured in geological eras."
msgstr ""
"Los terraformantes han permitido que sus mentes se hundan profundamente en "
"las piedras y metales del planeta, y se han unido a sus secretos. Para un "
"maestro terraformante, los hechizos pueden ser permanentes como las piedras "
"con las que son creados, y el tiempo se mide en eras geológicas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Biomancer"
msgstr "Biomante"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biomancer'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Biomancer focuses on manipulating and even absorbing flesh; their own, "
"and that of other living or dead things.  Most other wizards find their "
"powers gross and disturbing, but no one can question the potency of their "
"abilities, and certainly not their adaptability to any situation."
msgstr ""
"El biomante se focaliza en manipular e incluso absorber la carne; la propia "
"y la de otros seres vivos o muertos. La mayoría de los otros magos "
"encuentran sus poderes repugnantes y perturbadores, pero nadie puede "
"cuestionar la potencia de sus habilidades, ni tampoco su adaptabilidad a "
"cualquier situación."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "Druida"

#. ~ Description for Druid
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Druids follow a wild tradition of allegiance and rebirth within the world of"
" nature, especially the cycle of death and rebirth that is the plant world."
"  A powerful Druid is as much a part of that world as the human one."
msgstr ""
"Los druidas siguen la tradición salvaje de lealtad y renacimiento dentro del"
" mundo de la naturaleza, especialmente el ciclo de la muerte y renacimiento "
"que sucedes en el mundo vegetal. Un poderoso druida es tan parte del mundo "
"como un humano."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Manatouched'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Magic is in you.  Magic is you."
msgstr "La magia está en vos. La magia sos vos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mana Solidification"
msgstr "Solidificación de Maná"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Solidification'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, "
"resulting in you being able to naturally create crystallized mana."
msgstr ""
"Tus líneas ley internas se han vuelto mucho más fáciles para que puedas "
"controlar, haciendo que seas capaz de crear naturalmente maná cristalizado."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Seeker Bolts'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your hands glow with mana energy.  You can fire seeker bolts from your "
"fingertips."
msgstr ""
"Tus manos brillan con energía de maná. Podés disparar rayos buscadores desde"
" la punta de tus dedos."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Subtle Spell"
msgstr "Hechizo Sutil"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subtle Spell'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You no longer need to move your arms to cast spells, due to your ley lines "
"becoming untethered from your arms.  Arm encumbrance no longer applies to "
"spell failure chance."
msgstr ""
"Ya no necesitás mover tus brazos para lanzar hechizos debido a que tus "
"líneas ley se han independizado de tus brazos. La incomodidad en los brazos "
"ya no afecta la probabilidad del hechizo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Silent Spell"
msgstr "Hechizo Silencioso"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Silent Spell'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You no longer need to use your voice to enforce your will upon the world.  "
"Mouth encumbrance no longer applies to spell failure chance."
msgstr ""
"Ya no necesitás usar tu voz para ejecutar tu voluntad en el mundo. La "
"incomodidad en la boca ya no afecta la probabilidad del hechizo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Weak"
msgstr "Débil"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your body is unnaturally weak.  -2 Strength."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo es débil de una manera poco natural. Fuerza -2."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mana Luminance"
msgstr "Luminosidad de Maná"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Luminance'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body discards unusable mana as light and heat, making you glow softly."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo desecha el maná inutilizable de manera de luz y calor, haciendo "
"que brilles levemente."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Siphon'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Drain'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Vortex'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Violence excites your ley lines.  Whenever you hit an enemy in melee, you "
"have a chance of regaining some mana."
msgstr ""
"La violencia excita tus líneas ley. Cada vez que golpees a un enemigo en "
"cuerpo a cuerpo, tenés probabilidad de recuperar un poco de maná."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mana Drain"
msgstr "Drenaje de Maná"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Mana Vortex"
msgstr "Vórtice de Maná"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Manatouched Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "Eficiencia de Maná de Manátocado"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Manatouched Mana Efficiency'}
#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Efficiency
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are able to store a lot more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "Sos capaz de almacenar mucha más maná en tu cuerpo que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Manatouched Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "Regeneración de Maná de Manátocado"

#. ~ Description for Manatouched Mana Regeneration
#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Regeneration
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much faster than normal."
msgstr "Tu regeneración natural de maná es mucho más rápida que lo normal."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Manatouched Mana Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad de Maná de Manátocado"

#. ~ Description for Manatouched Mana Sensitivity
#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Sensitivity
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can sense the mana in your body much better than normal, allowing you to"
" tap into more of your reserves."
msgstr ""
"Podés sentir el maná en tu cuerpo mucho mejor que lo normal, lo que te "
"permite acceder a mayor cantidad de tus reservas."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lesser Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "Eficiencia Menor de Maná"

#. ~ Description for Lesser Mana Efficiency
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "You are able to store a little more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr ""
"Sos capaz de almacenar un poco más de maná en tu cuerpo que lo normal."

