#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Cropland"
msgstr "Tierra de cultivo"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Generally tilled land used to grow row crops.  Boundaries follow the shape "
"of the fields and include associated buildings (e.g., barns).  This category"
" also includes turf farms that grow sod."
msgstr ""
"Es tierra cultivada usada para cultivar filas de plantas. Los límites siguen"
" la forma de los campos e incluyen edificios asociados (p.ej. graneros). "
"Esta categoría también incluye granjas de césped que crecen."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Pasture"
msgstr "Pastura"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fields and associated facilities (barns and other outbuildings) used for "
"animal grazing and for the growing of grasses for hay."
msgstr ""
"Campos e instalaciones asociadas (graneros y otros anexos) usados por "
"animales para pastar y para cultivar césped para heno."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#: lang/json/overmap_terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Forest"
msgstr "Bosque"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Areas where tree canopy covers at least 50% of the land.  Both coniferous "
"and deciduous forests belong to this class."
msgstr ""
"Áreas donde las copas de los árboles cubren el 50% de la tierra. Tanto "
"bosques de coníferas como de hoja caduca pertenecen a esta clase."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal Sin Bosque"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, and 21."
msgstr "DEP Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODEs 4, 7, 8, 12, 23, 18, 20, y 21."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Mining"
msgstr "Minería"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes sand and gravel pits, mines and quarries.  The boundaries extend to"
" the edges of the site’s activities, including on-site machinery, parking "
"lots, roads and buildings."
msgstr ""
"Incluye pozos de arena y de gravilla, minas y canteras. Los límites se "
"extienden a los bordes de las actividades del sitio, incluyendo maquinaria "
"del lugar, estacionamientos, caminos y edificios."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Open Land"
msgstr "Campo Abierto"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Vacant land, idle agriculture, rock outcrops, and barren areas.  Vacant land"
" is not maintained for any evident purpose and it does not support large "
"plant growth."
msgstr ""
"Tierra vacía, agricultura desocupada, afloramiento rocoso y áreas estériles."
" La tierra vacía no está mantenida para ningún propósito y no permite el "
"crecimiento de grandes plantas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Participation Recreation"
msgstr "Recreación Participativa"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Facilities used by the public for active recreation.  Includes ball fields, "
"tennis courts, basketball courts, athletic tracks, ski areas, playgrounds, "
"and bike paths plus associated parking lots.  Primary and secondary school "
"recreational facilities are in this category, but university stadiums and "
"arenas are considered Spectator Recreation.  Recreation facilities not open "
"to the public such as those belonging to private residences are mostly "
"labeled with the associated residential land use class not participation "
"recreation.  However, some private facilities may also be mapped."
msgstr ""
"Instalaciones utilizadas por la gente para recreación activa. Incluye "
"canchas de pelota, tenis, básquet, pistas de atletismo, áreas de ski, juegos"
" infantiles y bicisendas además de los estacionamientos asociados. Las "
"instalaciones recreativas de escuelas primarias y secundarias están en esta "
"categoría, pero los estadios son consideradas Recreación de Espectadores. "
"Las instalaciones recreativas que no están abiertas al público como esas "
"pertenecientes a residencias privadas, son etiquetadas con la tierra "
"residencial asociada, no a la recreación participativa. Sin embargo, algunas"
" instalaciones privadas también pueden aparecer mapeadas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Spectator Recreation"
msgstr "Recreación de Espectadores"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"University and professional stadiums designed for spectators as well as "
"zoos, amusement parks, drive-in theaters, fairgrounds, race tracks and "
"associated facilities and parking lots."
msgstr ""
"Estadios universitarios y profesionales diseñados para espectadores, también"
" zoológicos, parques de diversión, autocines, ferias, pistas de autos e "
"instalaciones asociadas y estacionamientos."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Water-Based Recreation"
msgstr "Recreación Acuática"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Swimming pools, water parks, developed freshwater and saltwater sandy beach "
"areas and associated parking lots.  Also included are scenic areas "
"overlooking lakes or other water bodies, which may or may not include access"
" to the water (such as a boat launch).  Water-based recreation facilities "
"related to universities are in this class.  Private pools owned by "
"individual residences are usually included in the Residential category.  "
"Marinas are separated into code 29."
msgstr ""
"Piletas, parques acuáticos, playas de agua salada y de agua dulce y "
"estacionamientos asociados. También incluye áreas escénicas sobre lagos u "
"otros cuerpos de agua, que pueden o no incluir acceso al agua (como de donde"
" zarpan los botes). Las instalaciones de recreación acuática relacionadas a "
"universidades pertenecen a esta clase. Piletas privadas pertenecientes a "
"residencias individuales usualmente están incluidas en la categoría "
"Residencial. Los puertos deportivos están separados en el código 29."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Multi-Family Residential"
msgstr "Residencial MultiFamilia"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Duplexes (usually with two front doors, two entrance pathways, and sometimes"
" two driveways), apartment buildings, condominium complexes, including "
"buildings and maintained lawns.  Note: This category was difficult to assess"
" via photo interpretation, particularly in highly urban areas."
msgstr ""
"Dúplex (generalmente, con dos puertas delanteras, dos entradas y a veces dos"
" entradas de auto), edificios de departamentos, bloques de departamentos, "
"incluyendo edificios y césped cuidado. Nota: Esta categoría era difícil de "
"evaluar por interpretación de foto, particularmente en áreas muy urbanas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "High Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencial de Alta Densidad"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on smaller than 1/4 acre lots.  See notes below for details on "
"Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Casas en lotes menores de 1/4 de acre. Ver notas abajo para detalles de la "
"interpretación residencial."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Medium Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencial de Media Densidad"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/4 - 1/2 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Casas en lotes de 1/4 - 1/2 de acre. Ver notas abajo para detalles de la "
"interpretación residencial."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencial de Baja Densidad"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on 1/2 - 1 acre lots.  See notes below for details on Residential "
"interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Casas en lotes de 1/2 - 1 de acre. Ver notas abajo para detalles de la "
"interpretación residencial."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Saltwater Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal de Agua Salada"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 and 27."
msgstr "DEP Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODEs 11 y 27."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Commercial"
msgstr "Comercial"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Malls, shopping centers and larger strip commercial areas, plus neighborhood"
" stores and medical offices (not hospitals).  Lawn and garden centers that "
"do not produce or grow the product are also considered commercial."
msgstr ""
"Centros comerciales, shoppings y áreas comerciales grandes, además de los "
"negocios de barrios y oficinas médicas (no hospitales). Césped y centros de "
"jardines que no producen o cultivan productos también son considerados "
"comerciales."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Industrial"
msgstr "Industrial"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Light and heavy industry, including buildings, equipment and parking areas."
msgstr ""
"Industria liviana y pesada, incluyendo edificios, equipamiento y playas de "
"estacionamiento."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Transitional"
msgstr "Transicional"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Open areas in the process of being developed from one land use to another "
"(if the future land use is at all uncertain).  Formerly identified as Urban "
"Open."
msgstr ""
"Áreas abiertas en el proceso de ser desarrolladas para un uso de la tierra u"
" otro (si el uso futuro de la tierra es incierto). Antes identificadas como "
"Urbanas Abiertas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Transportation"
msgstr "Transporte"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Airports (including landing strips, hangars, parking areas and related "
"facilities), railroads and rail stations, and divided highways (related "
"facilities would include rest areas, highway maintenance areas, storage "
"areas, and on/off ramps).  Also includes docks, warehouses, and related "
"land-based storage facilities, and terminal freight and storage facilities."
"  Roads and bridges less than 200 feet in width that are the center of two "
"differing land use classes will have the land use classes meet at the center"
" line of the road (i.e., these roads/bridges themselves will not be "
"separated into this class)."
msgstr ""
"Aeropuertos (incluyendo pistas de aterrizaje, hangares, estacionamientos e "
"instalaciones relacionadas), vías y estaciones de tren, y autopistas con "
"carriles separados (instalaciones relacionadas incluirán áreas de descanso, "
"mantenimiento de autopistas, almacenamientos y rampas). También incluye "
"puertos, galpones y tierras relacionadas a las instalaciones de "
"almacenamiento, y terminales de flete y su almacenamiento. Rutas y puentes "
"de menos de menos de 60 metros de ancho que están en el centro de dos áreas "
"diferentes tendrán la clase de lugar que se encuentran en la línea central "
"del camino (p.ej. estas rutas/puentes por sí mismos no estarán separados en "
"clases)."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Waste Disposal"
msgstr "Eliminación de Residuos"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Landfills, dumps, and water and sewage treatment facilities such as pump "
"houses, and associated parking lots.  Capped landfills that have been "
"converted to other uses are coded with their present land use."
msgstr ""
"Rellenos sanitarios, basureros e instalaciones de tratamiento cloacal o de "
"aguas como estaciones de bombeo y sus estacionamientos asociados. Rellenos "
"al límite que han sido convertidos para otros usos tienen el código del uso "
"actual."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 and 22."
msgstr "DEP Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODEs 9 y 22."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Cranberry bog"
msgstr "Ciénaga de arándanos"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Both active and recently inactive cranberry bogs and the sandy areas "
"adjacent to the bogs that are used in the growing process.  Impervious "
"features associated with cranberry bogs such as parking lots and machinery "
"are included.  Modified from DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."
msgstr ""
"Abarca tanto las ciénagas de arándanos activas o recientemente inactivas y "
"las áreas arenosas adyacentes a las ciénagas que se usan en el proceso de "
"crecimiento. Cosas impermeables asociadas a la ciénaga de arándanos como los"
" estacionamientos y la maquinaria, están incluidos. Modificado de DEP "
"Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODE 5."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Powerline/Utility"
msgstr "Tendido eléctrico/Servicio público"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powerline and other maintained public utility corridors and associated "
"facilities, including power plants and their parking areas."
msgstr ""
"Los cables de luz y otros tendidos de servicios públicos y sus instalaciones"
" asociadas, incluyendo las empresas de energía y sus estacionamientos."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Saltwater Sandy Beach"
msgstr "Playa"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17 and 19"
msgstr "DEP Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODEs 1, 2, 3, 6, 10, 13, 17 y 19"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Golf Course"
msgstr "Cancha de Golf"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the greenways, sand traps, water bodies within the course, "
"associated buildings and parking lots.  Large forest patches within the "
"course greater than 1 acre are classified as Forest (class 3).  Does not "
"include driving ranges or miniature golf courses."
msgstr ""
"Incluye las vías verdes, trampas de arena, cuerpos de agua dentro de la "
"cancha, edificios asociados y estacionamientos. Bosques dentro de la cancha "
"más grandes a 1 acre serán clasificados como Bosque (clase 3). No incluye "
"driving ranges o canchas miniaturas de golf."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Marina"
msgstr "Puerto deportivo"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Include parking lots and associated facilities but not docks (in class 18)"
msgstr ""
"Incluye estacionamientos e instalaciones asociadas pero no los puertos (en "
"clase 18)"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Urban Public/Institutional"
msgstr "Público Urbano/Institucional"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lands comprising schools, churches, colleges, hospitals, museums, prisons, "
"town halls or court houses, police and fire stations, including parking "
"lots, dormitories, and university housing.  Also may include public open "
"green spaces like town commons."
msgstr ""
"Tierras que comprenden escuelas, iglesias, universidades, hospitales, "
"museos, cárceles, edificio municipal, juzgados, comisarías y cuarteles de "
"bomberos, incluyendo estacionamientos, dormitorios y pensiones "
"universitarias. También puede incluir espacios verdes públicos como plazas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#: lang/json/start_location_from_json.py
msgid "Cemetery"
msgstr "Cementerio"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the gravestones, monuments, parking lots, road networks and "
"associated buildings."
msgstr ""
"Incluye lápidas, monumentos, estacionamientos, calles y edificios asociados."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Orchard"
msgstr "Huerto de árboles"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Fruit farms and associated facilities."
msgstr "Granjas de fruta e instalaciones asociadas."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Nursery"
msgstr "Vivero"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Greenhouses and associated buildings as well as any surrounding maintained "
"lawn.  Christmas tree (small conifer) farms are also classified as "
"Nurseries."
msgstr ""
"Invernaderos y edificios asociados como también cualquier césped mantenido "
"de los alrededores. Las granjas de árboles de navidad (pequeñas coníferas) "
"también son clasificadas como Vivero."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Forested Wetland"
msgstr "Humedal Con Bosque"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "DEP Wetlands (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25 and 26."
msgstr "DEP Humedal (1:12,000) WETCODEs 14, 15, 16, 24, 25 y 26."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Very Low Density Residential"
msgstr "Residencial de Muy Baja Densidad"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Housing on > 1 acre lots and very remote, rural housing.  See notes below "
"for details on Residential interpretation."
msgstr ""
"Casas en lotes de más de 1 acre y muy remotos, lugares rurales. Ver notas "
"abajo para detalles de la interpretación residencial."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Junkyard"
msgstr "Basurero"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Includes the storage of car, metal, machinery and other debris as well as "
"associated buildings as a business."
msgstr ""
"Incluye el almacenamiento de autos, metal, maquinarias y otros escombros "
"como también los edificios asociados."

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
msgid "Brushland/Successional"
msgstr "Matorral/Sucesión"

#: lang/json/overmap_land_use_code_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Predominantly (> 25%) shrub cover, and some immature trees not large or "
"dense enough to be classified as forest.  It also includes areas that are "
"more permanently shrubby, such as heath areas, wild blueberries or mountain "
"laurel."
msgstr ""
"Predominantemente (> 25%) cubierto de arbustos, y algunos árboles jóvenes no"
