"Tu primer partido en primera fue abruptamente cancelado cuando entraron los "
"zombis a la cancha. Los pies veloces y los buenos reflejos te hicieron estar"
" entre las pocas afortunadas que escaparon vivas del estadio."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "Foodperson Verdadera"

#. ~ Profession (male True Foodperson) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Sos una verdadera Foodperson. Algunos pueden pensar que Foodperson es solo "
"una mascota, pero vos tenés más conocimiento. La máscara se ha vuelto tu "
"cara, sos real y la única cosa parada entre este mundo y el olvido sos vos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "Foodperson Verdadera"

#. ~ Profession (female True Foodperson) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
