"cara, sos real y la única cosa parada entre este mundo y el olvido sos vos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Professional Cyclist"
msgstr "Ciclista Profesional"

#. ~ Profession (male Professional Cyclist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a promising young cyclist with a bright career in front of you "
"before this all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the "
"grand tours now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: "
"you've got to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Eras un joven ciclista que prometía tener una carrera brillante por delante "
"antes de que esto pasara. Tal vez ya no vas a poder participar en un grand "
"tour, pero como dice el dicho, la vida es como andar en bicicleta: tenés que"
" seguir moviéndote."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Professional Cyclist"
msgstr "Ciclista Profesional"

#. ~ Profession (female Professional Cyclist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a promising young cyclist with a bright career in front of you "
"before this all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the "
"grand tours now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: "
"you've got to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Eras una joven ciclista que prometía tener una carrera brillante por delante"
" antes de que esto pasara. Tal vez ya no vas a poder participar en un grand "
"tour, pero como dice el dicho, la vida es como andar en bicicleta: tenés que"
" seguir moviéndote."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "Teniente General"

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you barely escaped your aides."
msgstr ""
"Lograste subir de rango desde un soldado raso hasta llegar a ser un "
"importante Teniente General. Ahora, sin embargo, han pasado años desde que "
"disparaste un arma con furia y apenas si pudiste escapar de tus asistentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "Teniente General"

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you barely escaped your aides."
msgstr ""
"Lograste subir de rango desde una soldada rasa hasta llegar a ser una "
"importante Teniente General. Ahora, sin embargo, han pasado años desde que "
"disparaste un arma con furia y apenas si pudiste escapar de tus asistentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Ingresar al ejército ha sido tu sueño por años. Finalmente, ingresaste justo"
" a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una emergencia"
" nacional. Parece que los comandantes te abandonaron en este infierno "
"después de que te perdiste la evacuación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Ingresar al ejército ha sido tu sueño por años. Finalmente, ingresaste justo"
" a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una emergencia"
" nacional. Parece que los comandantes te abandonaron en este infierno "
"después de que te perdiste la evacuación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánico de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and the dead men "
"are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"Fracasaste en la escuela y te uniste al ejército. Rápidamente, fuiste "
"elegido para un entrenamiento extra en mecánica, manteniendo funcionando a "
"los blindados. Pasaron años desde la última vez que tocaste un rifle, y los "
"hombres muertos están marchando otra vez…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánica de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and the dead men "
"are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"Fracasaste en la escuela y te uniste al ejército. Rápidamente, fuiste "
"elegida para un entrenamiento extra en mecánica, manteniendo funcionando a "
"los blindados. Pasaron años desde la última vez que tocaste un rifle, y los "
"hombres muertos están marchando otra vez…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple.  Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training, now might be the "
"time to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo era simple. Mantener en movimiento al ejército. Construiste "
"puentes, construiste rutas, destruiste fortificaciones y limpiaste minas. "
"Pasaron años desde que tocaste un rifle por última vez durante el "
"entrenamiento básico, ahora puede ser el momento de desempolvar esas "
"habilidades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniera de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple.  Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training, now might be the "
"time to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo era simple. Mantener en movimiento al ejército. Construiste "
"puentes, construiste rutas, destruiste fortificaciones y limpiaste minas. "
"Pasaron años desde que tocaste un rifle por última vez durante el "
"entrenamiento básico, ahora puede ser el momento de desempolvar esas "
"habilidades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Non Comissioned Officer"
msgstr "Suboficial"

#. ~ Profession (male Non Comissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"your squad are shambling and want to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Sos veterano de varias misiones de paz. Lideraste tu pelotón como una "
"especie de figura paterna, ofreciendo consejos sobre cómo no morir. Ahora tu"
" pelotón anda arrastrando los pies y quiere comerse tu cerebro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Non Comissioned Officer"
msgstr "Suboficial"

#. ~ Profession (female Non Comissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"your squad are shambling and want to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Sos veterana de varias misiones de paz. Lideraste tu pelotón como una "
"especie de figura materna, ofreciendo consejos sobre cómo no morir. Ahora tu"
" pelotón anda arrastrando los pies y quiere comerse tu cerebro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "Hombre del Rifle"

#. ~ Profession (male Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr ""
"Cuando eras joven, soñabas con ser un soldado. La guerra es el infierno y el"
" infierno es la guerra, pero nunca pensaste que iba a suceder de esta "
"manera."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "Hombre del Rifle"

#. ~ Profession (female Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr ""
"Cuando eras joven, soñabas con ser una soldada. La guerra es el infierno y "
"el infierno es la guerra, pero nunca pensaste que iba a suceder de esta "
"manera."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operador Especial"

#. ~ Profession (male Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Eras el mejor de los mejores, el militar de mayor calidad. Por eso todavía "
"estás vivo, incluso cuando todos tus camaradas cayeron ante los muertos "
"vivos. Por lo que sabés, los comandantes te abandonaron en este infierno "
"después de que te perdiste la evacuación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operadora Especial"

#. ~ Profession (female Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Eras la mejor de las mejores, la militar de mayor calidad. Por eso todavía "
"estás viva, incluso cuando todos tus camaradas cayeron ante los muertos "
"vivos. Por lo que sabés, los comandantes te abandonaron en este infierno "
"después de que te perdiste la evacuación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Butler"
msgstr "Mayordomo"

#. ~ Profession (Butler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste contratado para hacerte cargo de las tareas domésticas de una familia"
" adinerada. Naturalmente, cuando las cosas se pusieron feas, todos se fueron"
" de vacaciones familiares a algún lugar desconocido, dejándote a tu destino."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Maid"
msgstr "Sirvienta"

#. ~ Profession (Maid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste contratada para hacerte cargo de las tareas domésticas de una familia"
" adinerada. Naturalmente, cuando las cosas se pusieron feas, todos se fueron"
" de vacaciones familiares a algún lugar desconocido, dejándote a tu destino."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Profession (Captive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and"
" blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth"
" anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas yendo por un camino a la noche, intentando alejarte de los horrores "
"de la ciudad, cuando escuchaste una voz llamando en la oscuridad. La "
"seguiste, esperando que sea amigable, pero de repente sentiste un dolor "
"agudo en tu cabeza y te desmayaste. Recién te despertás en un lugar extraño…"
" ¿seguís estando en la Tierra?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Profession (Captive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and"
" blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth"
" anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas yendo por un camino a la noche, intentando alejarte de los horrores "
"de la ciudad, cuando escuchaste una voz llamando en la oscuridad. La "
"seguiste, esperando que sea amigable, pero de repente sentiste un dolor "
"agudo en tu cabeza y te desmayaste. Recién te despertás en un lugar extraño…"
" ¿seguís estando en la Tierra?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Rescatista"

#. ~ Profession (Rescuer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Estabas preparado. Te metiste determinado a encontrar y rescatar a tus "
"amigos. Ahora, la atmósfera en estos corredores laberínticos se puso pesada,"
" y ya no estás muy confiado. Pronto serás vos el que necesitará rescate."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Rescatista"

#. ~ Profession (Rescuer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Estabas preparada. Te metiste determinada a encontrar y rescatar a tus "
"amigos. Ahora, la atmósfera en estos corredores laberínticos se puso pesada,"
" y ya no estás muy confiada. Pronto serás vos la que necesitará rescate."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Medical Resident"
msgstr "Médico Residente"

#. ~ Profession (male Medical Resident) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical "
"experience and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will "
"be enough if 'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you"
" expected."
msgstr ""
"Recién salido de la facultad de medicina, pudiste hacer poca experiencia "
"práctica y solo conseguiste un puñado de suministros de primeros auxilios. "
"Ahora esperás que eso sea suficiente por si aquella sentencia de 'Médico, "
"cúrate a ti mismo' resulta ser algo más literal de lo que quisieras."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Medical Resident"
msgstr "Médica Residente"

#. ~ Profession (female Medical Resident) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical "
"experience and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will "
"be enough if 'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you"
" expected."
msgstr ""
"Recién salida de la facultad de medicina, pudiste hacer poca experiencia "
"práctica y solo conseguiste un puñado de suministros de primeros auxilios. "
"Ahora esperás que eso sea suficiente por si aquella sentencia de 'Médico, "
"cúrate a ti mismo' resulta ser algo más literal de lo que quisieras."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Mafioso"

#. ~ Profession (male Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"El jefe siempre decía que podía confiar en que vos resolvieras los trabajos "
"más complicados. Una lástima que le pegaron unos tiritos. No hay drama; el "
"mundo siempre tiene un lugar para alguien con tus talentos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Mafiosa"

#. ~ Profession (female Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"El jefe siempre decía que podía confiar en que vos resolvieras los trabajos "
"más complicados. Una lástima que le pegaron unos tiritos. No hay drama; el "
"mundo siempre tiene un lugar para alguien con tus talentos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Security Guard"
msgstr "Guardia de Seguridad"

#. ~ Profession (male Security Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, "
"but things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo aburrido y mal pago mirando cámaras y patrullando "
"pasillos, pero las cosas de repente se pusieron mucho más peligrosas. Tenés "
"algún equipamiento útil, pero nunca se te había presentado la oportunidad de"
" usarlo hasta ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Security Guard"
msgstr "Guardia de Seguridad"

#. ~ Profession (female Security Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, "
"but things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo aburrido y mal pago mirando cámaras y patrullando "
"pasillos, pero las cosas de repente se pusieron mucho más peligrosas. Tenés "
"algún equipamiento útil, pero nunca se te había presentado la oportunidad de"
" usarlo hasta ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "Paisajista"

#. ~ Profession (male Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left"
" except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Antes cortabas el pasto y recortabas arbustos para los ricos. El trabajo se "
"estaba volviendo escaso incluso antes de que llegaran los zombis, pero ahora"
" ya no te queda nada excepto tus herramientas y tu experiencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "Paisajista"

#. ~ Profession (female Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left"
" except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Antes cortabas el pasto y recortabas arbustos para los ricos. El trabajo se "
"estaba volviendo escaso incluso antes de que llegaran los zombis, pero ahora"
" ya no te queda nada excepto tus herramientas y tu experiencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Nursing Assistant"
msgstr "Acompañante Terapéutico"

#. ~ Profession (male Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste brindándoles cuidados a los ancianos incluso cuando el mundo "
"comenzó a caerse alrededor tuyo. Solo podés rezar para no tener que ver a "
"tus antiguos clientes entre los muertos caminantes…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Nursing Assistant"
msgstr "Acompañante Terapéutica"

#. ~ Profession (female Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
