#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombero TEM"

#. ~ Profession (male EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
"wounded, where every second counts.  On your way to respond to an emergency "
"call with your firetruck, you encounter chaos in the city, recklessness and "
"violence are plentiful.  Not wanting to use of the streets covered in "
"burning trash and debris, you took a long detour to your fire station, only "
"to find yourself unsure of the route back.  Looks like the only emergency "
"you will respond to will be your own."
msgstr ""
"TEM significa técnico en emergencias médicas. Te gusta manejar tanto como te"
" gusta extinguir fuegos y ayudar a los heridos, donde cada segundo importa. "
"Cuando ibas a atender una emergencia con tu camión de bomberos, encontraste "
"el caos de la ciudad, donde abundaba la violencia y la imprudencia. Como no "
"quisiste usar las calles que estaban llenas de basura y escombros prendidos "
"fuego, te desviaste mucho del camino hacia el cuartel de bomberos pero solo "
"lograste perderte. Parece que la única emergencia que vas a atender es la "
"tuya propia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombera TEM"

#. ~ Profession (female EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
