#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Serviceman"
msgstr "Reparador"

#. ~ Profession (male Serviceman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Employed by a large company, you performed services directly at annoying "
"customer's homes and also troubleshoot problems with their devices.  After "
"you finally finished replacing the 'wifi-cable' you finally were able to go "
"back to your company, along the road back you notice all the chaos happening"
" around you.  Not wanting to get in the way of angry looking protesters, you"
" took an old neglected side road, only to find yourself low on gas in a "
"truly deserted place.  Couldn't this all just happen before you finished "
"your work?"
msgstr ""
"Como empleado de una gran empresa, realizabas servicios directamente en la "
"casa de clientes molestos y también solucionabas los problemas de sus "
"dispositivos. Después de que terminaste de reemplazar un 'cable wifi' "
"pudiste regresar a la empresa, y en el camino de vuelta notaste el caos a tu"
" alrededor. Como no querías cruzarte con los piqueteros de aspecto furioso, "
"fuiste por un camino viejo y olvidado solo para quedarte sin combustible en "
"un lugar verdaderamente desierto. ¿No podría haber pasado esto cuando ya "
"había terminado tu horario de trabajo?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Serviceman"
msgstr "Reparadora"

#. ~ Profession (female Serviceman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
