#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "Colectivero"

#. ~ Profession (male Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
" the chaos happening around you.  By the time you arrive at the station, all"
" the brats look like zombies, so you took a long detour to safety, only to "
"find yourself in a different place.  At last you have been freed of the "
"hellish noises they release, but new ones are on the merge."
msgstr ""
"Vivís de llevar a mocosos ruidosos a sus escuelas, deseando en cada viaje "
"que no rompan ningún asiento ni ventana. Yendo a buscar la primera tanda de "
"malcriados, notaste todo el caos a tu alrededor. Cuando llegaste a la "
"parada, todos los mocosos parecían zombis, así que te desviaste mucho hacia "
"un camino seguro pero terminaste en otro lugar. Por lo menos te liberaste de"
" los ruidos infernales que hacen los pibes pero nuevos ruidos empiezan a "
"aparecer."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "Colectivera"

#. ~ Profession (female Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
