"que siempre quisieron que hicieras en estos días oscuros que se vienen: "
"sobrevivir."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dodgeball Player"
msgstr "Jugador de Matanza"

#. ~ Profession (male Dodgeball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In dodgeball, failing to dodge meant taking a ball to the head and being out"
" of the game.  In the Cataclysm, it means getting eaten by monsters.  Don't "
"slip up."
msgstr ""
"En la matanza, no poder esquivar bien significa recibir un pelotazo en la "
"cabeza y quedar eliminado. En el Cataclismo, significa ser comido por los "
"monstruos. No le pifies."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dodgeball Player"
msgstr "Jugadora de Matanza"

#. ~ Profession (female Dodgeball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In dodgeball, failing to dodge meant taking a ball to the head and being out"
" of the game.  In the Cataclysm, it means getting eaten by monsters.  Don't "
"slip up."
msgstr ""
"En la matanza, no poder esquivar bien significa recibir un pelotazo en la "
"cabeza y quedar eliminada. En el Cataclismo, significa ser comida por los "
"monstruos. No le pifies."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Science Club Member"
msgstr "Miembro de Club de Ciencia"

#. ~ Profession (male Science Club Member) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The school never let your club play with the really fun chemicals, the kind "
"that make things go boom, but there aren't any teachers around to enforce "
"the rules anymore."
msgstr ""
"La escuela nunca dejaba que tu grupo jugara con los químicos realmente "
"divertidos, esos que hacen explotar cosas, pero ya no hay profesores que te "
"obliguen a respetar las reglas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Science Club Member"
msgstr "Miembra de Club de Ciencia"

#. ~ Profession (female Science Club Member) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The school never let your club play with the really fun chemicals, the kind "
"that make things go boom, but there aren't any teachers around to enforce "
"the rules anymore."
msgstr ""
"La escuela nunca dejaba que tu grupo jugara con los químicos realmente "
"divertidos, esos que hacen explotar cosas, pero ya no hay profesores que te "
"obliguen a respetar las reglas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "A/V Club Member"
msgstr "Miembro de Club Audiovisual"

#. ~ Profession (male A/V Club Member) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
"can use your technical skills to help you stay alive.  You just haven't "
"figured out how to make an awesome death ray yet."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro del club audiovisual de la escuela. Estás seguro que debe haber"
" alguna manera de utilizar tus habilidades técnicas para mantenerte con "
"vida. Pero todavía no encontraste la manera de hacer un maravilloso rayo de "
"muerte."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "A/V Club Member"
msgstr "Miembra de Club Audiovisual"

#. ~ Profession (female A/V Club Member) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of the school A/V club.  You're sure there's some way you "
