msgstr ""
"Estabas filmando un reality show desnuda en el bosque. Extrañamente, el "
"elenco y el equipo parecen haberse convertido en zombis, lo que te parece un"
" mal momento. Parece que ahora es real…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master"

#. ~ Profession (male Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two tried to eat you, you ditched."
"  Maybe you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar arrear amigos para que se junten todas las semanas te enseñó algo: "
"usualmente es mejor cortar por lo sano y confiar en tu instinto. Por esa "
"razón, cuando tuviste dos ausentes y los otros dos intentaron comerte, te "
"fuiste. Tal vez puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en las ruinas del mundo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master"

#. ~ Profession (female Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
