"trabajar ese día."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "Golfista"

#. ~ Profession (male Golfer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day, so you headed to the "
"fairway for a nice relaxing round of golf."
msgstr ""
"Decidiste alejarte de la familia por un día, así que fuiste al fairway para "
"jugar una relajante ronda de golf."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "Golfista"

#. ~ Profession (female Golfer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day, so you headed to the "
"fairway for a nice relaxing round of golf."
msgstr ""
"Decidiste alejarte de la familia por un día, así que fuiste al fairway para "
"jugar una relajante ronda de golf."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Samurai Urbano"

#. ~ Profession (male Urban Samurai) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Some claimed you were a visiting Shinto god.  Little of "
"this concerns you, but last week the grocery service stopped coming and now "
"the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases you."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste una aparición inexplicable en el pueblo, con tu pelo gracioso"
" y tus extrañas ropas japonesas. Algunos dicen que estuviste visitando al "
"dios Shinto. Te importa poco eso, pero la última semana el delivery del "
"mercado dejó de aparecer y ahora el televisor ya no prende. Esto te "
"disgusta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Samurai Urbana"

#. ~ Profession (female Urban Samurai) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Some claimed you were a visiting Shinto god.  Little of "
"this concerns you, but last week the grocery service stopped coming and now "
"the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases you."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste una aparición inexplicable en el pueblo, con tu pelo gracioso"
" y tus extrañas ropas japonesas. Algunos dicen que estuviste visitando al "
"dios Shinto. Te importa poco eso, pero la última semana el delivery del "
"mercado dejó de aparecer y ahora el televisor ya no prende. Esto te "
"disgusta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Competitive Fencer"
msgstr "Esgrimista de Competición"

#. ~ Profession (male Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The "
"referee was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo fue terminado cuando los zombis invadieron la pista. "
"El referí fue comido así que no estás seguro si las reglas se siguen "
"aplicando."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Competitive Fencer"
msgstr "Esgrimista de Competición"

#. ~ Profession (female Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The "
"referee was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo fue terminado cuando los zombis invadieron la pista. "
"El referí fue comido así que no estás segura si las reglas se siguen "
"aplicando."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Career Politician"
msgstr "Político de Carrera"

#. ~ Profession (male Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base "
"wants to eat you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida agradándole a la gente, persuadiéndolos y prometiendo "
"mucho todo el tiempo en tu oficina. Ahora que tu base de votantes prefieren "
"comerte vivo, ganar sus corazones y mentes se ha puesto mucho más difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Career Politician"
msgstr "Política de Carrera"

#. ~ Profession (female Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base "
"wants to eat you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida agradándole a la gente, persuadiéndolos y prometiendo "
"mucho todo el tiempo en tu oficina. Ahora que tu base de votantes prefieren "
"comerte viva, ganar sus corazones y mentes se ha puesto mucho más difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rancher"
msgstr "Ganadero"

#. ~ Profession (male Rancher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways"
" things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Cuidar las vacas, caballos y otros animales es tu pasión, pero por la manera"
" es que están las cosas, este no va a ser otro día normal en la chacra."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rancher"
msgstr "Ganadera"

#. ~ Profession (female Rancher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways"
" things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Cuidar las vacas, caballos y otros animales es tu pasión, pero por la manera"
" es que están las cosas, este no va a ser otro día normal en la chacra."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Encargado del Equipo"

#. ~ Profession (male Roadie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Siempre trabajaste justo por detrás de los reflectores, llevando y "
"arreglando el equipo y asegurándote que los artistas tengan lo que "
"necesitaban. El show debe continuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Encargada del Equipo"

#. ~ Profession (female Roadie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Siempre trabajaste justo por detrás de los reflectores, llevando y "
"arreglando el equipo y asegurándote que los artistas tengan lo que "
"necesitaban. El show debe continuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "Músico"

#. ~ Profession (male Musician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"La rompiste con tu solo pero el público explotó con gritos en lugar de "
"aplausos. No pudiste agarrar muchas cosas durante el pánico, pero por lo "
"menos te pudiste colgar tu guitarra en la espalda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "Música"

#. ~ Profession (female Musician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"La rompiste con tu solo pero el público explotó con gritos en lugar de "
"aplausos. No pudiste agarrar muchas cosas durante el pánico, pero por lo "
"menos te pudiste colgar tu guitarra en la espalda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Kitted Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente Equipado"

#. ~ Profession (male Kitted Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the local mall, you saw a sign advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""
"En el shopping viste un cartel con publicidad de un descuento en equipos de "
"supervivencia. Te compraste uno, más para mostrarlo que para usarlo. Ahora "
"es todo lo que tenés."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Kitted Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente Equipada"

#. ~ Profession (female Kitted Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At the local mall, you saw a sign advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""
"En el shopping viste un cartel con publicidad de un descuento en equipos de "
"supervivencia. Te compraste uno, más para mostrarlo que para usarlo. Ahora "
"es todo lo que tenés."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wild West Gunslinger"
msgstr "Pistolero del Salvaje Oeste"

#. ~ Profession (male Wild West Gunslinger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists"
" with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high "
"noon."
msgstr ""
"Te ganaste la vida en exhibiciones y shows del Viejo Oeste, maravillando "
"turistas con tu espectáculo de puntería. Pero ahora el mundo se terminó, así"
" que agarraste tu fiel seis tiros y te fuiste al mundo donde siempre es "
"mediodía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wild West Gunslinger"
msgstr "Pistolera del Salvaje Oeste"

#. ~ Profession (female Wild West Gunslinger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists"
" with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high "
"noon."
msgstr ""
"Te ganaste la vida en exhibiciones y shows del Viejo Oeste, maravillando "
"turistas con tu espectáculo de puntería. Pero ahora el mundo se terminó, así"
" que agarraste tu fiel seis tiros y te fuiste al mundo donde siempre es "
"mediodía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Frat Boy"
msgstr "Chico de Fraternidad"

#. ~ Profession (Frat Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry "
"for more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last "
"symbol of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando la plata de tus viejos sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus usuales fiestas, los invitados se pusieron "
"hambrientos de algo más que drogas y alcohol, pero todavía tenés la "
"posibilidad de usar el último símbolo de una vida de lujos - tu auto "
"deportivo - e irte bien lejos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sorority Girl"
msgstr "Chica de Hermandad"

#. ~ Profession (Sorority Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry "
"for more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last "
"symbol of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando la plata de tus viejos sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus usuales fiestas, los invitados se pusieron "
"hambrientos de algo más que drogas y alcohol, pero todavía tenés la "
"posibilidad de usar el último símbolo de una vida de lujos - tu auto "
"deportivo - e irte bien lejos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Pudiste ver las cosas derrumbándose desde el cielo, mientras transportabas "
"soldados y sobrevivientes de un lugar a otro. Sabías que era solo cuestión "
"de tiempo antes de que los horrores patrullando el cielo te derribaran."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Pudiste ver las cosas derrumbándose desde el cielo, mientras transportabas "
"soldados y sobrevivientes de un lugar a otro. Sabías que era solo cuestión "
"de tiempo antes de que los horrores patrullando el cielo te derribaran."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT"
msgstr "Técnico de Emergencias Médicas"

#. ~ Profession (male EMT) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Estabas atendiendo una emergencia con tu compañero antes de que se "
"separaran. Ahora lo único que tenés es tu fiel ambulancia, lista para "
"transportar pacientes a través del apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT"
msgstr "Técnica de Emergencias Médicas"

#. ~ Profession (female EMT) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Estabas atendiendo una emergencia con tu compañero antes de que se "
"separaran. Ahora lo único que tenés es tu fiel ambulancia, lista para "
"transportar pacientes a través del apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paramedic"
msgstr "Paramédico"

#. ~ Profession (male Paramedic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste separado de tu compañero mientras atendían una emergencia. Lograste "
"quedarte con algunos suministros médicos, pero parece que la única vida que "
"tenés que salvar ahora es la tuya."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Paramedic"
msgstr "Paramédica"

#. ~ Profession (female Paramedic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste separada de tu compañero mientras atendían una emergencia. Lograste "
"quedarte con algunos suministros médicos, pero parece que la única vida que "
"tenés que salvar ahora es la tuya."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Medic"
msgstr "Médico de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Medic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the front-lines when everything happened, patching up the "
"wounded and providing support.  But they wouldn't stop coming.  Now you're "
"on your own."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en las líneas frontales cuando sucedió todo, atendiendo a los "
"heridos y brindando apoyo. Pero no paraban de llegar. Ahora estás solo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Medic"
msgstr "Médica de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Medic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were on the front-lines when everything happened, patching up the "
"wounded and providing support.  But they wouldn't stop coming.  Now you're "
"on your own."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en las líneas frontales cuando sucedió todo, atendiendo a los "
"heridos y brindando apoyo. Pero no paraban de llegar. Ahora estás sola."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Heroin Addict"
msgstr "Adicto a la Heroína"

#. ~ Profession (male Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then people started eating each other.  This doesn't feel like a fever "
"dream."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que recordás es encontrarte con Dios atrás de un negocio de "
"Foodplace. Después la gente empezó a comerse entre ella. Esto no parece ser "
"uno de tus delirios."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Heroin Addict"
msgstr "Adicta a la Heroína"

#. ~ Profession (female Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then people started eating each other.  This doesn't feel like a fever "
"dream."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que recordás es encontrarte con Dios atrás de un negocio de "
"Foodplace. Después la gente empezó a comerse entre ella. Esto no parece ser "
"uno de tus delirios."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntario de Asistencia"

#. ~ Profession (male Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a "
"hand.  But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested"
" in handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin fines de lucro dedicada a ayudar a los "
"más necesitados. Cuando comenzaron los disturbios, estabas ansioso por dar "
"una mano. Pero tuviste que cancelar tus planes cuando todos estaban poco "
"interesados en los folletos y muy interesados en comerte."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntaria de Asistencia"

#. ~ Profession (female Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a "
"hand.  But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested"
" in handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin fines de lucro dedicada a ayudar a los "
"más necesitados. Cuando comenzaron los disturbios, estabas ansiosa por dar "
"una mano. Pero tuviste que cancelar tus planes cuando todos estaban poco "
"interesados en los folletos y muy interesados en comerte."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Speed King"
msgstr "Rey de la Velocidad"

#. ~ Profession (Speed King) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to rule the roads before they were filled with wrecks, undead, and "
"unspeakable horrors.  At least there's no speed limits in the apocalypse!"
msgstr ""
"Eras el más capo de las rutas antes de que estuvieran llenas de chatarra, "
"muertos vivos y horrores inenarrables. Por lo menos, ¡en el apocalipsis no "
"hay velocidad máxima permitida!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Speed Queen"
msgstr "Reina de la Velocidad"

#. ~ Profession (Speed Queen) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to rule the roads before they were filled with wrecks, undead, and "
"unspeakable horrors.  At least there's no speed limits in the apocalypse!"
msgstr ""
"Eras la más capa de las rutas antes de que estuvieran llenas de chatarra, "
"muertos vivos y horrores inenarrables. Por lo menos, ¡en el apocalipsis no "
"hay velocidad máxima permitida!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "Eliminador Militar de Cadáveres"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"Como respuesta al brote, fuiste desplegado para contener la infección "
"quemando los cadáveres. Cuando el comando fue consumido por los muertos "
"vivos, tus prioridades cambiaron hacia la supervivencia básica."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "Eliminadora Militar de Cadáveres"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"Como respuesta al brote, fuiste desplegada para contener la infección "
"quemando los cadáveres. Cuando el comando fue consumido por los muertos "
"vivos, tus prioridades cambiaron hacia la supervivencia básica."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "Unidad NBQ"

#. ~ Profession (male Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" job description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegado para realizar la autopsia de uno de los alborotadores que "
"tenía una conducta salvaje antes de ser eliminado. Cuando volvieron, te "
"diste cuenta que esto estaba fuera del alcance de tu trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "Unidad NBQ"

#. ~ Profession (female Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" job description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegada para realizar la autopsia de uno de los alborotadores que "
"tenía una conducta salvaje antes de ser eliminado. Cuando volvieron, te "
"diste cuenta que esto estaba fuera del alcance de tu trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Drug Dealer"
msgstr "Dealer"

#. ~ Profession (male Drug Dealer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were about to make your biggest sale yet, but when you met the buyer he "
"tried to bite you.  To top it off, it seems that this wasn't some sort of "
"bad high for the user, as the whole town tried going for your throat too."
msgstr ""
"Estabas por finalizar tu venta más grande cuando el que te iba a comprar te "
"intentó morder. Y lo peor de todo, parece que no fue a causa de que le pegó "
"mal algo, porque todo el pueblo estaba tratando de arrancarte el cogote."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
