#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vatgrown Bodyguard"
msgstr "Guardaespaldas de Probeta"

#. ~ Profession (male Vatgrown Bodyguard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata "
"and somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning "
"words to force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first "
"taste of life."
msgstr ""
"Creciste en algún laboratorio corporativo que brindaba los guardaespaldas "
"perfectos, con ninguna otra razón para vivir que cuidar a cliente. El "
"Cataclismo ignoró los estratos sociales y de alguna manera pudiste "
"sobrevivir a tu amo. Ahora nadie sabe las palabras para forzar tu "
"obediencia. Mientras el mundo se prende fuego, vos podés empezar a probar la"
" vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Vatgrown Bodyguard"
msgstr "Guardaespaldas de Probeta"

#. ~ Profession (female Vatgrown Bodyguard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Grown in some corporate laboratory to provide the perfect bodyguard, with "
"nothing to live for but your client.  The Cataclysm ignored social strata "
"and somehow you outlived your master.  Now no one knows the conditioning "
"words to force your obedience.  While the world burns, you get your first "
"taste of life."
msgstr ""
"Creciste en algún laboratorio corporativo que brindaba los guardaespaldas "
