#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT ROTC Member"
msgstr "Miembro CRIT ROTC"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT ROTC Member) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were training ahead of time to become a C.R.I.T officer in the upcoming "
"war.  Your call to arms arrived dead on arrival and already plastered in the"
" all-too vibrant gore of your squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged"
" out lest you join the remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits "
"and short years of training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Estabas entrenando adelantado a tu época para convertirte en un oficial "
"C.R.I.T. para la guerra venidera. Tu reclutamiento llegó muerto y ya "
"enyesado en un triperío vibrante de tus compañeros de escuadrón. En el medio"
" del pánico, te asustaste temiendo unirte a los restos de tus amigos. Ahora "
"dependés de tu ingenio y breves años de entrenamiento para mantenerte vivo "
"en este Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT ROTC Member"
msgstr "Miembro CRIT ROTC"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT ROTC Member) description
