"en este Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Janitor"
msgstr "Portero CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Janitor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Your life has been a wreck.  Hopping place to place you finally found"
" a job at C.R.I.T… as a janitor of sorts.  The pay was good and you got some"
" sneak-peeks on some pretty cool stuff.  After all non-essential personnel "
"were purged you found yourself stuck with nothing but the uniform they gave "
"you and your job's sign-bonus equipment."
msgstr ""
"Ufff… Tu vida ha sido un desastre. Yendo de un lado a otro hasta que "
"encontraste un trabajo en C.R.I.T.… como portero. El sueldo era bueno y "
"podías espiar algunas cosas que estaban copadas. Después de que todo el "
"personal no esencial fue purgado, te encontraste atrapado con nada más que "
"el uniforme que te dieron y el equipamiento de tu trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Janitor"
msgstr "Portera CRIT"

