#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Grunt"
msgstr "Soldado CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Grunt) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were part of the infantry; first to hit the ground running, clear a FOB "
"and then come back to relax with your squad.  Those days ended when the "
"cataclysm reared its ugly head.  Your lines were torn through like wet paper"
" when the otherworldly abominations arrived.  Now fleeing for your life, "
"will you have what it takes to survive or is this hellish landscape your "
"resting place?"
msgstr ""
"Eras parte de la infantería; los primeros en llegar corriendo al territorio,"
" limpiar el campo de batalla y luego volver para relajarte con tu escuadrón."
" Esos días terminaron cuando el Cataclismo metió su horrible cabeza. Tus "
"líneas fueron destrozadas como papel mojado cuando las atacaron las "
"abominaciones sobrenaturales. Ahora, huyendo por tu vida, ¿tendrás lo "
"necesario para sobrevivir o este paisaje infernal será tu última morada?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Grunt"
msgstr "Soldada CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Grunt) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were part of the infantry; first to hit the ground running, clear a FOB "
"and then come back to relax with your squad.  Those days ended when the "
"cataclysm reared its ugly head.  Your lines were torn through like wet paper"
