"los que tenías ganas de participar. Tu carisma e intelecto afilado te "
"ayudaron a trepar rangos y brindar apoyo a los aliados que lo requerían. "
"Ahora que todo se fue por la alcantarilla, ¿eso te volverá a servir?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Enforcer"
msgstr "Enforcer CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Enforcer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal.  As "
"a guard, others joked that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a "
"fancy badge.  Knowingly, you laughed it off as the you donned on your "
"equipment and deployed.  While you mainly spent time at base, you honed your"
" skills and received special implants to do your job easier at the low low "
"cost of serving as a \"guard\" forever.  Time to do your job, mission "
"parameters look like they've expanded quite a bit though."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Te dieron la autoridad de un Alguacil de EEUU. Como"
" guardia, otros se burlaron diciendo que no eras más que un policía de "
"shopping con una placa elegante. Sabiamente, vos te reiste mientras te "
"ponías tu equipamiento. Aunque pasaste la mayor parte del tiempo en la base,"
" perfeccionaste tus habilidades y recibiste implantes especiales para hacer "
"tu trabajo más fácil a cambio de servir como \"guardia\" para siempre. Llegó"
" el momento de hacer tu trabajo, los parámetros de la misión parece que se "
"ha agrandado un poco."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Enforcer"
msgstr "Enforcer CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Enforcer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal.  As "
"a guard, others joked that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a "
"fancy badge.  Knowingly, you laughed it off as the you donned on your "
"equipment and deployed.  While you mainly spent time at base, you honed your"
" skills and received special implants to do your job easier at the low low "
"cost of serving as a \"guard\" forever.  Time to do your job, mission "
"parameters look like they've expanded quite a bit though."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Te dieron la autoridad de un Alguacil de EEUU. Como"
" guardia, otros se burlaron diciendo que no eras más que una policía de "
"shopping con una placa elegante. Sabiamente, vos te reiste mientras te "
"ponías tu equipamiento. Aunque pasaste la mayor parte del tiempo en la base,"
" perfeccionaste tus habilidades y recibiste implantes especiales para hacer "
"tu trabajo más fácil a cambio de servir como \"guardia\" para siempre. Llegó"
" el momento de hacer tu trabajo, los parámetros de la misión parece que se "
"ha agrandado un poco."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Lone Wolf"
msgstr "Lobo Solitario CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Lone Wolf) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You are fully armored badass granted the full authority"
" of a U.S Marshal.  Sent in as the one man army capable of handling "
"anything.  Dropped into war zones, you singlehandedly laid out entire "
"battalions by yourself.  Time to hang them all."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Sos un hombre rudo con armadura y con la autoridad "
"total de un Alguacil de EEUU. Enviado como ejército de un solo hombre capaz "
"de encargarse de cualquier cosa. Dejado en zonas de guerra, podías "
"encargarte vos solo de batallones enteros. Llegó el momento actuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Lone Wolf"
msgstr "Loba Solitaria CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Lone Wolf) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You are fully armored badass granted the full authority"
" of a U.S Marshal.  Sent in as the one man army capable of handling "
"anything.  Dropped into war zones, you singlehandedly laid out entire "
"battalions by yourself.  Time to hang them all."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Sos una mujer ruda con armadura y con la autoridad "
"total de un Alguacil de EEUU. Enviada como ejército de una sola mujer capaz "
"de encargarse de cualquier cosa. Dejada en zonas de guerra, podías "
"encargarte vos sola de batallones enteros. Llegó el momento actuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Spec Ops"
msgstr "Operaciones Especiales CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Spec Ops) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were an elite member of the Catastrophe "
"Response/Research & Investigation Team.  A looming spectre which responded "
"to secular threats which allowed your faction to leap decades in front of "
"other world powers.  Your squad was the first to be deployed into the New "
"England region, ground zero, to contain the impending outbreak and gain "
"information to relay back to command.  Good luck soldier."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Eras un miembro de elite del Equipo de Respuesta & "
"Investigación de Catástrofes. Un espectro acechante que responde a amenazas "
"seculares que permiten a tu bando saltar décadas delante de otros poderes "
"del mundo. Tu escuadrón fue el primero en ser desplegado en la región de New"
" England, en la zona de impacto, para contener el estallido inminente y "
"conseguir información en la cual transmitir al comando. Buena suerte, "
"soldado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Spec Ops"
msgstr "Operaciones Especiales CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Spec Ops) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were an elite member of the Catastrophe "
"Response/Research & Investigation Team.  A looming spectre which responded "
"to secular threats which allowed your faction to leap decades in front of "
"other world powers.  Your squad was the first to be deployed into the New "
"England region, ground zero, to contain the impending outbreak and gain "
"information to relay back to command.  Good luck soldier."
msgstr ""
"Se recomienda Fuerza 10. Eras un miembro de elite del Equipo de Respuesta & "
"Investigación de Catástrofes. Un espectro acechante que responde a amenazas "
"seculares que permiten a tu bando saltar décadas delante de otros poderes "
