#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled for some survival training in New England when the "
"Cataclysm broke out and your instructor never showed up for the next lesson."
"  Now stuck in the quarantine zone with your standard issue training "
"equipment, you wish you had a better gun.  Looks like you'll definitely "
"learn a thing or two about survival though!"
msgstr ""
"Te programaron el entrenamiento de supervivencia en New Englando cuando el "
"Cataclismo sucedió y tu instructor nunca apareció para la siguiente clase. "
"Ahora estás atrapado en la zona en cuarentena con el equipamiento de tu "
"entrenamiento normal, desearías tener una mejor arma. ¡Parece que de todas "
"maneras vas a aprender un par de cosas sobre supervivencia!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled for some survival training in New England when the "
"Cataclysm broke out and your instructor never showed up for the next lesson."
"  Now stuck in the quarantine zone with your standard issue training "
"equipment, you wish you had a better gun.  Looks like you'll definitely "
