#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Employee"
msgstr "Empleado CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Employee) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Like many others, you had requested to join the C.R.I.T organization's "
"admin-offices to escape from bitter memories and past traumas after "
"valiantly protecting your comrades for years.  After you completed the "
"readjustment program, your skills may have rusted considerably since your "
"last deployment to battle, but the drilled muscle memories have not worn "
"away.  As your comrades' screams once again ring in your ears and repressed "
"memories of abhorrent nature resurface, can you find it within yourself to "
"overcome the looming terror which paralyzes you?"
msgstr ""
"Como muchos otros, pediste unirte a las oficinas administrativas de la "
"organización C.R.I.T. para recuerdos malos y traumas del pasado, luego de "
"proteger a tus compañeros durante años. Después de haber completado el "
"programa de reajuste, tus habilidades pueden haberse oxidado "
"considerablemente desde tu último despliegue en batalla, pero la memoria "
"muscular no se pierde. Cuando los gritos de tus compañeros volvieron a sonar"
" en tus orejas y los recuerdos reprimidos de naturaleza aberrante "
"resurgieron, ¿podrás superar el terror acechante que te paraliza?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Employee"
msgstr "Empleada CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Employee) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
