"Foodplace. Después, el cielo se abrió y llovió fuego. Esto no parece ser uno"
" de tus delirios."

#. ~ Profession (male Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Después de un accidente que sufriste en tu juventud, te hiciste adicto a los"
" opiáceos que te ayudaban con el dolor. Ahora que las farmacias cerraron y a"
" los dealers les empezaron a crecer cristales, satisfacer ese deseo se hizo "
"un poco más complicado."

#. ~ Profession (female Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
