"terminara y sospechás que esos demonios de cristal no son tan resistentes."

#. ~ Profession (male Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se pusieron un poco extrañas cuando ibas a tu clase semanal de "
"danza. Los extraterrestres no parecen saber cómo bailar pero no los vas a "
"dejar que te pisen los pies."

#. ~ Profession (female Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
