" Antes venían de todas partes para escucharte, ahora vienen para "
"destrozarte."

#. ~ Profession (male Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida enseñando a los pibes, experimentando la alegría y la "
"irritación de impartir conocimiento en sus jóvenes mentes. Si los "
"extraterrestres tiene algo de interés en la educación, no lo estarían "
"demostrando."

#. ~ Profession (female Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida enseñando a los pibes, experimentando la alegría y la "
"irritación de impartir conocimiento en sus jóvenes mentes. Si los "
"extraterrestres tiene algo de interés en la educación, no lo estarían "
"demostrando."

#. ~ Profession (male Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Antes cortabas el pasto y recortabas arbustos para los ricos. El trabajo "
"estaba empezando a escasear incluso antes de que llegaran los "
"extraterrestres, y ahora ya no te queda nada excepto tus herramientas y tu "
"experiencia."

#. ~ Profession (female Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Antes cortabas el pasto y recortabas arbustos para los ricos. El trabajo "
"estaba empezando a escasear incluso antes de que llegaran los "
"extraterrestres, y ahora ya no te queda nada excepto tus herramientas y tu "
"experiencia."

#. ~ Profession (male Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste brindándoles cuidados a los ancianos incluso cuando el mundo "
"comenzó a caerse alrededor tuyo. Solo podés rezar para no tener que ver a "
"tus antiguos clientes entre esas cosas de cristal…"

#. ~ Profession (female Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste brindándoles cuidados a los ancianos incluso cuando el mundo "
"comenzó a caerse alrededor tuyo. Solo podés rezar para no tener que ver a "
"tus antiguos clientes entre esas cosas de cristal…"

#. ~ Profession (male Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos mirando animé y picando algo, decidiste "
"hacer el viaje hacia la convención de animé en el noreste. Ahora los "
"extraterrestres están matando a todos y peor todavía, ¡la convención fue "
"cancelada! Por lo menos estás preparado por si se te rompe el disfraz."

#. ~ Profession (female Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos mirando animé y picando algo, decidiste "
"hacer el viaje hacia la convención de animé en el noreste. Ahora los "
"extraterrestres están matando a todos y peor todavía, ¡la convención fue "
"cancelada! Por lo menos estás preparada por si se te rompe el disfraz."

#. ~ Profession (male Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Tenías al jurado en la palma de tu mano pero después de que los "
"extraterrestres comenzaron a invadir, te viste forzado a escapar de la corte"
" con deshonra. Ahora, a nadie parecen importarle tus objeciones."

#. ~ Profession (female Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"Tenías al jurado en la palma de tu mano pero después de que los "
"extraterrestres comenzaron a invadir, te viste forzada a escapar de la corte"
" con deshonra. Ahora, a nadie parecen importarle tus objeciones."

#. ~ Profession (Pizza Delivery Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas entregando la última pizza de la noche al laboratorio de criogénesis"
" cuando unos extraterrestres hambrientos intentaron comerte. Escapando, te "
"encontraste solo con tu buen juicio y sobras de pizza. ¡Y ni siquiera te "
"dieron propina!"

#. ~ Profession (Pizza Delivery Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas entregando la última pizza de la noche al laboratorio de criogénesis"
" cuando unos extraterrestres hambrientos intentaron comerte. Escapando, te "
"encontraste sola con tu buen juicio y sobras de pizza. ¡Y ni siquiera te "
"dieron propina!"

#. ~ Profession (male Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin fines de lucro dedicada a ayudar a los "
"más necesitados. Cuando las tormentas arreciaron y cayeron las primeras "
"bombas, estabas ansioso por dar una mano. Pero tuviste que cancelar tus "
"planes cuando llegaron los extraterrestres: parecían poco interesados en los"
" folletos y muy interesados en comerte."

#. ~ Profession (female Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin fines de lucro dedicada a ayudar a los "
"más necesitados. Cuando las tormentas arreciaron y cayeron las primeras "
"bombas, estabas ansiosa por dar una mano. Pero tuviste que cancelar tus "
"planes cuando llegaron los extraterrestres: parecían poco interesados en los"
" folletos y muy interesados en comerte."

#. ~ Profession (male Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabio e ilustrado."
" Comúnmente, podrías responder cualquier pregunta pero ni siquiera vos estás"
" seguro de lo que se podría hacer con los voraces extraterrestres."

#. ~ Profession (female Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabia e ilustrada."
" Comúnmente, podrías responder cualquier pregunta pero ni siquiera vos estás"
" segura de lo que se podría hacer con los voraces extraterrestres."

#. ~ Profession (male Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the aliens don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""
"Comprometiste tu vida a difundir la palabra, siempre en el camino, viajando "
"de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora, todo se fue al infierno, ya no podés hacer tu "
"podcast diario y los extraterrestres no parecen particularmente conmovidos "
"por tus sermones."

#. ~ Profession (female Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the aliens don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""
"Comprometiste tu vida a difundir la palabra, siempre en el camino, viajando "
"de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora, todo se fue al infierno, ya no podés hacer tu "
"podcast diario y los extraterrestres no parecen particularmente conmovidos "
"por tus sermones."

#. ~ Profession (male Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the aliens before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Eras un infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto del equipo está muerto y tal "
"vez no hubieras sobrevivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la violencia "
"de alta velocidad. Las cosas son desalentadoras. ¿Cuántas vueltas podrás dar"
" alrededor de los extraterrestres hasta que puedan bloquearte?"

#. ~ Profession (female Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the aliens before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Eras un infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto del equipo está muerto y tal "
"vez no hubieras sobrevivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la violencia "
"de alta velocidad. Las cosas son desalentadoras. ¿Cuántas vueltas podrás dar"
" alrededor de los extraterrestres hasta que puedan bloquearte?"

#. ~ Profession (male Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two got eaten, you ditched.  Maybe "
"you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar arrear amigos para que se junten todas las semanas te enseñó algo: "
"usualmente es mejor cortar por lo sano y confiar en tu instinto. Por esa "
"razón, cuando tuviste dos ausentes y los otros dos fueron comidos, te "
"fuiste. Tal vez puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en lo que queda del mundo."

#. ~ Profession (female Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two got eaten, you ditched.  Maybe "
"you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar arrear amigos para que se junten todas las semanas te enseñó algo: "
"usualmente es mejor cortar por lo sano y confiar en tu instinto. Por esa "
"razón, cuando tuviste dos ausentes y los otros dos fueron comidos, te "
"fuiste. Tal vez puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en lo que queda del mundo."

#. ~ Profession (Frat Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, a bomb landed right in "
"the hot tub, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol of your "
"luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando la plata de tus viejos sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus usuales fiestas, una bomba cayó justo en el "
"jacuzzi pero todavía te queda la posibilidad de usar el último símbolo de "
"una vida de lujos - tu auto deportivo - e irte bien lejos."

#. ~ Profession (Sorority Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, a bomb landed right in "
"the hot tub, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol of your "
"luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando la plata de tus viejos sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus usuales fiestas, una bomba cayó justo en el "
"jacuzzi pero todavía te queda la posibilidad de usar el último símbolo de "
"una vida de lujos - tu auto deportivo - e irte bien lejos."

#. ~ Profession (male Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you avoid "
"getting experimented on in return?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y trabajo duro en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizado con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Solo queda"
" hacer una pregunta: ¿podrás evitar que experimenten en vos como venganza?"

#. ~ Profession (female Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you avoid "
"getting experimented on in return?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y trabajo duro en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizada con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Solo queda"
" hacer una pregunta: ¿podrás evitar que experimenten en vos como venganza?"

#. ~ Profession (Paperboy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The aliens "
"don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle is "
"still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Saliste esta mañana para entregar las noticias del apocalipsis. Los "
"extraterrestres no parecen valorar las noticias pero al menos tu querida "
"bicicleta todavía funciona."

#. ~ Profession (Papergirl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The aliens "
"don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle is "
"still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Saliste esta mañana para entregar las noticias del apocalipsis. Los "
"extraterrestres no parecen valorar las noticias pero al menos tu querida "
"bicicleta todavía funciona."

#. ~ Profession (male National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"storms and the following bombings.  Despite your best efforts, you were "
"unable to form up before all communications ceased and you found yourself "
"alone amongst the enemy."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para ocuparte de las "
"tormentas crecientes y los consecuentes bombardeos. A pesar de tus mejores "
"esfuerzos, no pudieron reunirse antes de que todas las comunicaciones se "
"cortaran y quedaste solo entre los extraterrestres."

#. ~ Profession (female National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"storms and the following bombings.  Despite your best efforts, you were "
"unable to form up before all communications ceased and you found yourself "
"alone amongst the enemy."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para ocuparte de las "
"tormentas crecientes y los consecuentes bombardeos. A pesar de tus mejores "
"esfuerzos, no pudieron reunirse antes de que todas las comunicaciones se "
"cortaran y quedaste sola entre los extraterrestres."

#. ~ Profession (male Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"doing it in a warzone.  Aliens won't even line up when you blow your "
"whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya era bastante difícil hacer que los pibes corrieran sin tener que "
"preocuparse en que lo hicieran en zona de guerra. Los extraterrestres ni "
"siquiera se ponen en fila cuando tocás el silbato."

#. ~ Profession (female Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"doing it in a warzone.  Aliens won't even line up when you blow your "
"whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya era bastante difícil hacer que los pibes corrieran sin tener que "
"preocuparse en que lo hicieran en zona de guerra. Los extraterrestres ni "
"siquiera se ponen en fila cuando tocás el silbato."

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Lograste subir de rango desde un soldado raso hasta llegar a ser un "
"importante Teniente General. Ahora, sin embargo, han pasado años desde que "
"disparaste un arma con furia y de alguna manera terminaste detrás de las "
"líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Lograste subir de rango desde una soldada rasa hasta llegar a ser una "
"importante Teniente General. Ahora, sin embargo, han pasado años desde que "
"disparaste un arma con furia y de alguna manera terminaste detrás de las "
"líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Profession (male Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Ingresar al ejército ha sido tu sueño por años. Finalmente, ingresaste justo"
" a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una emergencia"
" nacional. Luego de un despliegue complicado, por lo que podés ver sos uno "
"de los últimos miembros del personal en este infierno."

#. ~ Profession (female Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Ingresar al ejército ha sido tu sueño por años. Finalmente, ingresaste justo"
" a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una emergencia"
" nacional. Luego de un despliegue complicado, por lo que podés ver sos una "
"de los últimos miembros del personal en este infierno."

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is"
" falling…"
msgstr ""
"Fracasaste en la escuela y te uniste al ejército. Rápidamente, fuiste "
"elegido para un entrenamiento extra en mecánica, para mantener funcionando a"
" los blindados. Pasaron años desde la última vez que tocaste un rifle, y "
"ahora se está cayendo el cielo…"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is"
" falling…"
msgstr ""
"Fracasaste en la escuela y te uniste al ejército. Rápidamente, fuiste "
"elegida para un entrenamiento extra en mecánica, para mantener funcionando a"
" los blindados. Pasaron años desde la última vez que tocaste un rifle, y "
"ahora se está cayendo el cielo…"

#. ~ Profession (male Riot Control Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Te encargabas de mantener la paz durante una protesta contra el cambio "
"climático cuando las bombas comenzaron a caer y los extraterrestres "
"aparecieron en las calles. Fue de suerte que lograste sobrevivir sano y "
"salvo, y lo peor todavía está por suceder."

#. ~ Profession (female Riot Control Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Te encargabas de mantener la paz durante una protesta contra el cambio "
"climático cuando las bombas comenzaron a caer y los extraterrestres "
"aparecieron en las calles. Fue de suerte que lograste sobrevivir sana y "
"salva, y lo peor todavía está por suceder."

#. ~ Profession (male Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Alguna vez dominaste las rutas con tu gran camión. Cuando comenzaron los "
"bombardeos, te subiste y manejaste hacia un lugar seguro. Ahora, solo estás "
"vos y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Profession (female Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Alguna vez dominaste las rutas con tu gran camión. Cuando comenzaron los "
"bombardeos, te subiste y manejaste hacia un lugar seguro. Ahora, solo estás "
"vos y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Profession (male Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo terminó cuando los extraterrestres invadieron la "
"pista. El referí fue reventado así que no estás seguro si las reglas se "
"siguen respetando."

#. ~ Profession (female Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima "
"pero tu último torneo terminó cuando los extraterrestres invadieron la "
"pista. El referí fue reventado así que no estás seguro si las reglas se "
"siguen respetando."

#. ~ Profession (male Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida agradándole a la gente, persuadiéndolos y prometiendo "
"mucho todo el tiempo en tu oficina. Ahora que tu base de votantes está "
"muerta o peor y hay fuerzas hostiles en el medio del país, ganar sus "
"corazones y mentes se ha puesto mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Profession (female Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Te pasaste la vida agradándole a la gente, persuadiéndolos y prometiendo "
"mucho todo el tiempo en tu oficina. Ahora que tu base de votantes está "
"muerta o peor y hay fuerzas hostiles en el medio del país, ganar sus "
"corazones y mentes se ha puesto mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Profession (male Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegado para realizar la autopsia de uno de los extraterrestres. "
"Cuando sus amigos aparecieron, te diste cuenta que esto estaba fuera del "
"alcance de tu trabajo."

#. ~ Profession (female Hazmat Unit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the aliens after it was put down.  When "
"their friends showed up in force, you knew this was out of your job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste desplegada para realizar la autopsia de uno de los extraterrestres. "
"Cuando sus amigos aparecieron, te diste cuenta que esto estaba fuera del "
"alcance de tu trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Flamethrower Operator"
msgstr "Operador Militar de Lanzallamas"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Flamethrower Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain alien invasive "
"species through judicious use of fire.  After getting separated from your "
"squad, your priorities have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"Como respuesta al brote, fuiste desplegado para contener las especies "
"invasivas extraterrestres con un sensato uso del fuego. Después de quedar "
"separado de tu equipo, tus prioridades han cambiado hacia la supervivencia "
"básica."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Flamethrower Operator"
msgstr "Operadora Militar de Lanzallamas"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Flamethrower Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain alien invasive "
"species through judicious use of fire.  After getting separated from your "
"squad, your priorities have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"Como respuesta al brote, fuiste desplegada para contener las especies "
"invasivas extraterrestres con un sensato uso del fuego. Después de quedar "
"separada de tu equipo, tus prioridades han cambiado hacia la supervivencia "
"básica."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Non Commissioned Officer"
msgstr "Suboficial"

#. ~ Profession (male Non Commissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"they've been blasted to pieces by the alien and you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"Sos veterano de varias misiones de paz. Lideraste tu pelotón como una "
"especie de figura paterna, ofreciendo consejos sobre cómo no morir. Ahora ya"
" han sido reventados en pedacitos por los extraterrestres y estás solo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Non Commissioned Officer"
msgstr "Suboficial"

#. ~ Profession (female Non Commissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"they've been blasted to pieces by the alien and you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"Sos veterana de varias misiones de paz. Lideraste tu pelotón como una "
"especie de figura materna, ofreciendo consejos sobre cómo no morir. Ahora ya"
" han sido reventados en pedacitos por los extraterrestres y estás sola."

#. ~ Profession (male Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the aliens.  As far as you"
" can tell, you're one of the last active operators in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Eras el mejor de los mejores, el militar de mayor calidad. Por eso todavía "
"estás vivo, incluso cuando todos tus camaradas cayeron ante los "
"extraterrestres. Por lo que sabés, sos el único de los últimos operadores "
"activos en este infierno."

#. ~ Profession (female Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the aliens.  As far as you"
" can tell, you're one of the last active operators in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Eras la mejor de las mejores, la militar de mayor calidad. Por eso todavía "
"estás viva, incluso cuando todos tus camaradas cayeron ante los "
"extraterrestres. Por lo que sabés, sos la única de los últimos operadores "
"activos en este infierno."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Rifleman"
msgstr "Riflero Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Frontline infantry, frontline infantry, frontline infantry, frontline "
"infantry."
msgstr ""
"Primera línea de infantería, primera línea de infantería, primera línea de "
"infantería, primera línea de infantería."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Rifleman"
msgstr "Riflera Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Frontline infantry, frontline infantry, frontline infantry, frontline "
"infantry."
msgstr ""
"Primera línea de infantería, primera línea de infantería, primera línea de "
"infantería, primera línea de infantería."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Marksman"
msgstr "Francotirador Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Marksman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You like to think you're a real sniper, but really you're just infantry with"
" a bigger gun."
msgstr ""
"Te gusta pensar que sos un verdadera francotirador, pero realmente solo sos "
"alguien de infantería con un arma más grande."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Marksman"
msgstr "Francotiradora Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Marksman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You like to think you're a real sniper, but really you're just infantry with"
" a bigger gun."
msgstr ""
"Te gusta pensar que sos una verdadera francotiradora, pero realmente solo "
"sos alguien de infantería con un arma más grande."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Automatic Rifleman"
msgstr "Riflero Automático Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Automatic Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "S stands for suppressing fire!"
msgstr "¡La S es por el disparo de Supresión!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Automatic Rifleman"
msgstr "Riflera Automático Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Automatic Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
