"de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora, todo se fue al infierno, ya no podés hacer tu "
"podcast diario y los muertos vivos que escuchan tus sermones no parecen "
"particularmente conmovidos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "Nigromante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Necromancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te tuviste que esconder en tu magia, porque generalmente no era un "
"tipo de magia aceptable en el mundo de los magos, pero con el Cataclismo vas"
" a necesitar todos los trucos del libro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "Nigromante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Necromancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te tuviste que esconder en tu magia, porque generalmente no era un "
"tipo de magia aceptable en el mundo de los magos, pero con el Cataclismo vas"
" a necesitar todos los trucos del libro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "Tormentaformante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Stormshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"El hijo del señor meteorólogo, siempre estuviste interesado en la clima. "
"¡Recientemente encontraste que era posible manipular el clima a través de "
"medios arcanos! Lamentablemente, no pudiste disfrutar mucho tiempo tu poder,"
" ya que los eventos se fueron desarrollando…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "Tormentaformante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Stormshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"La hija del señor meteorólogo, siempre estuviste interesada en la clima. "
"¡Recientemente encontraste que era posible manipular el clima a través de "
"medios arcanos! Lamentablemente, no pudiste disfrutar mucho tiempo tu poder,"
" ya que los eventos se fueron desarrollando…"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Earthshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste resistente en las peleas. Tu entrenador logró enseñarte un "
"par de trucos para hacerte un poco más resistente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Earthshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste resistente en las peleas. Tu entrenador logró enseñarte un "
"par de trucos para hacerte un poco más resistente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Technomancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""
"Con el Cataclismo reciente, esa manera que encontraste para hacer trampa en "
"los exámenes ahora puede tener otro uso."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Technomancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""
"Con el Cataclismo reciente, esa manera que encontraste para hacer trampa en "
"los exámenes ahora puede tener otro uso."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Introspectionist"
msgstr "Introspeccionista"

#. ~ Profession (male Introspectionist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse"
" won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"Te segregaste de la sociedad porque querías concentrarte en mejorarte. Eran "
"vos y tu mejor amigo, pero ahora el apocalipsis no te va a dejar solo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Introspectionist"
msgstr "Introspeccionista"

#. ~ Profession (female Introspectionist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse"
" won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"Te segregaste de la sociedad porque querías concentrarte en mejorarte. Eran "
"vos y tu mejor amigo, pero ahora el apocalipsis no te va a dejar sola."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vengeful Preacher"
msgstr "Pastor Vengativo"

#. ~ Profession (male Vengeful Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Perdiste tu fe cuando tu esposa murió de una enfermedad. Desde entonces, has"
" estado tomando alcohol como si quisieras morir. Dios está castigando a "
"todos con este apocalipsis, vos vas a demostrarles tu estilo de "
"misericordia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Vengeful Preacher"
msgstr "Pastora Vengativa"

#. ~ Profession (female Vengeful Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Perdiste tu fe cuando tu esposo murió de una enfermedad. Desde entonces, has"
" estado tomando alcohol como si quisieras morir. Dios está castigando a "
"todos con este apocalipsis, vos vas a demostrarles tu marca de merced."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Techno-Prepper"
msgstr "Tecno-Survivalista"

#. ~ Profession (male Techno-Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""
"Ya venías sospechando de hace tiempo que el mundo podía terminarse de "
"repente. Con tu entrenamiento, hechizos y revólver, tus probabilidades son "
"mucho mejores que las de la mayoría."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Techno-Prepper"
msgstr "Tecno-Survivalista"

#. ~ Profession (female Techno-Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""
"Ya venías sospechando de hace tiempo que el mundo podía terminarse de "
