"mucho mejores que las de la mayoría."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Pseudovamp"
msgstr "Pseudovampiro Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Pseudovamp) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tuviste una obsesión con las novelas de terror y usaste tu fortuna "
"para mejorarte con hechizos y biónicos para hacerte un morador de la noche. "
"El abandono de tu salud en tu búsqueda te ha dejado pálido y desanimado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Pseudovamp"
msgstr "Pseudovampiresa Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Pseudovamp) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tuviste una obsesión con las novelas de terror y usaste tu fortuna "
"para mejorarte con hechizos y biónicos para hacerte una moradora de la "
"noche. El abandono de tu salud en tu búsqueda te ha dejado pálida y "
"desanimada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Academy Wizard"
msgstr "Mago de Academia"

#. ~ Profession (male Academy Wizard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead"
" and classes cancelled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr ""
"Un año de enrolamiento en la academia de magos te ha enseñado paciencia, "
"sabiduría y un puñado de hechizos útiles. Con los maestros convertidos en "
"muertos vivos y las clases suspendidas, la lección final ha comenzado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Academy Wizard"
msgstr "Maga de Academia"

#. ~ Profession (female Academy Wizard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead"
