" máquina imparable de trompadas. Ahora que todos tus oponentes son muertos "
"vivos, no hay necesidad de que te guardes nada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Illicit Fleshmender"
msgstr "Arreglacarne Ilícito"

#. ~ Profession (male Illicit Fleshmender) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and "
"combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to "
"kill you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr ""
"Después de fracasar en la facultad de medicina, tomaste sus métodos mundanos"
" y los combinaste con magia para salvar a tus pacientes. Ahora que todos te "
"quieren matar, la falta de licencia es la menor de tus preocupaciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Illicit Fleshmender"
msgstr "Arreglacarne Ilícita"

#. ~ Profession (female Illicit Fleshmender) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
