"quieren matar, la falta de licencia es la menor de tus preocupaciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wildborne Rider"
msgstr "Jinete Salvaje"

#. ~ Profession (male Wildborne Rider) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to"
" survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are "
"no stranger to hardship."
msgstr ""
"Abandonado a una joven edad y criado por alces, tuviste que dominar la vida "
"salvaje para sobrevivir. Aunque el mundo moderno ha sido devorado, vos y tu "
"corcel están acostumbrados a la adversidad."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wildborne Rider"
msgstr "Jinete Salvaje"

#. ~ Profession (female Wildborne Rider) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to"
" survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are "
