"A wood stove, counter, and some pots and pans in the south half of the "
"central building will allow us to cook simple recipes and organize hunting "
"expeditions.  The stove will be more efficient than a fireplace."
msgstr ""
"Un horno a leña, mesada y algunas ollas y sartenes en la mitad sur del "
"edificio central nos permitirá cocinar recetas simples y organizar "
"expediciones de caza. La cocina será más eficiente que la chimenea."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "south wood stove"
msgstr "horno a leña sur"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Digging a well will give us easy access to water."
msgstr "Cavar un pozo nos dará fácil acceso al agua."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north water well"
msgstr "pozo de agua norte"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Digging a root cellar will give us a way to preserve food."
msgstr ""
"Cavar una bodega de alimentos nos dará una manera de preservar la comida."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north root cellar"
msgstr "bodega de alimentos norte"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We could build a radio tower to improve the range of our radios."
msgstr ""
"Podríamos construir una torre de radio para mejorar el rango de nuestras "
"radios."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north radio tower"
msgstr "torre de radio norte"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Adding a console to control the radio tower will help with recruiting more "
"survivors."
msgstr ""
"Agregar una consola para controlar la torre de radio nos ayudará a reclutar "
"más sobrevivientes."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north radio console"
msgstr "consola de radio norte"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Digging a trench along the north edge of the camp would provide some defense"
" and generate building materials."
msgstr ""
"Cavar una trinchera por la frontera norte del campamento nos brindará algo "
"de defensa y nos dará materiales de construcción."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "north trench"
msgstr "trinchera norte"

