#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - Island Prison' for a male
#. character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were in a high-security prison right before the Cataclysm.  "
"Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how to escape."
"  It's located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need to escape "
"that also."
msgstr ""
"Estabas en una cárcel de alta seguridad justo antes de que suceda el "
"Cataclismo. Lamentablemente, todavía estás ahí así que vas a tener que "
"encontrar la manera de escaparte. Encima está ubicada en una isla remota y "
"eventualmente tendrás que escapar de ahí también."

