#. ~ Description for scenario 'The Mascot Rises' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just finished your shift and got back in the break room when you heard "
"the alarms and the security door shutting down behind you.  There's a lot of"
" customers out there and you're not sure Foodplace's delicious food™ is "
"going to be enough for them."
msgstr ""
"Acabás de terminar tu turno y volviste a la sala de descanso cuando "
"escuchaste las alarmas y la puerta de seguridad cerrándose atrás tuyo. Hay "
"muchos clientes ahí afuera y no estás seguro que la deliciosa comida™ de "
"Foodplace va a ser suficiente para ellos."

