msgstr "Pasame un poco de etanol, necesito alimentar mi quemador de etanol."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Waiter!  I need a refill, my ethanol burner is running out of charge!"
msgstr ""
"¡Mozo! ¡Necesito una carga, mi quemador de etanol se está quedando vacío!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I require ethanol for my internal power supply.  Anything on you?"
msgstr ""
"Necesito etanol para mi alimentación interna de energía. ¿Tendrás un poco?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need some ethanol to power up my CBMs."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Got any alcohol to spare?  Need to recharge my drives.  Methanol, would do."
msgstr ""
"¿Tenés un poco de alcohol para prestarme? Necesito recargar mis discos. "
"Metanol serviría."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need some junk to power my internal furnace."
msgstr "Necesito un poco de basura para alimentar mi horno interno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I can't recharge my CBMs without some firewood for my internal furnace."
msgstr "No puedo recargar mi MCB sin algo de leña para mi horno interno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need something to use as fuel for my furnace."
msgstr "Necesito algo que pueda usar como combustible para mi horno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need something to burn for my furnace.  Can you help?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Hey, <name_g>, can I get some waste paper or withered plants?  I need to "
"recharge."
msgstr ""
"Hey, <name_g>, ¿me podés dar algo de papel o plantas marchitas? Necesito "
"recargar."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need some fuel to power my bionics."
msgstr "Necesito algo de combustible para alimentar mis biónicos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I can't recharge my CBMs without some fuel."
msgstr "No puedo recargar mi MCB sin algo de combustible."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Could I get some fuel for my bionics?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I need more fuel.  Can you help me out here?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, can I get some fuel?  I need to recharge."
msgstr ""
"Hey, <name_g>, ¿me podés dar algo de combustible? Necesito recargarme."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm saying this, but I need radioactive plutonium slurry for"
" my internal reactor."
msgstr ""
"No puedo creer que esté diciendo esto pero necesito pulpa de plutonio "
"radiactivo para mi reactor interno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I can't use my internal reactor to recharge my CBMs without some plutonium "
"slurry."
msgstr ""
"No puedo usar mi reactor interno para recargar mi MCB sin un poco de pulpa "
"de plutonio."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Hey, <name_g>, pass me some plutonium slurry if you have any, I need to "
"refuel my internal reactor."
msgstr ""
"Hey, <name_g>, pasame un poco de pulpa de plutonio si tenés que necesito "
"alimentar mi reactor interno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Beta radiation can be blocked by clothing, but is really dangerous if you "
"ingest it.  So can I have some plutonium slurry to power my reactor and give"
" me cancer?"
msgstr ""
"La radiación beta puede ser frenada por la ropa, pero es realmente peligrosa"
" si la ingerís. Así que ¿me podrías dar un poco de pulpa de plutonio para "
"alimentar mi reactor y darme cancer?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I need some radioactive slurry to power my reactor.  Or a less dangerous "
"power source, that would be even better!"
msgstr ""
"Necesito algo de pulpa de plutonio para alimentar mi reactor. ¡O algún "
"suministro menos peligroso sería incluso mejor!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Please, <name_g>, get me some radioactive slurry to fuel my internal "
"reactor.  Or get me another way to recharge my CBMs!"
msgstr ""
"Por favor, <name_g>, dame algo de pulpa radiactiva para alimentar mi reactor"
" interno. ¡O conseguime otra manera de recargar mi MCB!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I can't use my internal reactor to recharge my CBMs without some plutonium "
"slurry.  Which wouldn't be a problem if I had anything else that would "
"recharge my CBMs!"
msgstr ""
"No puedo usar mi reactor interno para recargar mi MCB sin algo de pulpa de "
"plutonio. ¡Que no sería un problema si tuviera otra cosa que pueda recargar "
"mi MCB!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I sure could use a highly radioactive slurry shake for my power supply right"
" now."
msgstr ""
"Seguro que me vendría bien un licuado de pulpa altamente radiactiva para mi "
"suministro de energía en este momento."

