#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy "
"texture, but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and "
"formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair "
"crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  Still,"
" it seems digestible at least, if you cook it and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"Es la carne de un animal muy mutado. Tiene una textura perturbadoramente "
"floja y esponjosa, pero el olor… es casi normal. Tiene extraños nudos y "
"formaciones que no parece nada naturales: pedazos de hueso y pelo "
"incrustados en el músculo, como si intentaran formar otro organismo. De "
"todas maneras, para digerible, si lo cocinás y le sacás las peores partes."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it"
" has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a "
"knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr ""
"Es carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque es de tejido muscular, tiene un "
"curioso patrón de grano en remolino y en el centro de cada grano tiene un "
"nudo de tejido cartilaginoso y duro. Tiene un olor repelente."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial"
" tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, "
"cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Es carne de un animal muy mutado. Es de un músculo pero en el tejido fascial"
" entre los músculos tiene pelos gruesos y espinosos crecidos. Tiene un olor "
"nauseabundo, y un fluido de color crema le chorrea cada vez que un pelo se "
"sale."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has "
"a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr ""
"Es carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque es del músculo, tiene una textura "
"gruesa como una soga y huele a cuero y moho de pan."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling,"
" spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you got all"
" the bits of hair and bone out…"
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo cocinado de carne de un animal mutante. Tiene una textura "
"perturbadoramente esponjosa, pero el gusto... es bastante normal. Con "
"suerte, ya le pudiste sacar todos los pedazos de pelo y hueso..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac "
"inside burst and covered it in some kind of thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un pedazo cocinado de carne de un animal mutado. Pensás que ya "
"sacaste las partes desagradables pero cuando lo cocinabas, un saco lleno de "
"fluido de su interior explotó y lo cubrió en alguna clase de grasa espesa."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  The surface is "
"peppered with divots from the pieces you had to dig out to make it seem "
"edible."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un pedazo cocinado de carne de un animal mutado. La superficie está "
"salpicada de agujeros por los pedazos que le tuviste que sacar para hacerlo "
"comestible."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  Heat caused the "
"muscles to twist and move as if they were alive, and now it has writhed "
"itself into a dense knot."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un pedazo cocinado de carne de un animal mutado. El calor ha causado"
" que los músculos se retuerzan y se muevan como si estuvieran vivos, y ahora"
" se han apretujado sobre sí mismos como un nudo denso."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug, and you really aren't sure what "
"to make of them.  There are things you've never seen in any anatomy book, "
"with spines and hair and other unidentified parts protruding seemingly at "
"random."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos son de un insecto gigante mutante, y realmente no sabés qué "
"pensar de esto. Hay cosas que nunca viste en un libro de anatomía, con "
"columnas vertebrales y pelo y otras partes desconocidas sobresaliendo de "
"manera aleatoria."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug.  They have a sickly green color, "
"and one of them ripped when you were removing it, revealing an inner surface"
" that looks like row upon row of human fingers, nails and all."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos son de un insecto gigante mutante. Tiene un color verde "
"enfermizo y uno de ellos se rompió cuando lo estabas sacando, revelando una "
"superficie interna que parece como una hilera sobre otra de dedos humanos, "
"con uñas y todo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge, thick, fleshy sac you removed from a giant mutant bug.  The "
"surface is covered in smooth, soft skin, and beneath it is a coiled, twisted"
" mess of cordlike tissue."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un saco grande, duro y carnoso que le sacaste a un insecto gigante "
"mutante. La superficie está recubierta de una piel suave y lisa, y debajo "
"tiene un tejido espiralado y retorcido como una soga."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a long, corded organ you removed from a giant mutant bug.  It ran "
"from the head to the abdomen and has long tendrils coming off it, not unlike"
" a spinal cord."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un órgano largo y como una cuerda que le sacaste a un insecto "
"gigante mutante. Iba desde la cabeza hasta el abdomen y tiene largos "
"zarcillos sobresaliendo, parecido a una médula espinal."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a meaty grey organ you removed from a mutant.  It has a chalky "
"yellow coating that burns your skin, and several unidentifiable fleshy tubes"
" sticking out of it.  The smell it gives off stings your nostrils.  You're "
"pretty confident no natural creature has one of these."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un órgano carnoso gris que le sacaste a un mutante. Tiene una "
"cobertura blancuzca amarillenta que te quema la piel, y varios tubos "
"carnosos desconocidos saliendo de ella. El olor que tiene te hace picar la "
"nariz. Estás bastante convencido de que no hay criatura natural con algo "
"así."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This organ meat, retrieved from a mutated creature, looks like a series of "
"small mammalian hearts arranged in series on a long fleshy tube.  At the end"
" of the chain is a large fleshy sac resembling a stomach."
msgstr ""
"Este órgano de carne, sacado de una criatura mutada, parece una serie de "
"pequeños corazones de mamífero puestos en serie en un tubo largo y carnoso. "
"Al final de la cadena tiene un saco carnoso grande que parece un estómago."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It looks like a lung from a larger "
"mammal, like a dog, but instead of a few distinct lobes, it has dozens of "
"lobes arranged in sheets.  Strange spindles and gnarled tumescences dot the "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro que esto es tejido pulmonar. Parece el pulmón de un "
"mamífero grande, como un perro, pero en lugar de unos lóbulos distinguibles,"
" tiene docenas de lóbulos dispuestos en láminas. Tiene unos extraños ejes e "
"hinchazones retorcidos por la superficie."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It has a vaguely wing-like shape, "
"with a series of nodules around what would be the trailing edge of the "
"'wing'.  A cluster of quills in each corner of the organ held it to the "
"bug's carapace like clasps."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro que esto es tejido pulmonar. Tiene vagamente la forma "
"de un ala con una serie de nódulos alrededor de lo que sería el borde "
"trasero del 'ala'. Un grupo de plumas en cada esquina del órgano se agarran "
"a la caparazón del insecto como broches."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton, but mutated.  The inner side is lined with "
"veins and strange, hooked protuberances."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de exoesqueleto de un insecto, pero mutado. La parte interior "
"tiene venas y unas extrañas protuberancias como ganchos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton.  Stringy lines of nervous tissue and blood "
"vessels still cling to the inner surface."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de exoesqueleto. Un tejido de nervios con líneas fibrosas y "
"vasos sanguíneos todavía cuelgan de la superficie interior."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of rigid, tube-shaped chitin from the inside of a giant bug.  It "
"seemed to be performing some kind of support role.  You're quite sure normal"
" insects don't have these."
msgstr ""
"Es un pedazo de quitina rígida con forma de tubo que procede del interior de"
" un insecto gigante. Parece tener alguna función de apoyo. Estás bastante "
"seguro que los insectos normales no tienen de estos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long, flexible rod of chitin from inside a giant mutant bug.  It is laced "
"with blood vessels and chitinous nodules."
msgstr ""
"Es una vara larga y flexible de quitina que procede del interior de un "
"insecto gigante mutante. Está lleno de vasos sanguíneos y nódulos "
"quitinosos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you peel away the outer shell, you find veins lining the chitin plates"
msgstr ""
"Cuando vas sacando la caparazón exterior encontrás venas en las placas de "
"quitina"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr ""
"Con la criatura muerta su caparazón se sale con una facilidad "
"sorprendentemente"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's a thin membrane, much like skin, spread over the chitin of this "
"creature"
msgstr ""
"Hay una membrana delgada, parecida a piel, estirada sobre la quitina de esta"
" criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la caparazón de este mutante hay un material rasposo similar al "
"velcro"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The anatomy concealed beneath seems almost like a small mammal given a shell"
" and twisted into the shape of an arthropod"
msgstr ""
"La anatomía oculta debajo parece casi como la de un mamífero pequeño con "
"caparazón y retorcido en forma de artrópodo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You crack the beast open like a horrific lobster"
msgstr "Partís la bestia y la abrís como una langosta horrorífica"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chitin holds tight to the creature, and you need to snap and tear it "
"away, sawing at tough fibers beneath"
msgstr ""
"La quitina se mantiene firme a la criatura y necesitás romperla y "
"arrancarla, cortando las fibras resistentes que tiene debajo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The moment you start cutting into the corpse, a few of what you thought were"
" extra legs detach and scurry off into the undergrowth"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que empezás a cortar el cadáver, algunas de lo que pensaste"
" que eran patas se sueltan y se escabullen rápido por el sotobosque."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, "
"only to reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr ""
"Con tu primer corte conectás la docena de aberturas en los costados de la "
"criatura, solo para revelar una larva del tamaño de un dedo retorciéndose de"
" cada lado."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your work disturbs the parasites still clinging to the joints of the "
"creature, and a few size you up as a potential new home before scurrying "
"away"
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo molesta los parásitos que todavía se aferran a las articulaciones"
" de la criatura, y algunos te observan como un potencial nuevo hogar antes "
"de escabullirse."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Spaced evenly across the entire body you find small sacs of eggs in "
"different stages of growth"
msgstr ""
"Dispersas a distancias equitativas por el cuerpo entero, encontrás pequeños "
"sacos de huevos en diferentes etapas de crecimiento."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its intestines grew into a labyrinthine tangle, like so many worms devouring"
" each other"
msgstr ""
"Sus intestinos crecieron en una maraña laberíntica, como muchos gusanos "
"devorándose entre ellos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside, half-formed organs press against spongy meat that doesn't look "
"anything like raw arthropod meat from normal creatures"
msgstr ""
"Adentro, unos órganos a medio formar apretados contra una carne esponjosa no"
" se parecen en nada a la carne cruda de artrópodo de las criaturas normales"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Beneath, you find a collection of hooked spines that seem to have been "
"clasping it on somehow"
msgstr ""
"Debajo, encontrás una colección de espinas ganchudas que parecen haber "
"estado enganchadas de alguna manera"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside is a complex, still-squirming mess of strange appendages and organs "
"that bear only a passing resemblance to any natural creature"
msgstr ""
"Adentro hay un lío complejo que todavía se retuerce de extraños apéndices y "
"órganos que tienen solo una leve similitud a cualquier criatura natural"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Beneath the chitin, the meat is covered in thick, bristly hair hiding a "
"chaotic bramble of half-formed, mutated organs"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina, la carne está recubierta de pelos gruesos y "
"puntiagudos que esconden lo que parece un matorral de órganos mutados y a "
"medio formar"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside is a tangled mess of organs and tissues that do not appear entirely "
"natural"
msgstr ""
"Adentro tiene un lío enredado de órganos y tejidos que no parecen ser "
"completamente naturales"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside the creature you find lungs, hearts, and intestines more like a "
"mammal than a giant bug"
msgstr ""
"Adentro de la criatura encontrás pulmones, corazones e intestinos que se "
"parecen más a los de un mamífero que a los de un insecto gigante"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite the apparent death of the whole, some organs still pump, beat, and "
"churn on undisturbed"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The meat inside gives off a horrifying stench, and seems to be covered in "
"thin damp hair, like a newborn animal gone horribly wrong"
msgstr ""
"La carne interior libera un hedor horripilante y parece estar recubierta de "
"un pelo fino y húmedo como un animal recién nacido que salió espantosamente "
"mal"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small bundles of fiber break loose as you work, splitting open to reveal "
"twisted, half-formed copies of the creature itself"
msgstr ""
"Pequeños grupos de fibra se van rompiendo mientras trabajás, partiéndolo "
"para revelar copias de la misma criatura retorcidas y a medio formar"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It is difficult to work, as the spongey tissue tears apart under your tools"
msgstr ""
"Es difícil de trabajar porque el tejido esponjoso se rompe con tus "
"herramientas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite its outward appearance, both the organs and the endolymph of this "
"creature is pristinely white"
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su apariencia exterior, los dos órganos y la endolinfa de esta "
"criatura son de un blanco prístino."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of your cuts meet nerves, and the already stiff corpse shudders with "
"movement each time"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de tus cortes alcanzan nervios y el cuerpo ya rígido tiembla "
"moviéndose cada vez que lo hacés."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You follow what you think are superflous veins into the deep, finding a "
"gorged, tick-like creature at their convergence"
msgstr ""
"Seguís lo que te parece que son venas superfluas hasta lo profundo, "
"encontrando una criatura similar a una garrapata atiborrada en su "
"convergencia."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every cut reveals an organ you can't quite recognize, and you start to "
"wonder what your insides look like by now"
msgstr ""
"Cada corte revela un órgano que no podés reconocer, y empezás a preguntarte "
"cómo se verá tu interior ahora."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are dizzied by the rainbow coloration of the creature's muscles, "
"clashing with the bloody mess in its guts"
msgstr ""
"Estás mareado por la coloración del arcoiris de los músculos de la criatura,"
" chocando con el quilombo sangriento en sus tripas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut into its flesh you are disturbed by its sickly-sweet smell, like "
"fermenting fruit"
msgstr ""
"Mientras cortás su carne te molesta si olor dulce y enfermizo, como fruta "
"fermentando."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There are fist-sized globs of nervous tissue dotted about its insides, "
"sending the corpse into a spasm every time you touch one"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The muscles grow stiff, and begin leaking a dark gray liquid that pools "
"around your feet"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Its legs contain no muscles, just sinews hanging in yellow-green ichor"
msgstr ""
"Sus patas no tienen músculos, solamente tendones colgando con un icor "
"amarillo y verdoso"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The legs fall off easily, leaving the main body looking like an armored worm"
msgstr ""
"las patas se caen fácilmente, dejando el cuerpo como si fuera un gusano con "
"armadura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each pair of legs is slightly different.  These end in hooks, the next in "
"talons like a bird's, there's a pair of chitinous tentacles"
msgstr ""
"Cada par de patas es un poco distinta. Estas terminan en ganchos, las "
"siguientes en garras como las de los pájaros, ahí hay un par de tentáculos "
"quitinosos"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The mandibles keep snapping, and acrid-smelling venom wets the soil.  You "
"decide to begin your work at its tail"
msgstr ""
"Las mandíbulas siguen cerrándose de golpe y un veneno de olor acre humedece "
"el suelo. Decidís empezar a trabajar por la cola"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're startled as its antenna whips out and briefly coils around your arm"
msgstr ""
"Te sorprendés cuando la antena da un latigazo y se enrolla brevemente en tu "
"brazo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much "
"harder than the rest"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la superficie, hay unas placas chicas de quitina esparcidas, mucho"
" más duras que el resto"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On its tail end the segments get smaller and smaller, until they terminate "
"in a small copy of the head, looking backwards"
msgstr ""
"En la parte de la cola, los segmentos se van haciendo cada vez más pequeños,"
" hasta que terminan en casi una copia de su cabeza pero mirando hacia atrás"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chitin of the head is caked in old blood and lymph of its previous "
"victims"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de la cabeza está cubierta de sangre y linfa viejas de sus "
"víctimas anteriores"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find vacuoles filled with its venom in the most unexpected nooks, "
"forcing you to work carefully"
msgstr ""
"Encontrás vacuolas llenas con su veneno en la mayoría de los rincones, "
"obligándote a trabajar con cuidado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The indescribable stench of the remains of its last meal make you question "
"your decision to butcher it"
msgstr ""
"La baranda indescriptible de los restos de su última cena te hacen "
"cuestionar tu decisión de carnearlo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On some organs you see the same swollen ulcers as around your own wounds.  "
"It seems not all of it is venom-proof"
msgstr ""
"En algunos órganos ves las mismas úlceras hinchadas de alrededor de tus "
"heridas. Parece que no es todo resistente al veneno"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one's very blood stinks like its venom, and even the slightest drop "
"makes your skin itch"
msgstr ""
"La misma sangre de esta criatura apesta como su veneno, e incluso la menor "
"gota te hace picar la piel"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is order to the chaos in this one.  Each segment's insides is a "
"perfect copy of the last, down to each sinew"
msgstr ""
"Hay un orden en el caos de esta criatura. El interior de cada segmento es "
"una copia perfecta de la anterior, hasta cada tendón"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one smells disturbingly appetizing, like a memory of a childhood meal "
"whose details you forgot"
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura tiene un olor inquietantemente apetitoso, como el recuerdo de "
"una comida de tu niñez cuyos detalles has olvidado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have "
"disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched "
"siblings, unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr ""
"Para cuando llegás a la parte posterior de la matriarca, la mayoría de sus "
"crías han desaparecido en el pasto. Algunos quedaron agarrados alimentándose"
" de sus hermanos que no salieron del cascarón, decididos a no dejar pasar la"
" oportunidad de una comida fácil hasta el último momento"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The moment the matriarch grows still, the last third of its body flops to "
"the ground, letting go of dozens of eggs and small centipedes"
msgstr ""
"El momento en que la matriarca quedó en silencio, el último tercio de su "
"cuerpo se desplomó al suelo, dejando salir docenas de huevos y pequeños "
"ciempiés"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After cleaning away the rotten meat and mess of eggs shrouding the "
"matriarch's hind segments, you find its carapace chewed open, and much of "
"its flesh already eaten by its ever-hungry young"
msgstr ""
"Después de limpiar la carne y los huevos podridos que cubren los segmentos "
"ocultos de la matriarca, encontrás su caparazón mordida, y buena parte de su"
" carne ya estaba comida por sus crías siempre hambrientas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As if they noticed the death of their mother, the dozens of centipedes still"
" clinging to it attack each other with a sudden frenzy.  You decide to give "
"them time to disperse before continuing"
msgstr ""
"Como si hubieran notado la muerte de su madre, las docenas de ciempiés que "
"todavía están prendidos es atacan entre sí con un frenesí repentino. Decidís"
" darles tiempo para que se dispersen antes de continuar"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Since your tools barely have purchase on its carapace you decide to dig the "
"meat and viscera out from your first cut.  At times, you disappear up to "
"your waist in its armored insides"
msgstr ""
"Como tus herramientas apenas han hecho algo en su caparazón, decidís cavar "
"en la carne y las vísceras desde tu primer corte. Por momentos, te metés "
"hasta la cintura en su interior"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut more and more meat away, some of the resilient chitin plates fall"
" away with a loud squelch"
msgstr ""
"Mientras vas cortando más carne, algunas placas de quitina caen con un "
"fuerte chapoteo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"To bypass the armor you had to start your work by its mandibles, inches away"
" from its venom-coated fangs and the remains of chitin, bones, and strands "
"of Kevlar stuck between their points"
msgstr ""
"Para evitar la armadura tenés que empezar tu trabajo por sus mandíbulas, a "
"centímetros de sus colmillos cubiertos de veneno y los restos de quitina, "
"hueso y pedazos de kevlar trabados en sus puntas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This feels more like scrapping a car than butchering an animal.  Instead of "
"veins and legs you find yourself thinking about joints, panels, and cabling"
msgstr ""
"Esto se parece más a desarmar un auto que a carnear un animal. En lugar de "
"venas y patas, te descubrís pensando en juntas, paneles y cableados."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On closer inspection, the head's armor is pocked by finger-sized holes with "
"jagged edges, reminiscent of the creature's fangs"
msgstr ""
"Con una inspección más cercana ves que la armadura de la cabeza está llena "
"de agujeros del tamaño de dedos con los bordes dentados, un recuerdo de los "
"colmillos de la criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In a hidden organ without an obvious connection to the outside world, you "
"find a seemingly forgotten handful of glistening eggs"
msgstr ""
"En un órgano oculto sin una conexión obvia con el mundo exterior, encontrás "
"un puñado de huevos relucientes que parece olvidado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The wings of this creature break apart upon the slightest touch into myriad "
"identical rainbow crystals"
msgstr ""
"Las alas de esta criatura se rompen apenas las tocás en una innumerable "
"cantidad de cristales idénticos de arcoiris."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Even as the body grows still, the wings keep on beating slowly"
msgstr ""
"Incluso con el cuerpo quedando en silencio, las alas siguen batiendo "
"lentamente."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The chitin of this one is light and brittle, like an empty eggshell"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de esta es ligera y quebradiza, como una cáscara de huevo vacío."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a "
"web of hardened strands"
msgstr ""
"Donde esperabas encontrar quitina lisa, encontrás carne expuesta, con mechas"
" de telaraña de hilos endurecidos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You cough as you inhale the fine, colorful dust shedded from the wings"
msgstr ""
"Tosés cuando inhalás el polvo fino y colorido desprendido de las alas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The carapace of this one still feels hot to the touch, especially around the"
" wings"
msgstr ""
"La caparazón de esta todavía se siente caliente al tacto, especialmente "
"alrededor de las alas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in"
" reality, thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in "
"unison"
msgstr ""
"Lo que pensabas que era pelusa temblorosa de quitina en la espalda de la "
"criatura es en realidad miles de copias miniatura de sus alas principales, "
"aleteando al unísono."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The wings are held in place by stiff muscles, reaching into the deep"
msgstr ""
"Las alas están sujetas en su lugar por músculos rígidos, que se hunden "
"profundamente."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held "
"in place by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina encontrás bultos de perlas pequeñas y flotantes, cada "
"una sostenida en su lugar por un hilo solo de nervio."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Near its wings you find a black, bubbling organ still periodically emitting "
"a bundle of floating bubbles"
msgstr ""
"Cerca de sus alas encontrás un órgano negro y burbujeante que todavía emite "
"periódicamente un manojo de burbujas flotantes."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you open its intestines by mistake, you can barely pull your finger away "
"from the dozen snapping mandibles on its inside"
msgstr ""
"Mientras abrís sus intestinos por error, apenas si podés sacar tu dedo de la"
" docena de mandíbulas mordiendo en su interior."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The space not taken up by the now-familiar floating sacs is almost entirely "
"filled by a sticky, homogenous yellow jelly that seems to actively try to "
"avoid your knife"
msgstr ""
"El espacio no cubierto con los sacos flotantes que ya te son conocidos, está"
" casi completamente lleno de una gelatina pegajosa, amarilla y homogénea que"
" parece intentar activamente de esquivar tu cuchillo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The wings are rooted in its flesh by an almost transparent, fractal root "
"structure, making you question if it always belonged to the creature"
msgstr ""
"Las alas están enraizadas en su carne por una estructura transparente y "
"fractal, haciéndote preguntar si siempre pertenecieron a esta criatura."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The light of its abdomen flickers with each cut, growing ever dimmer"
msgstr "La luz de su abdomen titila con cada corte, haciéndose más tenue."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "An errant cut coats your tools with foul-smelling, glowing goop"
msgstr ""
"Un corte errante cubre tus herramientas con un pegote brillante de olor "
"nauseabundo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad "
"strands of glowing chitin criscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr ""
"Lo que veías como una luz homogénea desde la distancia era el resultado de "
"innumerables hilos de quitina brillante entrecruzándose debajo de la "
"caparazón."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one's very flesh is glowing with a blinding intensity, lighting up your"
" gruesome work"
msgstr ""
"La carne de esta está brillando con una intensidad enceguecedora, iluminando"
" tu repugnante trabajo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its chitin is sturdier than usual for the flying insects, and marked by the "
"struggles of its previous victims"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The stripes on the back of its abdomen are warped into a nauseating spiral "
"you can't tear your eyes away from"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Upon closer inspection, the uniform black stripes reveal themselves to be "
"rows upon rows of glistening eyes"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so "
"slightly towards your leg"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The stripes -so uniform at a distance- reveal themselves to be jagged, "
"strangely familiar patterns, like the cursive of an unknown language"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chaotic bundle of organs in its torso look much like those of other "
"mutated insects, but as you near the abdomen there's order to the madness: "
"comparatively neat rows of venom-filled glands, each feeding into a "
"reservoir at the base of the stinger"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You open a stomach, releasing a gush of sweet-smelling grey fluid"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knife reaches the retracted stinger and slips on its smooth surface, "
"opening half a dozen venom glands in the process.  You haven't cut yourself,"
" have you?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find a handful of dead grubs underneath its chitin, near a chewed-open "
"venom gland"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Deep, deep within the dead queen you find a smooth, brightly colored plaque "
"the size of your fingernail, reading <number><number>"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of the now-familiar venom glands also contain dozens of shiny white "
"eggs, undisturbed by their deadly surroundings"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut into its abdomen you disturb a handful of normal-sized, wingless "
"wasps clinging to a strange, tubular organ.  They crawl a few steps before "
"falling lifelessly to the ground"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of the egg clusters are ransacked by fat, white worms tunneling blindly"
" through its flesh"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Steaming puddles of acid spill from its outer shell as you pull it back"
msgstr ""
"Unos charcos de ácido humeante salen de su caparazón exterior a medida que "
"la vas arrancando"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Steaming acid burbles from the creature's chitin as you peel it back"
msgstr ""
"Un ácido burbujeante y humeante sale de la quitina de esta criatura a medida"
" que la vas desprendiendo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several acid glands rupture as you peel back the carapace, sending streams "
"of steaming caustic fluids spraying around"
msgstr ""
"Varias glándulas de ácido se rompen cuando desprendés la caparazón, haciendo"
" chorrear fluidos cáusticos y humeantes por todas partes"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The organs themselves have an acrid odour, but don't seem as caustically "
"acidic as the outer shell"
msgstr ""
"Los órganos mismos tienen un olor agrio pero no parecen tan cáusticos como "
"la caparazón exterior"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You carefully avoid breaking through pockets of what you think may be acid-"
"secreting glands"
msgstr ""
"Evitás cuidadosamente romper los bolsillos de lo que te parece que son "
"glándulas que segregan ácido"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick, ropey cords of tissue beneath its chitin protect an inner layer of "
"strange organs, resembling those of a bird more than anything"
msgstr ""
"Unas cuerdas gruesas de tejido debajo de su quitina protegen la capa "
"interior de órganos extraños, recordando a aquellos de los pájaros más que a"
" otra cosa"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The powerfully acidic vapors coming from the carcass make it hard to work"
msgstr ""
"Los potentes vapores ácidos que salen de esta carcasa te dificultan el "
"trabajo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The tissues of the creature are full of half-formed organs, their purpose "
"unclear"
msgstr ""
"Los tejidos de la criatura están llenos de órganos a medio formar, con un "
"propósito poco claro"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several times, you nearly burn yourself piercing a concealed gland full of "
"acid"
msgstr ""
"Casi te quemás varias veces por pinchar un glándula oculta llena de ácido"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The skin is so riddled with wounds that you barely need to cut to pull it "
"away."
msgstr ""
"La piel está tan agujereada por las heridas que apenas y necesitas cortarla "
"para sacarla."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The poor creature has stopped breathing, but there's still a lot of movement"
" in the corpse."
msgstr ""
"La pobre criatura ha dejado de respirar pero todavía hay mucho movimiento en"
" el cadáver."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The larvae seem to have taken care to leave enough intact not to kill their "
"host, but the rest is practically hollow."
msgstr ""
"Las larvas parece haberse encargado de dejar lo suficiente como para no "
"matar a su huésped, pero el resto está prácticamente vacío."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have to pause often to stomp on the slower grubs, who only now realized "
"that their home is growing cold."
msgstr ""
"Tenés que parar a veces para pisar las larvas más lentas, que recién ahora "
"se dan cuenta de que su hogar se está enfriando."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its stomach is full of grubs even more malformed than the rest.  The runt of"
" the litter got recycled, it seems."
msgstr ""
"Su estómago está lleno de larvas incluso más deformadas que el resto. Los "
"más pequeños de la camada parecen haber sido reciclados."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In the beginning you take care to separate parasite and host, but after a "
"while you give up and start cutting through."
msgstr ""
"Al principio, te encargás de separar los parásitos del huésped pero después "
"de un rato te das por vencido y empezás a cortar."

