msgstr "¡Es una verdad sintética a priori! ¡Immanuel estaría tan contento!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's an Internet chain letter about sodium laureth sulfate."
msgstr "Es una cadena de internet acerda del lauril éter sulfato de sodio."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's an autographed copy of \"Secondary Colors,\" by Bob Ross."
msgstr "Es una copia autografiada de \"Colores Secundarios\", de Bob Ross."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's an inverted billiard ball!"
msgstr "¡Es una bola de billar invertida!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's either a mirror, or another soulless kitten-seeking robot."
msgstr "O es un espejo u otro robot sin alma buscador de kitten."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the ASCII Floating Head of Seth David Schoen!"
msgstr "¡Es la Cabeza Flotante de Seth David Schoen en ASCII!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the Donation of Constantine!"
msgstr "¡Es la Detonación de Constantin!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the Tiki Room."
msgstr "Es la habitación Tiki."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the author of \"Randomness and Mathematical Proof\"."
msgstr "Es el autor de \"Aleatoriedad y Prueba Matemática\"."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the crusty exoskeleton of an arthropod!"
msgstr "¡Es el exoesqueleto crujiente de un artrópodo!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the embalmed corpse of Vladimir Lenin."
msgstr "Es el cuerpo embalsamado de Vladimir Lenin."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the handheld robotfindskitten game, by Tiger."
msgstr "Es el juego portátil robotencuentrakitten, de Tiger."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the phrase \"and her\", written in ancient Greek."
msgstr "Es la frase \"y ella\", escrita en griego antiguo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's the triangle leg adjacent to an angle divided by the leg opposite it."
msgstr ""
"Es el lado de un triángulo adyacente al ángulo dividido por el lado opuesto."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's this message, nothing more."
msgstr "Es este mensaje y nada más."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's your favorite game -- robotfindscatan!"
msgstr "¡Es tu juego favorito -- robotencuentracatan!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Judith Platt insults librarians."
msgstr "Judith Platt insulta a bibliotecarios."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just a broken hard drive containg the archives of Nerth Pork."
msgstr "Es un disco rígido roto que contiene los archivos de Nerth Pork."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just a man selling an albatross."
msgstr "Es un hombre vendiendo un albatros."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just a monitor with the blue element burnt out."
msgstr "Es un monitor con el elemento azul quemado."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just some old play by a Czech playwright, and you can't read Czech."
msgstr "Es una vieja obra de un dramaturgo checo, y no podés leer checo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just the empty husk of a locust."
msgstr "Es la cáscara vacía de una langosta."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Kitten is the letter 'Q'.  Oh, wait, maybe not."
msgstr "Kitten es la letra 'Q'. Ah, esperá, tal vez no."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Lysine, an essential amino acid.  Well, maybe not for robots."
msgstr "Lisina, un aminoácido esencial. Bueno, tal vez no para los robots."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Mr. Hooper is here, surfing."
msgstr "Acá está el Sr. Hooper, surfeando."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "No kitten here."
msgstr "Acá no está kitten."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "One person shouts \"What do we want?\" The crowd answers \"Free Dmitry!\""
msgstr "Una persona grita \"¿Qué queremos?\". La multitud contesta \"¡Dmitry libre!\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Preoccupation with finding kitten prevents you from investigating further."
msgstr "La preocupación por encontrar a kitten evita que sigas investigando."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Quidquid Latine dictum sit, kitten non est."
msgstr "Quidquid Latine dictum sit, kitten non est."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Robot should not be touching that."
msgstr "Robot no debería estar tocando eso."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Run away!  Run away!"
msgstr "¡Escapate! ¡Escapate!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Someone has written \"ad aerarium\" on the ground here."
msgstr "Alguien escribió \"ad aerarium\" acá en el suelo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Someone's identity disk lies here."
msgstr "El disco de identidad de alguien está tirado acá."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Something is written here in the dust.  You read: \"rJbotf ndQkttten\"."
msgstr "Acá hay algo escrito en el polvo. Leés: \"rJbot nc  ntrdQkttten\"."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Stimutacs."
msgstr "Stimutacs."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Sutro Tower is visible at some distance through the fog."
msgstr "La Torre Sutro se ve a cierta distancia a través de la niebla."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The Digital Millennium Copyright Act of 1998."
msgstr "La Ley de Derechos de Autor de la Era Digital de 1998."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The United States Court of Appeals for the Federal Circuit."
msgstr "La Corte de los Estados Unidos apela para el Circuito Federal."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The ghost of your dance instructor, his face a paper-white mask of evil."
msgstr ""
"El fantasma de tu maestro de danza, su cara es una máscara  de maldad blanca"
" como el papel."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The intermission from a 1930s silent movie."
msgstr "El entreacto de una película muda de los años 30."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The ionosphere seems charged with meaning."
msgstr "La ionosfera parece cargada con significado."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The non-kitten item bites!"
msgstr "¡El objeto no kitten te muerde!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The non-kitten item like this but with \"false\" and \"true\" switched is "
"true.\","
msgstr ""
"Al objeto no kitten le gusta esto pero con \"falso\" y \"verdadero\" puesto "
"en verdadero.\","

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The non-kitten item like this but with \"true\" and \"false\" switched is "
"false."
msgstr ""
"Al objeto no kitten le gusta esto pero con \"verdadero\" y \"falso\" puesto "
"en falso."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The rothe hits!  The rothe hits!"
msgstr "¡El rothe golpea! ¡El rothe golpea!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The score for a Czech composer's \"Kitten-Finding Symphony in C\"."
msgstr "La partitura del compositor checo de \"Buscando-Kitten Sinfonía en DO\"."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The spectre of Sherlock Holmes wills you onwards."
msgstr "El espectro de Sherlock Holmes te alienta a seguir."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The swampy ground around you seems to stink with disease."
msgstr "El terreno pantanoso a tu alrededor parece hundirse con enfermedades."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "There is an opulent throne here."
msgstr "Acá hay un opulento trono."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This appears to be a statue of Perseus."
msgstr "Esto parece ser una estatua de Perseo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This copy of \"Steal This Book\" has been stolen from a bookstore."
msgstr "Esta copia de \"Roba Este Libro\" ha sido robada de una librería."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This invisible box contains a pantomime horse."
msgstr "Esta caja invisible contiene un caballo de pantomima."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is a porcelain kitten-counter.  0, 0, 0, 0, 0…"
msgstr "Este es un contador de kitten de porcelana.  0, 0, 0, 0, 0…"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is a tasty-looking banana creme pie."
msgstr "Esto es una torta de crema de banana que parece muy apetitosa."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the chapter called \"A Map of the Cat?\" from Feynman's "
"autobiography.\","
msgstr ""
"Esto es un capítulo llamada \"¿Un Mapa del Gato?\" de la autobiografía de "
"Feynman.\","

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is the forest primeval."
msgstr "Este es el bosque primitivo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is the tenth key you've found so far."
msgstr "Esta es la décima llave que encontraste hasta ahora."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This jar of pickles expired in 1957."
msgstr "Este frasco de pickles venció en 1957."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This kit is the fourteenth in a series of kits named with Roman letters."
msgstr ""
"Este equipo es el decimocuarto en la serie de equipos nombrados con las "
"letras romanas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This looks like Bradley's \"Appearance and Reality\", but it's really not."
msgstr ""
"Esto parece \"Apariencia y Realidad\" de Bradley, pero en realidad no lo es."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This map is not the territory."
msgstr "Este mapa no es el territorio."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This might be the fountain of youth, but you'll never know."
msgstr "Esto podría ser la fuente de la juventud pero nunca lo vas a saber."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This non-kitten item no verb."
msgstr "Este objeto no kitten no verbo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This particular monstrosity appears to be ENIAC."
msgstr "Esta monstruosidad particular parece ser ENIAC."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This place is called Antarctica.  There is no kitten here."
msgstr "Este lugar se llama Antártida. Acá no hay kitten alguno."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This seems to be junk mail addressed to the finder of the Eye of Larn."
msgstr ""
"Esto parece ser correo basura dirigido al que encuentr el Ojo de Larn."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This tomography is like, hella axial, man!"
msgstr "¡Esta tomografía está como, bien axial, chabón!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Tigerbot Hesh."
msgstr "Tigerbot Hesh."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Vladimir Lenin's casket rests here."
msgstr "Acá están los restos del ataúd de Vladimir Lenin."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "We wish you a merry kitten, and a happy New Year!"
msgstr "¡Te deseamos una feliz kitten y un próspero año nuevo!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Werner's \"Pocket Field Guide to Things That Are Not Kitten\"."
msgstr "Es \"Guía de Campo de Bolsillo para Cosas que no son Kitten\" de Werner."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You can see right through this copy of Brin's \"Transparent Society\"."
msgstr "Podés ver a través de esta copia de \"Sociedad Transparente\" de Brin."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You disturb a murder of crows."
msgstr "Molestás a un asesino de cuervos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You feel strangely unfulfilled."
msgstr "Te sentís extrañamente insatisfecho."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You find a bright shiny penny."
msgstr "Encontrás una reluciente moneda de un centavo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find a fraud scheme in which loans are used as security for other loans."
msgstr ""
"Encontrás un plan fraudulento en el cual los préstamos son usados como "
"seguridad para otros préstamos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You found netkit!  Way to go, robot!"
msgstr "¡Encontraste a netkit! ¡Así se hace, robot!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You found nettik, but that's backwards."
msgstr "Encontraste a nettik, pero eso está al revés."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have found some zinc, but you must not stop here, for you must find "
"kitten.\","
msgstr ""
"Encontraste un poco de zinc pero no te detengas ahí, porque debés encontrar "
"a kitten.\","

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You have new mail in /var/spool/robot"
msgstr "Tenés un mail nuevo en /var/spool/robot"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You hit the non-kitten item.  The non-kitten item fails to yowl."
msgstr "Golpeás al objeto no kitten. El objeto no kitten no logra aullar."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You see a snowflake here, melting slowly."
msgstr "Ves un copo de nieve acá, derritiéndose lentamente."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You suddenly yearn for your distant homeland."
msgstr "De repente, anhelás tu distante tierra natal."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've found the snows of yesteryear!  So that's where they all went to."
msgstr "¡Encontraste las nieves de antaño! Así que ahí habían ido a parar."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You've found… Oh wait, that's just a cat."
msgstr "Encontraste… Ah, no, esperá, es un gato."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "That is a moose, a thing of pure evil.  You should \"RUN!\""
msgstr "Eso es un alce, una cosa de pura maldad. Deberías \"¡CORRER!\""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's a half-drunk 200-liter tank of pine needle tea."
msgstr "Es un tanque de 200 litros a medio tomar de té de aguja de pino."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Here is a cargo space containing a six-month supply of pemmican."
msgstr ""
"Acá hay un espacio de almacenamiento que contiene suministros de pemmican "
"por seis meses."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is a cardboard box, tragically uninhabited by any felines."
msgstr "Esto es una caja de cartón trágicamente deshabitada de todo felino."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Watch your step!  There is a board with a bunch of nails sticking up."
msgstr ""
"¡Cuidado donde pisás! Hay una tabla con un montón de clavos sobresaliendo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You count sixteen fire axes in this crate."
msgstr "Contás dieciséis hachas de bomber en esta caja."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "An assortment of high-caliber rifles in a body bag."
msgstr ""
"Hay una variedad de rifles de alto calibre en esta bolsa de cadáveres."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A muskellunge dives into the flowing deep water!"
msgstr "¡Un muscallonge se sumerge en la corriente de aguas profundas!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A duck flies over the flowing deep water!"
msgstr "¡Un pato vuela sobre la corriente de aguas profundas!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py src/activity_handlers.cpp
msgid "The corpse is thoroughly pulped."
msgid_plural "The corpses are thoroughly pulped."
msgstr[0] "El cadáver está completamente hecho puré."
msgstr[1] "Los cadáveres están completamente hechos puré."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Jackpot!  It's a toolbox, and a copy of \"Under the Hood\"."
msgstr "¡Bingo! Es una caja de herramientas y una copia de \"Bajo del Capó\"."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Looks like a fully-functional deathmobile."
msgstr "Parece uno de esos autos de la muerte completamente funcional."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A glass flask of Troglobite mutagen."
msgstr "Un frasco de vidrio con mutágeno de troglobio."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Just an ordinary pair of rollerblades."
msgstr "Es un ordinario par de rollers."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Some harmless-looking mushrooms."
msgstr "Son unos hongos que parecen inofensivos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A nest full of containers!  Or is it a container full of nests?"
msgstr "¡Un nido lleno de recipientes! ¿O es un recipiente lleno de nidos?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "These socks have storage pouches sewn into them."
msgstr "Estas medias tienen bolsas de almacenamiento cosidas en ellas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Whatever this is, it would take an extremely long time to wield."
msgstr ""
"Sea lo que sea esto, vas a tardar un tiempo excesivamente largo para "
"empuñarlo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Camouflaged in the underbrush here is the entrance to an LMOE shelter."
msgstr "Camuflada en la maleza está la entrada a un refugio LMOE."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A box of delicious toast-ems!  Sadly, you are a robot and cannot eat them."
msgstr ""
"¡Es una caja de pasteli-tostadas! Lamentablemente, sos un robot y no las "
"podés comer."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Enough ordnance to scrub the entirety of New England off the face of the "
"earth."
msgstr ""
"Suficiente artillería para limpiar completamente a New England de la faz de "
"la tierra."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Oooh look!  A mininuke (active).  Best not touch that…"
msgstr "¡Oooh, mirá! Una minibomba nuclear (activa). Mejor no tocar eso…"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not a kitten, but what appears to be a ferret eating a plate of lasagne."
msgstr ""
"No es un kitten, parece ser una comadreja comiendo un plato de lasaña."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A bunch of pies!  In a plastic box, of course."
msgstr "¡Un montón de tortas! En una caja de plástico, por supuesto."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "It's the Skeleton Costume Design Committee."
msgstr "Es el Comité de Diseño de Disfraz de Esqueleto."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is the end of the world."
msgstr "Este es el fin del mundo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "This is a model of Yugo car from 1984."
msgstr "Esto es un modelo de auto Yugo de 1984."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A wooden barrel of water."
msgstr "Un barril de madera con agua."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A box of sunflowers."
msgstr "Una caja con girasoles."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A book on what animal to eat."
msgstr "Un libro sobre qué animal comerse."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A bucket of poisonous gas."
msgstr "Un balde de gas venenoso."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A diary that proves your wife is never home."
msgstr "Un diario que prueba que tu esposa no está nunca en casa."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A jar full of Earthworms."
msgstr "Un frasco lleno de Earthworms."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A CD of Little Richard."
msgstr "Un CD de Little Richard."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A jar of fingerprints."
msgstr "Un frasco de huellas dactilares."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A lifetime supply of beef."
msgstr "Un suministro eterno de carne."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A pen that still has some ink in it."
msgstr "Una lapicera que todavía tiene un poco de tinta."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The Golden Fleece."
msgstr "El Vellocino de Oro."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Exactly 37 hot dogs."
msgstr "Son exactamente 37 panchos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The Panama Papers"
msgstr "Los Panamá Papers."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A copy of Don Quixote, slightly eaten."
msgstr "Una copia de Don Quijote, un poquito masticada."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A solid gold rocket car."
msgstr "Un auto cohete de oro sólido."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Your long lost twin's roommate."
msgstr "Tu perdido compañero de habitación de tu gemelo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A pile of very sharp cherry tree petals."
msgstr "Una pila de pétales muy filosos de cerezos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Some brass laundry tokens."
msgstr "Un poco de fichas latón para lavandería."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A plastic bin containing an assortment of spatulas."
msgstr "Un tacho plástico que contiene una variedad de espátulas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A power dongle belonging to a long-lost electronic gadget."
msgstr ""
"Es una llave electrónica que pertenecía a algún dispositivo electrónico "
"perdido hace mucho."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A potato clock that someone forgot to change for Daylight Saving Time."
msgstr ""
"Un reloj de papa al que alguien olvidó cambiarlo para el horario de verano."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Ninety-nine red balloons."
msgstr "Noventa y nueve globos rojos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A bobble-head statue of Genghis Khan winking at you."
msgstr ""
"Una estatua con la cabeza móvil de Genghis Khan que te está guiñando un ojo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Your sense of dignity."
msgstr "Tu sentido de la dignidad."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The One Paperclip, forged in the fires of Mount Doom."
msgstr "El Clip Único, forjado en los fuegos del Monte Perdición."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"That one screw you were missing to finish building an Ikea desk three years "
"ago."
msgstr ""
"Ese tornillo que no encontrabas para terminar de armar el escritorio de Ikea"
" hace tres años."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "A kitten!  No… wait, it's a turkey."
msgstr "¡Un kitten! No… esperá, es un pavo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Hey, can you hear me?"
msgstr "Hey, ¿me escuchás?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Don't touch me."
msgstr "No me toques."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "¿Cómo es tu nombre?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I thought you were my friend."
msgstr "Pensé que éramos amigos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py lang/json/talk_topic_from_json.py
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "¿Cómo te sentís hoy?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Shut up!  Don't lie to me."
msgstr "¡Callate! No me mientás."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Why would you do that?"
msgstr "¿Para qué harías eso?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Please, don't go."
msgstr "Por favor, no te vayas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Don't leave me alone!"
msgstr "¡No me dejes solo/a!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "No way, man."
msgstr "De ninguna manera, chabón."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Do you really think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad pensás eso?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Is it really time for that?"
msgstr "¿Te parece que es el momento para eso?"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Sorry, I can't hear you."
msgstr "Perdón, no te escucho."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You've told me already."
msgstr "Ya me lo dijiste."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "I know!"
msgstr "¡Ya sé!"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Why are you following me?"
