"A makeshift reinforced window with a opened curtain.  It's three sheets of "
"translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with sheets strung "
"about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Reinforced plastic window with an open curtain
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An open makeshift reinforced window with a opened curtain.  It's three "
"sheets of translucent, rigid plastic secured in a wooden frame, with sheets "
"strung about it to block the light as required.  It'll do in a pinch."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Skylight frame"
msgstr "Armazón de claraboya"

#. ~ Description for Skylight frame
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A wooden skylight frame."
msgstr "Es la armazón de madera de una claraboya."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Tempered glass window"
msgstr "Ventana de vidriado templado"

#. ~ Description for Tempered glass window
#. ~ Description for Tempered glass window open
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A giant sheet of tempered glass inserted into a window frame."
msgstr ""
"Es una lámina gigante de vidrio templado insertada en un marco de ventana."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Tempered glass window open"
msgstr "Ventana abierta de vidriado templado"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "tempered glass window with a curtain"
msgstr "ventana de vidrio templado con cortina"

#. ~ Description for tempered glass window with a curtain
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tempered window with fancy curtains on the inside that are closed to block"
" visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr ""
"Es una ventana templada con cortinas muy elegantes en la parte de adentro "
"que están cerradas para bloquear la visibilidad y la luz."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Tempered glass window with a curtain"
msgstr "Ventana de vidrio templado con cortina"

#. ~ Description for Tempered glass window with a curtain
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tempered window with fancy curtains on the inside that can be drawn closed"
" to block visibility and shut out any light."
msgstr ""
"Es una ventana templada con cortinas muy elegantes en la parte de adentro "
"que pueden cerrarse para bloquear la visibilidad y la luz."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "porthole"
msgstr "ojo de buey"

#. ~ Description for porthole
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick round window surrounded with a strong metal frame, the window is "
"sealed closed."
msgstr ""
"Es una ventana gruesa y redonda con un borde fuerte de metal. La ventana "
"está sellada."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "wooden stairs"
msgstr "escaleras de madera"

#. ~ Description for wooden stairs
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A wooden staircase leading down."
msgstr "Es una escalera de madera que lleva abajo."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "half-built wooden stairs"
msgstr "escaleras de madera a medio construir"

#. ~ Description for half-built wooden stairs
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Half of a wooden staircase.  Some work still needs to be done before this "
"staircase is complete."
msgstr ""
"Es una escalera de madera a medio construir. Necesita algún trabajo más para"
" que esta escalera esté completa."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken wooden stairs"
msgstr "escaleras rotas de madera"

#. ~ Description for broken wooden stairs
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A number of planks are missing and the structure is beginning to sag and "
"fall apart.  It's going to need quite a bit of work to repair this "
"staircase."
msgstr ""
"Le faltan algunas tablas de madera y la estructura empieza a caerse. Va a "
"ser necesario bastante trabajo para reparar esta escalera."

#. ~ Description for wooden stairs
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A wooden staircase leading up"
msgstr "Es una escalera de madera que lleva arriba."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "stairs"
msgstr "escalera"

#. ~ Description for stairs
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A flight of stairs leading down."
msgstr "Es un tramo de escalera que lleva abajo."

#. ~ Description for stairs
#. ~ Description for low stairs (beginning section)
#. ~ Description for low stairs (end section)
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A flight of stairs leading up."
msgstr "Es un tramo de escalera que lleva arriba."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "manhole"
msgstr "cámara de inspección"

#. ~ Description for manhole
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a manhole.  The heavy iron cover lies over an entrance to the "
"underworld of hidden tunnels beneath the streets where sewage and rain water"
" frolic freely."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una cámara de inspección. La pesada tapa de hierro cubre una entrada"
" al mundo subterráneo de túneles escondidos bajo las calles, donde el "
"desperdicio cloacal y el agua de lluvia corren libres."

#. ~ Description for manhole cover
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Just a manhole cover."
msgstr "Es la tapa de una cámara de inspección."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "ladder"
msgstr "escalera de mano"

#. ~ Description for ladder
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A ladder leading up."
msgstr "Es una escalera de mano para subir."

#. ~ Description for ladder
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A ladder leading down."
msgstr "Es una escalera de mano para bajar."

