"Dificultad: 3\n"
"Efectos:\n"
"> Elegir puntos específicos para trazar el camino.\n"
"> Revela terreno alrededor del camino.\n"
"> Puede pasar por escondites para extender su alcance.\n"
" \n"
"Riesgo: Alto\n"
"Tiempo: Traslado\n"
"Lugares: %d/3\n"

#: src/faction_camp.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to purge the wasteland.  Their goal is to kill anything hostile they encounter and return when their wounds are too great or the odds are stacked against them.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: 4\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Pulls creatures encountered into combat instead of fleeing.\n"
