#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"\n"
" Using the Autodoc without an operator can lead to <color_light_cyan>serious injuries</color> or <color_light_cyan>death</color>.\n"
" By continuing with the operation you accept the risks and acknowledge that you will not take any legal actions against this facility in case of an accident. "
msgstr ""
"\n"
" Usar el Autodoc sin un operador puede causar <color_light_cyan>lesiones graves</color> o <color_light_cyan>muerte</color>.\n"
" Al continuar con la operación acepta los riesgos y admite que no tomará ninguna acción legal contra estas instalaciones en caso de accidente."

